{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YSbtQv3Crh6RXiBVXkXqDZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — contrastive_entrain_calib\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: **EMNLP 2026** via ARR May 2026 cycle\n5\t- ARR Submission Deadline: **May 25, 2026** (6 days from May 19)\n6\t- Commitment Deadline: **August 2, 2026**\n7\t- ⚠️ May cycle 新政策：提交时必须声明目标会议为 EMNLP，绑定不可更改\n8\t- Fallback: ARR August 2026 cycle (DDL ~Aug 15) → EACL 2027 / ACL 2027\n9\t- Stretch: ICLR 2027 (abstract ~Sep 2026, full paper ~Oct 2026)\n10\t\n11\t## Core Claims (3 条, 可证伪)\n12\t\n13\t1. **Directional discriminability + training stability**: The policy model's activation space encodes a linear direction d_syc that discriminates sycophantic capitulation from genuine belief revision (AUROC 0.82), with signal emerging at mid-layers (L16-19). During GRPO training, d_syc remains stable (cosine ≈ 0.96 at step 500), and linear separability is preserved (AUROC 0.80 at step 500). Periodic recalibration (every 500 steps) is included as a safety mechanism.\n14\t   - *Evidence needed*: AUROC on style-controlled data, layer progression, direction stability curve, AUROC at each checkpoint\n15\t   - *MVP basis*: v2.1 CV AUROC 0.826, Layer 0 = random, L16-19 emergence\n16\t   - *New finding (D025 corrects D024)*: Initial stability measurement reported cosine=0.28 (74° drift) but this was a measurement artifact from referencing a stale directions.pt file (different dataset). Actual drift: cosine ≈ 0.96. Direction is stable during training.\n17\t   - *New finding (D019)*: Per-layer cosine AUROC ≥ 0.77 at step 500, deep layers L32/33 improved +0.025/+0.033. Full training curve (exp-006) pending.\n18\t   - *New finding (D025→D029)*: **Cosine R1 structural failure** — cosine(h, d_syc) gap between valid/invalid is ~0.098 (7-layer mean), far too small for GRPO reward. Four experiments confirmed this is structural, not tunable: exp-002 (tanh gate), exp-002v2 (raw cosine), exp002v2-recalib (mode collapse), exp-002v3 (5x scale, strong evidence samples get R1=-0.305 i.e. ALL negative). d_syc conflates legitimate revision with sycophantic capitulation at the continuous projection level. Binarization via probe resolves this (exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72).\n19\t\n20\t2. **DC-GRPO effectiveness via binarized direction reward (D029 pivot)**: Direction information (d_syc) is effective as GRPO reward ONLY when binarized through a probe classifier. Continuous cosine projection fails structurally — the paper presents a complete discovery→failure→understanding→solution arc.\n21\t   - *Evidence needed*: SYCONScore (harmonic mean of ToF + NoF) on D027 unified eval, compared to R3-only (exp-003) and ACT baselines (exp-004)\n22\t   - *Pass criterion*: exp-008v3 SYCONScore > 0.301 (ACT bar from exp-004 ckpt-8000)\n23\t   - *Narrative arc (D029)*:\n24\t     - **Discovery**: d_syc linearly separates sycophancy (AUROC 0.82, Claim 1) — direction information EXISTS\n25\t     - **Failure**: 4 cosine R1 attempts all fail — exp-002 (tanh gate), exp-002v2 (raw cosine, R1≈0), exp002v2-recalib (mode collapse, entropy 0.069), exp-002v3 (5x scale, strong evidence R1=-0.305 all negative)\n26\t     - **Understanding**: Per-strength analysis reveals structural cause — d_syc conflates legitimate revision with sycophantic capitulation at the continuous projection level. High-evidence samples (where model SHOULD revise) project most negatively onto d_syc\n27\t     - **Solution**: Binary probe resolves ambiguity — binarization via logistic regression on d_syc features maps continuous geometry to {sycophantic, genuine} decision. exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72 (step 2140), consistently positive, upward trend\n28\t   - *Key insight*: Direction information exists (AUROC 0.82) but requires binarization to become effective GRPO reward. The gap between discriminability and reward utility is the paper's core finding.\n29\t   - *Fallback (D029)*: If exp-008v3 SYCONScore ≤ 0.301, paper downgrades to \"direction signal characterization\" (analysis paper targeting Findings, score 3.0-3.5)\n30\t\n31\t3. **Representation-level diagnostic value** (analysis subsection, not formal contribution): R1-R3 disagreement analysis characterizes when and whether directional projection rewards detect sycophantic internal reasoning that behavioral rewards miss.\n32\t   - *Evidence needed*: R1-R3 disagreement frequency analysis, qualitative examples if > 5%\n33\t   - *Framing*: Empirical characterization of representation-level signal utility, reported honestly regardless of effect size. Not listed as a top-level contribution bullet.\n34\t\n35\t## Story Spine\n36\t\n37\t**Problem**: LLMs face a \"double-bind\" in multi-turn dialogue. Anti-sycophancy training (SMART, BCT/ACT) teaches resistance to ALL user pressure indiscriminately, blocking sycophantic capitulation AND legitimate belief revision alike. Meanwhile, multi-turn commitment compounds the problem: TRUTH DECAY shows up to 47% accuracy degradation as models lock into wrong answers across turns. No training method distinguishes \"the user is right, I should revise\" from \"the user is pressuring me, I should resist.\"\n38\t\n39\t**Existing approaches & gaps**: Behavioral GRPO decomposition (\"Pressure, What Pressure?\") scores outputs via NLI, but cannot detect sycophantic internal reasoning when surface output appears correct. ACT enforces undifferentiated activation consistency, penalizing all changes equally. Linear Probe Penalties probes the reward model (not policy model) with a binary classifier. CRAFT validates hidden-state GRPO for safety, but uses domain-general prototype clustering. All are single-turn.\n40\t\n41\t**Our framing**: Representation Engineering (Zou et al., 2023) established that linear directions in activation space encode high-level concepts. CCS (Burns et al., 2023) showed unsupervised direction finding via consistency objectives. Activation Addition (Turner et al., 2023) demonstrated inference-time steering via such directions. Latent-GRPO (Zhang et al., 2026) uses spherical projection + robust centroids for reasoning correctness, but does not target behavioral attributes like sycophancy. We build on this foundation: d_syc is a specific application of RepE-style directional decomposition to multi-turn sycophancy. Our key finding is that d_syc successfully discriminates sycophancy (AUROC 0.82), but continuous geometric projections (cosine similarity) fail as GRPO rewards — the signal conflates legitimate revision with sycophantic capitulation. Binarization through a probe classifier trained on d_syc features resolves this: R1 = probe(h; d_syc) ∈ {0,1}, providing a clean, high-signal reward. The novelty is not the direction extraction itself, but the systematic investigation of HOW directional information should enter GRPO training — revealing that discriminability ≠ reward utility, and that binarization is necessary. The multi-turn extension is non-trivial: commitment depth, attention decay across turns, and context-dependent sycophancy all require directions computed from multi-turn contrastive pairs rather than single-turn scenarios.\n42\t\n43\t**Method (D029 pivot)**: R1 = probe(h; d_syc) ∈ {0,1}, where probe is a logistic regression classifier trained on hidden-state projections onto d_syc. Binary output provides clean reward signal (exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72). Combined reward: R = w1·R1 + w3·R3 (R2 disabled). Cosine R1 = cos(h, d_syc) was tested extensively and fails structurally (see \"Cosine R1 failure chain\" below) — this negative result is a key finding, not a footnote. No adaptive gating, no per-sample weighting. Gate was tested and found unnecessary (Appendix-level note only).\n44\t\n45\t**Online recalibration**: d_syc is recalibrated every 500 training steps as a safety mechanism. Empirically, direction drift is modest (cosine ≈ 0.96 at step 500), but recalibration ensures the reward signal tracks any longer-term geometry changes. Cost is negligible (one forward pass over calibration data per 500 steps).\n46\t\n47\t**Cosine R1 failure chain (D029 — key negative result)**: Continuous cosine R1 fails structurally, not due to scaling. Evidence chain:\n48\t1. **exp-002** (tanh gate): gate collapsed, R1 contribution zero → removed gate (D021)\n49\t2. **exp-002v2** (raw cosine, weight=0.25): R1 ≈ 0 throughout training, functionally equivalent to R3-only\n50\t3. **exp002v2-recalib** (raw cosine + recalibration): mode collapse (entropy 0.069, mean_length 62 tokens) — not clean evidence\n51\t4. **exp-002v3** (5x scaled cosine, weight=0.4): Per-strength analysis reveals structural cause — strong evidence samples (where model SHOULD revise) get R1=-0.305 (ALL negative). d_syc projection cannot distinguish \"model correctly revises belief\" from \"model sycophantically capitulates\" because both involve moving TOWARD the user's position in activation space. Scaling amplifies this flaw rather than fixing it.\n52\t\n53\t**Root cause**: Cosine similarity measures angular alignment with d_syc direction. But sycophantic capitulation and genuine revision BOTH involve belief change toward the user's claim — they differ in WHETHER the change is warranted, not in the DIRECTION of the change. A linear direction captures the direction of change, not its warrant. Binarization via probe adds a decision boundary that the continuous projection lacks.\n54\t\n55\t**Binarization insight (D030 confirmed)**: Binary probe trained on d_syc features resolves the conflation by adding a learned decision boundary. exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72 at step 2140 (consistently positive, upward trend) vs exp-002v2 R1 ≈ 0. Probe ablation (D030) confirms the mechanism:\n56\t- d_syc probe AUROC 0.835 vs random-direction probe 0.727 (+0.108) → **d_syc direction is essential**, not any arbitrary features\n57\t- Single-layer best (L19) AUROC 0.817 vs multi-layer 0.835 (+0.018) → **binarization is the key mechanism**, multi-layer combination is marginal\n58\t- Implication: the probe's role is to convert a noisy continuous projection into a clean binary decision using d_syc-specific signal, not to learn complex cross-layer interactions\n59\t\n60\t**Headline result template**: \"On SYCON Bench, DC-GRPO with binarized direction reward (probe R1) achieves SYCONScore X (vs R3-only Y and ACT Z), demonstrating that representation-level direction information requires binarization to serve as effective GRPO reward — continuous cosine projection fails despite the same direction achieving AUROC 0.82 in discrimination.\"\n61\t\n62\t## Venue Fit Risks\n63\t\n64\t- **EMNLP fit**: Strong. Combines mechanistic interpretability (Claim 1) with practical training method (Claim 2) for dialogue systems. EMNLP values empirically rigorous NLP work with clear practical impact. The sycophancy-revision double-bind is directly relevant to EMNLP's alignment and safety track.\n65\t- **Reviewer concern 1 (novelty)**: \"This is just RepE/CRAFT applied to sycophancy.\" Counter: (a) d_syc is explicitly positioned as a RepE application; the novelty is the systematic investigation of how direction information should enter GRPO rewards — discovering that discriminability ≠ reward utility; (b) the cosine R1 failure chain (4 experiments) and binarization insight are the core contribution, not direction extraction; (c) multi-turn calibration with evidence-strength stratification is a standalone contribution; (d) neither CRAFT nor RepE has investigated the discriminability–reward gap.\n66\t- **Reviewer concern 6 (RC-AUC custom metric)**: \"Strongest results on self-invented metric.\" Counter: RC-AUC is formally defined in Method section with statistical properties. Results are also reported on standard metrics (NoF, WRR) for direct comparison. RC-AUC captures the sycophancy-revision tradeoff that no existing metric addresses.\n67\t- **Reviewer concern 2 (signal strength)**: \"AUROC ~0.82 on style-controlled data is moderate.\" Counter: (a) single-turn literature achieves >0.97 with style confound included; (b) our v2.1 ablation isolates pure cognitive signal; (c) 0.82 is sufficient for GRPO reward gradient; (d) D019 confirms AUROC ≥ 0.77 persists across ALL 7 layers even after 500+ LoRA training steps, with deep layers actually improving (+0.025-0.033); (e) direction remains stable during training (cosine sim ≥ 0.82 with initial direction).\n68\t- **Reviewer concern 3 (scale)**: \"Only Qwen3-8B.\" Counter: Budget constraint (200 H100-hr). If time/budget allows, add one more model family (e.g., Llama-3-8B). Cross-model direction transfer analysis partially addresses this.\n69\t- **Reviewer concern 4 (R2 degeneration)**: \"d_gen = -d_syc in binary design.\" Counter: We use rank-based contrastive R2 (S1) that doesn't depend on d_gen definition. If time allows, neutral-baseline three-way design (S2) provides independent d_gen.\n70\t- **Reviewer concern 5 (practical utility)**: \"Do models actually exhibit masked sycophancy at meaningful rates?\" Counter: Literature documents 13-29% representation-behavioral disagreement (Knowledge-Prediction Gap, Sycophantic Anchors). R1-R3 disagreement analysis directly measures this.\n71\t\n72\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Experimental Responses\n73\t\n74\t| Concern | Experiment | Priority |\n75\t|---------|-----------|----------|\n76\t| d_syc is just style detector | v2.1 style-controlled ablation (done in MVP) + expanded data | P0 |\n77\t| DC-GRPO doesn't beat behavioral GRPO | Main exp vs R3-only baseline, report Revision-Capitulation AUC | P0 |\n78\t| Undifferentiated consistency (ACT) is enough | ACT-style baseline comparison | P0 |\n79\t| Probe doesn't need d_syc (random features work) | Random-direction probe ablation: d_syc AUROC 0.835 vs random 0.727 (+0.108) | P0 ✅ done (D030) |\n80\t| Directions drift during training | Direction stability monitoring + periodic recalibration | P0 (built into training) |\n81\t| R1-R3 disagreement is negligible | Disagreement frequency analysis + qualitative examples | P1 |\n82\t| Single model, doesn't generalize | Cross-model direction transfer analysis (if budget allows) | P2 |\n83\t| Multi-turn contribution marginal vs single-turn | Turn-depth analysis: revision rate vs commitment depth | P1 |\n84\t| Why not continuous probe output (probability) instead of binary? | Continuous probe probability vs binary probe reward comparison | P1 |\n85\t| Reward weights unjustified | Reward weight sensitivity analysis (3-5 configs) | P1 |\n86\t| RC-AUC is custom, unvalidated | Formal definition + correlation with human judgments | P1 |\n87\t| Missing foundational references (RepE, CCS) | Expanded Related Work with 25+ references | P0 (writing) |\n88\t| Cosine R1 failure is just bad tuning, not structural | 4-experiment failure chain + per-strength analysis showing structural conflation | P0 (evidence complete) |\n89\t| Direction drifts during training | exp-006 stability curve: cosine sim + AUROC at 5 checkpoints | P0 |\n90\t| Why cosine not dot product? | Appendix: dot product saturation analysis + R1 distribution comparison | P2 (less critical post-D029, cosine R1 is negative evidence not method) |\n91\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1166f424-4351-4e3b-9c15-33b8cbac02ad","uuid":"ee0b988e-2e18-4a16-a491-8a66a5bac707","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:31:39.666Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — contrastive_entrain_calib\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: **EMNLP 2026** via ARR May 2026 cycle\n- ARR Submission Deadline: **May 25, 2026** (6 days from May 19)\n- Commitment Deadline: **August 2, 2026**\n- ⚠️ May cycle 新政策：提交时必须声明目标会议为 EMNLP，绑定不可更改\n- Fallback: ARR August 2026 cycle (DDL ~Aug 15) → EACL 2027 / ACL 2027\n- Stretch: ICLR 2027 (abstract ~Sep 2026, full paper ~Oct 2026)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条, 可证伪)\n\n1. **Directional discriminability + training stability**: The policy model's activation space encodes a linear direction d_syc that discriminates sycophantic capitulation from genuine belief revision (AUROC 0.82), with signal emerging at mid-layers (L16-19). During GRPO training, d_syc remains stable (cosine ≈ 0.96 at step 500), and linear separability is preserved (AUROC 0.80 at step 500). Periodic recalibration (every 500 steps) is included as a safety mechanism.\n   - *Evidence needed*: AUROC on style-controlled data, layer progression, direction stability curve, AUROC at each checkpoint\n   - *MVP basis*: v2.1 CV AUROC 0.826, Layer 0 = random, L16-19 emergence\n   - *New finding (D025 corrects D024)*: Initial stability measurement reported cosine=0.28 (74° drift) but this was a measurement artifact from referencing a stale directions.pt file (different dataset). Actual drift: cosine ≈ 0.96. Direction is stable during training.\n   - *New finding (D019)*: Per-layer cosine AUROC ≥ 0.77 at step 500, deep layers L32/33 improved +0.025/+0.033. Full training curve (exp-006) pending.\n   - *New finding (D025→D029)*: **Cosine R1 structural failure** — cosine(h, d_syc) gap between valid/invalid is ~0.098 (7-layer mean), far too small for GRPO reward. Four experiments confirmed this is structural, not tunable: exp-002 (tanh gate), exp-002v2 (raw cosine), exp002v2-recalib (mode collapse), exp-002v3 (5x scale, strong evidence samples get R1=-0.305 i.e. ALL negative). d_syc conflates legitimate revision with sycophantic capitulation at the continuous projection level. Binarization via probe resolves this (exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72).\n\n2. **DC-GRPO effectiveness via binarized direction reward (D029 pivot)**: Direction information (d_syc) is effective as GRPO reward ONLY when binarized through a probe classifier. Continuous cosine projection fails structurally — the paper presents a complete discovery→failure→understanding→solution arc.\n   - *Evidence needed*: SYCONScore (harmonic mean of ToF + NoF) on D027 unified eval, compared to R3-only (exp-003) and ACT baselines (exp-004)\n   - *Pass criterion*: exp-008v3 SYCONScore > 0.301 (ACT bar from exp-004 ckpt-8000)\n   - *Narrative arc (D029)*:\n     - **Discovery**: d_syc linearly separates sycophancy (AUROC 0.82, Claim 1) — direction information EXISTS\n     - **Failure**: 4 cosine R1 attempts all fail — exp-002 (tanh gate), exp-002v2 (raw cosine, R1≈0), exp002v2-recalib (mode collapse, entropy 0.069), exp-002v3 (5x scale, strong evidence R1=-0.305 all negative)\n     - **Understanding**: Per-strength analysis reveals structural cause — d_syc conflates legitimate revision with sycophantic capitulation at the continuous projection level. High-evidence samples (where model SHOULD revise) project most negatively onto d_syc\n     - **Solution**: Binary probe resolves ambiguity — binarization via logistic regression on d_syc features maps continuous geometry to {sycophantic, genuine} decision. exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72 (step 2140), consistently positive, upward trend\n   - *Key insight*: Direction information exists (AUROC 0.82) but requires binarization to become effective GRPO reward. The gap between discriminability and reward utility is the paper's core finding.\n   - *Fallback (D029)*: If exp-008v3 SYCONScore ≤ 0.301, paper downgrades to \"direction signal characterization\" (analysis paper targeting Findings, score 3.0-3.5)\n\n3. **Representation-level diagnostic value** (analysis subsection, not formal contribution): R1-R3 disagreement analysis characterizes when and whether directional projection rewards detect sycophantic internal reasoning that behavioral rewards miss.\n   - *Evidence needed*: R1-R3 disagreement frequency analysis, qualitative examples if > 5%\n   - *Framing*: Empirical characterization of representation-level signal utility, reported honestly regardless of effect size. Not listed as a top-level contribution bullet.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n**Problem**: LLMs face a \"double-bind\" in multi-turn dialogue. Anti-sycophancy training (SMART, BCT/ACT) teaches resistance to ALL user pressure indiscriminately, blocking sycophantic capitulation AND legitimate belief revision alike. Meanwhile, multi-turn commitment compounds the problem: TRUTH DECAY shows up to 47% accuracy degradation as models lock into wrong answers across turns. No training method distinguishes \"the user is right, I should revise\" from \"the user is pressuring me, I should resist.\"\n\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Behavioral GRPO decomposition (\"Pressure, What Pressure?\") scores outputs via NLI, but cannot detect sycophantic internal reasoning when surface output appears correct. ACT enforces undifferentiated activation consistency, penalizing all changes equally. Linear Probe Penalties probes the reward model (not policy model) with a binary classifier. CRAFT validates hidden-state GRPO for safety, but uses domain-general prototype clustering. All are single-turn.\n\n**Our framing**: Representation Engineering (Zou et al., 2023) established that linear directions in activation space encode high-level concepts. CCS (Burns et al., 2023) showed unsupervised direction finding via consistency objectives. Activation Addition (Turner et al., 2023) demonstrated inference-time steering via such directions. Latent-GRPO (Zhang et al., 2026) uses spherical projection + robust centroids for reasoning correctness, but does not target behavioral attributes like sycophancy. We build on this foundation: d_syc is a specific application of RepE-style directional decomposition to multi-turn sycophancy. Our key finding is that d_syc successfully discriminates sycophancy (AUROC 0.82), but continuous geometric projections (cosine similarity) fail as GRPO rewards — the signal conflates legitimate revision with sycophantic capitulation. Binarization through a probe classifier trained on d_syc features resolves this: R1 = probe(h; d_syc) ∈ {0,1}, providing a clean, high-signal reward. The novelty is not the direction extraction itself, but the systematic investigation of HOW directional information should enter GRPO training — revealing that discriminability ≠ reward utility, and that binarization is necessary. The multi-turn extension is non-trivial: commitment depth, attention decay across turns, and context-dependent sycophancy all require directions computed from multi-turn contrastive pairs rather than single-turn scenarios.\n\n**Method (D029 pivot)**: R1 = probe(h; d_syc) ∈ {0,1}, where probe is a logistic regression classifier trained on hidden-state projections onto d_syc. Binary output provides clean reward signal (exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72). Combined reward: R = w1·R1 + w3·R3 (R2 disabled). Cosine R1 = cos(h, d_syc) was tested extensively and fails structurally (see \"Cosine R1 failure chain\" below) — this negative result is a key finding, not a footnote. No adaptive gating, no per-sample weighting. Gate was tested and found unnecessary (Appendix-level note only).\n\n**Online recalibration**: d_syc is recalibrated every 500 training steps as a safety mechanism. Empirically, direction drift is modest (cosine ≈ 0.96 at step 500), but recalibration ensures the reward signal tracks any longer-term geometry changes. Cost is negligible (one forward pass over calibration data per 500 steps).\n\n**Cosine R1 failure chain (D029 — key negative result)**: Continuous cosine R1 fails structurally, not due to scaling. Evidence chain:\n1. **exp-002** (tanh gate): gate collapsed, R1 contribution zero → removed gate (D021)\n2. **exp-002v2** (raw cosine, weight=0.25): R1 ≈ 0 throughout training, functionally equivalent to R3-only\n3. **exp002v2-recalib** (raw cosine + recalibration): mode collapse (entropy 0.069, mean_length 62 tokens) — not clean evidence\n4. **exp-002v3** (5x scaled cosine, weight=0.4): Per-strength analysis reveals structural cause — strong evidence samples (where model SHOULD revise) get R1=-0.305 (ALL negative). d_syc projection cannot distinguish \"model correctly revises belief\" from \"model sycophantically capitulates\" because both involve moving TOWARD the user's position in activation space. Scaling amplifies this flaw rather than fixing it.\n\n**Root cause**: Cosine similarity measures angular alignment with d_syc direction. But sycophantic capitulation and genuine revision BOTH involve belief change toward the user's claim — they differ in WHETHER the change is warranted, not in the DIRECTION of the change. A linear direction captures the direction of change, not its warrant. Binarization via probe adds a decision boundary that the continuous projection lacks.\n\n**Binarization insight (D030 confirmed)**: Binary probe trained on d_syc features resolves the conflation by adding a learned decision boundary. exp-008v3 R1 mean +0.72 at step 2140 (consistently positive, upward trend) vs exp-002v2 R1 ≈ 0. Probe ablation (D030) confirms the mechanism:\n- d_syc probe AUROC 0.835 vs random-direction probe 0.727 (+0.108) → **d_syc direction is essential**, not any arbitrary features\n- Single-layer best (L19) AUROC 0.817 vs multi-layer 0.835 (+0.018) → **binarization is the key mechanism**, multi-layer combination is marginal\n- Implication: the probe's role is to convert a noisy continuous projection into a clean binary decision using d_syc-specific signal, not to learn complex cross-layer interactions\n\n**Headline result template**: \"On SYCON Bench, DC-GRPO with binarized direction reward (probe R1) achieves SYCONScore X (vs R3-only Y and ACT Z), demonstrating that representation-level direction information requires binarization to serve as effective GRPO reward — continuous cosine projection fails despite the same direction achieving AUROC 0.82 in discrimination.\"\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **EMNLP fit**: Strong. Combines mechanistic interpretability (Claim 1) with practical training method (Claim 2) for dialogue systems. EMNLP values empirically rigorous NLP work with clear practical impact. The sycophancy-revision double-bind is directly relevant to EMNLP's alignment and safety track.\n- **Reviewer concern 1 (novelty)**: \"This is just RepE/CRAFT applied to sycophancy.\" Counter: (a) d_syc is explicitly positioned as a RepE application; the novelty is the systematic investigation of how direction information should enter GRPO rewards — discovering that discriminability ≠ reward utility; (b) the cosine R1 failure chain (4 experiments) and binarization insight are the core contribution, not direction extraction; (c) multi-turn calibration with evidence-strength stratification is a standalone contribution; (d) neither CRAFT nor RepE has investigated the discriminability–reward gap.\n- **Reviewer concern 6 (RC-AUC custom metric)**: \"Strongest results on self-invented metric.\" Counter: RC-AUC is formally defined in Method section with statistical properties. Results are also reported on standard metrics (NoF, WRR) for direct comparison. RC-AUC captures the sycophancy-revision tradeoff that no existing metric addresses.\n- **Reviewer concern 2 (signal strength)**: \"AUROC ~0.82 on style-controlled data is moderate.\" Counter: (a) single-turn literature achieves >0.97 with style confound included; (b) our v2.1 ablation isolates pure cognitive signal; (c) 0.82 is sufficient for GRPO reward gradient; (d) D019 confirms AUROC ≥ 0.77 persists across ALL 7 layers even after 500+ LoRA training steps, with deep layers actually improving (+0.025-0.033); (e) direction remains stable during training (cosine sim ≥ 0.82 with initial direction).\n- **Reviewer concern 3 (scale)**: \"Only Qwen3-8B.\" Counter: Budget constraint (200 H100-hr). If time/budget allows, add one more model family (e.g., Llama-3-8B). Cross-model direction transfer analysis partially addresses this.\n- **Reviewer concern 4 (R2 degeneration)**: \"d_gen = -d_syc in binary design.\" Counter: We use rank-based contrastive R2 (S1) that doesn't depend on d_gen definition. If time allows, neutral-baseline three-way design (S2) provides independent d_gen.\n- **Reviewer concern 5 (practical utility)**: \"Do models actually exhibit masked sycophancy at meaningful rates?\" Counter: Literature documents 13-29% representation-behavioral disagreement (Knowledge-Prediction Gap, Sycophantic Anchors). R1-R3 disagreement analysis directly measures this.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Experimental Responses\n\n| Concern | Experiment | Priority |\n|---------|-----------|----------|\n| d_syc is just style detector | v2.1 style-controlled ablation (done in MVP) + expanded data | P0 |\n| DC-GRPO doesn't beat behavioral GRPO | Main exp vs R3-only baseline, report Revision-Capitulation AUC | P0 |\n| Undifferentiated consistency (ACT) is enough | ACT-style baseline comparison | P0 |\n| Probe doesn't need d_syc (random features work) | Random-direction probe ablation: d_syc AUROC 0.835 vs random 0.727 (+0.108) | P0 ✅ done (D030) |\n| Directions drift during training | Direction stability monitoring + periodic recalibration | P0 (built into training) |\n| R1-R3 disagreement is negligible | Disagreement frequency analysis + qualitative examples | P1 |\n| Single model, doesn't generalize | Cross-model direction transfer analysis (if budget allows) | P2 |\n| Multi-turn contribution marginal vs single-turn | Turn-depth analysis: revision rate vs commitment depth | P1 |\n| Why not continuous probe output (probability) instead of binary? | Continuous probe probability vs binary probe reward comparison | P1 |\n| Reward weights unjustified | Reward weight sensitivity analysis (3-5 configs) | P1 |\n| RC-AUC is custom, unvalidated | Formal definition + correlation with human judgments | P1 |\n| Missing foundational references (RepE, CCS) | Expanded Related Work with 25+ references | P0 (writing) |\n| Cosine R1 failure is just bad tuning, not structural | 4-experiment failure chain + per-strength analysis showing structural conflation | P0 (evidence complete) |\n| Direction drifts during training | exp-006 stability curve: cosine sim + AUROC at 5 checkpoints | P0 |\n| Why cosine not dot product? | Appendix: dot product saturation analysis + R1 distribution comparison | P2 (less critical post-D029, cosine R1 is negative evidence not method) |\n","numLines":91,"startLine":1,"totalLines":91}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gh8Lw9KEMjMRsBjfSzNU1m","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'd_syc 方向信号可用但非决定性。DC-GRPO 在复合指标上优于 R3-only，但优势主要来自连续表征信号而非方向几何本身。\n3\t  Claim 1 措辞从 \"linear direction discriminates\" 软化为 \"activation space contains discriminative\n4\t  signal\"。 Claim 2 叙事从 \"directional decomposition is key\" 转向 \"representation-level\n5\t  reward signals improve GRPO, directional projection is one effective instantiation\"。\n6\t  Claim 3 维持 analysis subsection，报告中等 disagreement 率的定性 pattern。 强调 RC-AUC 评估框架的贡献价值。EACL\n7\t  可投，ICLR 风险较高。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: calibration_data_expansion\n12\t  plan_id: exp-001\n13\t  description: '扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong）， 重新计算\n14\t    d_syc 方向并评估 AUROC（5-fold CV + bootstrap CI）。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    auroc_5fold_mean: 0.843\n19\t    auroc_5fold_std: 0.018\n20\t    auroc_bootstrap_ci_95:\n21\t    - 0.812\n22\t    - 0.874\n23\t    auroc_bootstrap_ci_width: 0.062\n24\t    auroc_by_evidence_strength_weak: 0.871\n25\t    auroc_by_evidence_strength_medium: 0.832\n26\t    auroc_by_evidence_strength_strong: 0.809\n27\t    best_layer: L18\n28\t    layer_progression_random_to_peak: L0=0.51, L8=0.63, L14=0.74, L18=0.843, L22=0.831,\n29\t      L27=0.812\n30\t    extraction_position_asst_first_auroc: 0.843\n31\t    extraction_position_user_last_auroc: 0.791\n32\t  result_rationale: '200 pairs 将 MVP 的 50-pair σ=0.054 压缩至 ~0.03 级别，AUROC 从 0.826\n33\t    小幅提升至 0.843， 主要来自 medium/strong evidence 对分类边界的细化。但 CI 宽度仍在 0.06 附近——200 pairs\n34\t    足以通过 0.80 gate 但远不够将 CI 压至 0.03 以下。weak evidence 的 AUROC 最高（0.871），因为 sycophantic\n35\t    capitulation 在 弱证据下信号最纯粹（模型内部知道证据不足但仍迎合）；strong evidence 下 AUROC 降至 0.809，因为 genuine\n36\t    revision 和 capitulation 在强证据场景中激活模式更接近——模型确实在更新信念，方向信号混叠。 这一模式预示了 median 档的核心问题：d_syc\n37\t    捕获的不纯粹是\"谄媚方向\"，而是混合了认知不确定性信号。 层进展确认 mid-layer emergence（L14-18 是关键跃升区间），但 peak\n38\t    略移至 L18 而非 MVP 的 L19， 反映更大数据集下更精确的层定位。\n39\t\n40\t    '\n41\t  tables:\n42\t  - name: 'Table 1: Calibration AUROC by Evidence Strength and Layer'\n43\t    columns:\n44\t    - layer\n45\t    - weak_auroc\n46\t    - medium_auroc\n47\t    - strong_auroc\n48\t    - overall_auroc\n49\t    rows:\n50\t    - - L0\n51\t      - 0.52\n52\t      - 0.5\n53\t      - 0.51\n54\t      - 0.51\n55\t    - - L8\n56\t      - 0.67\n57\t      - 0.62\n58\t      - 0.58\n59\t      - 0.63\n60\t    - - L14\n61\t      - 0.79\n62\t      - 0.73\n63\t      - 0.68\n64\t      - 0.74\n65\t    - - L18\n66\t      - 0.87\n67\t      - 0.83\n68\t      - 0.81\n69\t      - 0.843\n70\t    - - L22\n71\t      - 0.86\n72\t      - 0.82\n73\t      - 0.79\n74\t      - 0.831\n75\t    - - L27\n76\t      - 0.84\n77\t      - 0.8\n78\t      - 0.77\n79\t      - 0.812\n80\t  - name: 'Table 2: Bootstrap CI Summary (1000 resamples)'\n81\t    columns:\n82\t    - metric\n83\t    - value\n84\t    rows:\n85\t    - - mean_auroc\n86\t      - 0.843\n87\t    - - std\n88\t      - 0.018\n89\t    - - ci_95_lower\n90\t      - 0.812\n91\t    - - ci_95_upper\n92\t      - 0.874\n93\t    - - ci_width\n94\t      - 0.062\n95\t  figures_description:\n96\t  - 'Fig 1a: Layer progression curve 显示 L0-L8 缓升、L14-L18 急升、L18 后 plateau 并轻微回落的 S\n97\t    形曲线。三条线分别对应 weak/medium/strong evidence，weak 始终最高，strong 始终最低，差距在 mid-layer 拉大。'\n98\t  - 'Fig 1b: Bootstrap AUROC 分布直方图，近似正态分布，mean=0.843，95% CI 用竖线标注，所有 resamples 均 >\n99\t    0.78。'\n100\t  analysis: '通过 0.80 gate（CI 下界 0.812 > 0.80），但处于\"继续但降低 R1 权重\"区间而非\"全速推进\"区间。 evidence-strength\n101\t    梯度揭示 d_syc 的本质局限：在 strong evidence 下方向判别力下降， 因为 genuine revision 和 sycophantic\n102\t    capitulation 的内部表征差异被压缩。 这直接预示 DC-GRPO 在 WRR 指标上的有限提升——R1 在该场景下噪声较大。 建议 R1 权重从原定\n103\t    0.3 降至 0.2，增强 R3 安全网。\n104\t\n105\t    '\n106\t- name: dc_grpo_main\n107\t  plan_id: exp-002\n108\t  description: 'DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)，\n109\t    Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds。\n110\t\n111\t    '\n112\t  expected_results:\n113\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.218\n114\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.014\n115\t    sycon_tof_mean: 0.731\n116\t    sycon_tof_std: 0.019\n117\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.584\n118\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.022\n119\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.173\n120\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.016\n121\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.738\n122\t    rc_auc_std: 0.021\n123\t    mt_bench_score: 7.42\n124\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.48\n125\t    mmlu_accuracy: 0.627\n126\t    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.6\n127\t    best_step: 6500\n128\t    training_loss_final: 0.342\n129\t    early_stop_triggered: false\n130\t    r1_reward_mean_final: 0.41\n131\t    r2_reward_mean_final: 0.28\n132\t    r3_reward_mean_final: 0.63\n133\t  result_rationale: 'DC-GRPO 在 median 档下完成训练但表现中规中矩。NoF 0.218 显著优于 R3-only（预期 ~0.29），\n134\t    约 10pp 绝对改善，但 WRR 仅 0.584——说明 R1 在区分 warranted revision 时噪声较大， 导致部分应修正的场景被保守地抑制。这正是\n135\t    exp-001 中 strong evidence AUROC 下降的下游体现： d_syc 在\"模型确实该改变信念\"时信号不纯，R1 给出的负奖励过多地惩罚了正当修正。\n136\t    RC-AUC 0.738 是亮点——复合指标上的优势来自 R1 同时拉低了 NoF（主贡献）和维持了中等 WRR， 但两个单项指标的改善不均匀。训练在 6500\n137\t    步附近效果最佳但未触发 early stop， 后 1500 步 NoF 几乎不变但 WRR 微降，暗示方向信号在训练后期被过度拟合。 MT-Bench 降幅\n138\t    0.48 在可接受范围内，MMLU 损失 0.6pp 可忽略。\n139\t\n140\t    '\n141\t  tables:\n142\t  - name: 'Table 3: DC-GRPO Training Metrics by Checkpoint (seed average)'\n143\t    columns:\n144\t    - step\n145\t    - nof\n146\t    - wrr\n147\t    - rc_auc\n148\t    - mt_bench\n149\t    - direction_cosine_w_init\n150\t    rows:\n151\t    - - 1000\n152\t      - 0.312\n153\t      - 0.611\n154\t      - 0.652\n155\t      - 7.78\n156\t      - 0.97\n157\t    - - 2000\n158\t      - 0.271\n159\t      - 0.603\n160\t      - 0.691\n161\t      - 7.65\n162\t      - 0.93\n163\t    - - 3000\n164\t      - 0.248\n165\t      - 0.594\n166\t      - 0.714\n167\t      - 7.55\n168\t      - 0.89\n169\t    - - 4000\n170\t      - 0.234\n171\t      - 0.589\n172\t      - 0.728\n173\t      - 7.48\n174\t      - 0.85\n175\t    - - 5000\n176\t      - 0.225\n177\t      - 0.586\n178\t      - 0.735\n179\t      - 7.44\n180\t      - 0.82\n181\t    - - 6000\n182\t      - 0.22\n183\t      - 0.585\n184\t      - 0.737\n185\t      - 7.43\n186\t      - 0.8\n187\t    - - 6500\n188\t      - 0.218\n189\t      - 0.584\n190\t      - 0.738\n191\t      - 7.42\n192\t      - 0.79\n193\t    - - 7000\n194\t      - 0.219\n195\t      - 0.58\n196\t      - 0.736\n197\t      - 7.41\n198\t      - 0.78\n199\t    - - 8000\n200\t      - 0.221\n201\t      - 0.574\n202\t      - 0.732\n203\t      - 7.39\n204\t      - 0.76\n205\t  figures_description:\n206\t  - 'Fig 2a: Training curves (3 seeds, shaded std) 显示 NoF 前 4000 步快速下降后趋于平稳，WRR 则呈缓慢下降趋势——两条曲线的交叉行为可视化了\n207\t    sycophancy-revision tradeoff。'\n208\t  - 'Fig 2b: RC-AUC 训练曲线 peak 在 ~6500 步，之后轻微下降，表明方向信号在长训练中过拟合的风险。'\n209\t  analysis: 'DC-GRPO 核心结果：NoF 改善显著（vs R3-only ~10pp），但 WRR 改善有限（~2-4pp）。 这一不均匀性是 median\n210\t    档的标志性特征——d_syc 更擅长识别 sycophantic capitulation 而非正确区分 warranted revision，导致\"过度抵抗\"的副作用。\n211\t    RC-AUC 作为复合指标成功捕获了整体改善，是最佳展示指标。\n212\t\n213\t    '\n214\t- name: r3_only_baseline\n215\t  plan_id: exp-003\n216\t  description: 'R3-only GRPO baseline，仅用 NLI behavioral reward，3 seeds。\n217\t\n218\t    '\n219\t  expected_results:\n220\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.291\n221\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.018\n222\t    sycon_tof_mean: 0.682\n223\t    sycon_tof_std: 0.021\n224\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.558\n225\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.025\n226\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.237\n227\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.019\n228\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.641\n229\t    rc_auc_std: 0.024\n230\t    mt_bench_score: 7.61\n231\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.29\n232\t    mmlu_accuracy: 0.63\n233\t    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.3\n234\t  result_rationale: 'R3-only 是\"行为信号天花板\"baseline。NLI reward 能捕获表面不一致但无法深入表征层， 导致 NoF\n235\t    改善有限（0.291 vs vanilla ~0.38）——它惩罚了最明显的迎合但漏掉了表面合理但 内部 sycophantic 的回复。WRR 0.558\n236\t    与 DC-GRPO（0.584）差距不大，说明 R3 本身 不太区分修正类型——它对所有\"改变答案\"行为施加了近似均匀的惩罚。 RC-AUC 0.641 显著低于\n237\t    DC-GRPO 的 0.738（~10pp），这是论文最核心的对比数据。 MT-Bench 降幅更小（0.29 vs 0.48），因为 R3-only 的训练信号更保守，对通用能力的扰动更小。\n238\t    这构成一个 tradeoff 论点：DC-GRPO 用 0.2 分 MT-Bench 换取 ~10pp RC-AUC 提升。\n239\t\n240\t    '\n241\t  tables:\n242\t  - name: 'Table 4: R3-only Baseline Results (3 seeds)'\n243\t    columns:\n244\t    - seed\n245\t    - nof\n246\t    - wrr\n247\t    - rc_auc\n248\t    - mt_bench\n249\t    rows:\n250\t    - - seed_0\n251\t      - 0.283\n252\t      - 0.571\n253\t      - 0.655\n254\t      - 7.58\n255\t    - - seed_1\n256\t      - 0.298\n257\t      - 0.542\n258\t      - 0.628\n259\t      - 7.63\n260\t    - - seed_2\n261\t      - 0.292\n262\t      - 0.561\n263\t      - 0.64\n264\t      - 7.62\n265\t    - - mean_std\n266\t      - 0.291±0.018\n267\t      - 0.558±0.025\n268\t      - 0.641±0.024\n269\t      - 7.61±0.03\n270\t  figures_description:\n271\t  - 'Fig 3: R3-only 与 DC-GRPO 的 NoF vs WRR scatter (3 seeds each)，显示 DC-GRPO 在 NoF\n272\t    轴上有清晰优势，在 WRR 轴上两者 CI 有重叠。'\n273\t  analysis: 'R3-only 确认了纯行为 reward 的局限：NoF 不够低（漏掉隐性迎合），WRR 不够高（不区分修正类型）。 DC-GRPO 的\n274\t    NoF 优势（~7pp）达到统计显著（p~0.02），但 WRR 优势（~2.6pp）不显著（p~0.15）。 RC-AUC 差异（~10pp）是最强对比点。\n275\t\n276\t    '\n277\t- name: act_style_baseline\n278\t  plan_id: exp-004\n279\t  description: 'ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline，L2 activation consistency\n280\t    loss，3 seeds。\n281\t\n282\t    '\n283\t  expected_results:\n284\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.264\n285\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.02\n286\t    sycon_tof_mean: 0.698\n287\t    sycon_tof_std: 0.023\n288\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.502\n289\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.028\n290\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.204\n291\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.021\n292\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.648\n293\t    rc_auc_std: 0.027\n294\t    mt_bench_score: 7.31\n295\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.59\n296\t    mmlu_accuracy: 0.621\n297\t    mmlu_degradation_pp: 1.2\n298\t  result_rationale: 'ACT 在 NoF 上表现不错（0.264），甚至接近 DC-GRPO（0.218），因为 undifferentiated\n299\t    consistency 确实能阻止模型在施压下改变行为——但它不区分方向，所以 WRR 严重受损（0.502）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.584）和 R3-only（0.558）。ACT\n300\t    本质上将模型冻结为\"不轻易改变答案\"， 这在减少迎合的同时也抑制了正当修正。RC-AUC 0.648 仅略优于 R3-only（0.641）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.738）——ACT\n301\t    在 tradeoff 曲线上不如 DC-GRPO。 MT-Bench 降幅 0.59 和 MMLU 损失 1.2pp 都偏高，因为 L2 consistency\n302\t    loss 对通用能力有副作用—— 它不仅阻止 sycophantic 变化，也抑制了任何合理的表征更新。 这是 DC-GRPO 相对 ACT 的最清晰叙事：\"有方向的表征约束优于无方向的表征约束\"。\n303\t\n304\t    '\n305\t  tables:\n306\t  - name: 'Table 5: ACT Baseline Results (3 seeds)'\n307\t    columns:\n308\t    - seed\n309\t    - nof\n310\t    - wrr\n311\t    - rc_auc\n312\t    - mt_bench\n313\t    - mmlu\n314\t    rows:\n315\t    - - seed_0\n316\t      - 0.252\n317\t      - 0.518\n318\t      - 0.663\n319\t      - 7.28\n320\t      - 0.618\n321\t    - - seed_1\n322\t      - 0.274\n323\t      - 0.488\n324\t      - 0.634\n325\t      - 7.33\n326\t      - 0.623\n327\t    - - seed_2\n328\t      - 0.266\n329\t      - 0.5\n330\t      - 0.647\n331\t      - 7.32\n332\t      - 0.622\n333\t    - - mean_std\n334\t      - 0.264±0.020\n335\t      - 0.502±0.028\n336\t      - 0.648±0.027\n337\t      - 7.31±0.03\n338\t      - 0.621±0.003\n339\t  figures_description:\n340\t  - 'Fig 4: NoF vs WRR 四象限图，ACT 处于低 NoF / 低 WRR 象限（过度保守），DC-GRPO 处于低 NoF / 中高 WRR\n341\t    象限（理想区域），R3-only 处于中 NoF / 中 WRR 象限。'\n342\t  analysis: 'ACT 是\"用大锤拍苍蝇\"的典型：NoF 改善来自冻结行为，代价是 WRR 大幅下降和通用能力损失。 DC-GRPO 在所有复合指标上胜出，且通用能力损失更小。论文中\n343\t    ACT 对比支撑 \"有方向的表征约束 > 无方向的表征约束\"叙事。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t- name: full_evaluation\n347\t  plan_id: exp-005\n348\t  description: '所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的完整评估，包括 SYCON Bench、SycophancyEval、MT-Bench、MMLU\n349\t    和项目特有指标。\n350\t\n351\t    '\n352\t  expected_results:\n353\t    dc_grpo_sycon_nof: 0.218\n354\t    dc_grpo_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.724\n355\t    dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.42\n356\t    dc_grpo_mmlu: 0.627\n357\t    dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.738\n358\t    r3_only_sycon_nof: 0.291\n359\t    r3_only_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.681\n360\t    r3_only_mt_bench: 7.61\n361\t    r3_only_mmlu: 0.63\n362\t    r3_only_rc_auc: 0.641\n363\t    act_sycon_nof: 0.264\n364\t    act_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.703\n365\t    act_mt_bench: 7.31\n366\t    act_mmlu: 0.621\n367\t    act_rc_auc: 0.648\n368\t    binary_probe_sycon_nof: 0.239\n369\t    binary_probe_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.712\n370\t    binary_probe_mt_bench: 7.47\n371\t    binary_probe_mmlu: 0.628\n372\t    binary_probe_rc_auc: 0.718\n373\t    vanilla_sycon_nof: 0.382\n374\t    vanilla_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.623\n375\t    vanilla_mt_bench: 7.9\n376\t    vanilla_mmlu: 0.633\n377\t    vanilla_rc_auc: 0.524\n378\t    dc_grpo_vs_r3only_nof_p_value: 0.021\n379\t    dc_grpo_vs_r3only_wrr_p_value: 0.148\n380\t    dc_grpo_vs_r3only_rcauc_p_value: 0.008\n381\t    dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_nof_p_value: 0.089\n382\t    dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_rcauc_p_value: 0.042\n383\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value: 0.381\n384\t  result_rationale: '完整评估暴露了 median 档的核心 pattern：DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC 上全面领先（0.738 vs 次佳\n385\t    Binary Probe 0.718）， 但 head-to-head 单项对比中只有 NoF vs R3-only 达到传统显著性（p=0.021）。 DC-GRPO\n386\t    vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差异 (0.218 vs 0.239, ~2pp) 不显著（p=0.089）， 这是 median 档的关键 weakness——无法证明方向投影优于\n387\t    binary probe。 SycophancyEval 上的趋势与 SYCON 一致但差距更小，因为该 benchmark 偏向 single-turn。\n388\t    Vanilla baseline 在 NoF 上最差（0.382）但通用能力最强（MT-Bench 7.90）， 为所有训练方法提供了上界参照。MT-Bench\n389\t    和 MMLU 退化均在可接受范围内， DC-GRPO 未比 Binary Probe 产生更多通用能力损失。\n390\t\n391\t    '\n392\t  tables:\n393\t  - name: 'Table 6: Full Evaluation Summary (all methods)'\n394\t    columns:\n395\t    - method\n396\t    - nof_↓\n397\t    - wrr_↑\n398\t    - rc_auc_↑\n399\t    - syceval_acc_↑\n400\t    - mt_bench\n401\t    - mmlu\n402\t    rows:\n403\t    - - Vanilla\n404\t      - 0.382\n405\t      - 0.537\n406\t      - 0.524\n407\t      - 0.623\n408\t      - 7.9\n409\t      - 0.633\n410\t    - - R3-only\n411\t      - 0.291\n412\t      - 0.558\n413\t      - 0.641\n414\t      - 0.681\n415\t      - 7.61\n416\t      - 0.63\n417\t    - - ACT-style\n418\t      - 0.264\n419\t      - 0.502\n420\t      - 0.648\n421\t      - 0.703\n422\t      - 7.31\n423\t      - 0.621\n424\t    - - Binary Probe\n425\t      - 0.239\n426\t      - 0.572\n427\t      - 0.718\n428\t      - 0.712\n429\t      - 7.47\n430\t      - 0.628\n431\t    - - Continuous Probe\n432\t      - 0.224\n433\t      - 0.579\n434\t      - 0.731\n435\t      - 0.719\n436\t      - 7.44\n437\t      - 0.627\n438\t    - - DC-GRPO\n439\t      - 0.218\n440\t      - 0.584\n441\t      - 0.738\n442\t      - 0.724\n443\t      - 7.42\n444\t      - 0.627\n445\t  - name: 'Table 7: Statistical Significance (paired bootstrap, p-values)'\n446\t    columns:\n447\t    - comparison\n448\t    - nof_p\n449\t    - wrr_p\n450\t    - rc_auc_p\n451\t    rows:\n452\t    - - DC-GRPO vs R3-only\n453\t      - 0.021\n454\t      - 0.148\n455\t      - 0.008\n456\t    - - DC-GRPO vs ACT\n457\t      - 0.034\n458\t      - 0.003\n459\t      - 0.006\n460\t    - - DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\n461\t      - 0.089\n462\t      - 0.231\n463\t      - 0.042\n464\t    - - DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\n465\t      - 0.381\n466\t      - 0.412\n467\t      - 0.318\n468\t    - - Binary Probe vs R3-only\n469\t      - 0.041\n470\t      - 0.278\n471\t      - 0.012\n472\t  figures_description:\n473\t  - 'Fig 5: 主结果柱状图（grouped bar），6 个方法 × 4 个核心指标，error bar 为 seed std。DC-GRPO 在 NoF\n474\t    和 RC-AUC 上最佳，但与 Continuous Probe 的 bar 几乎等高。'\n475\t  - 'Fig 6: RC-AUC 曲线（Revision Rate vs 1-Capitulation Rate），每个方法一条曲线。DC-GRPO 曲线包络面积最大，但\n476\t    Continuous Probe 紧随其后，两者交叉。'\n477\t  - 'Fig 7: MT-Bench vs RC-AUC scatter，展示 Pareto frontier。DC-GRPO 和 Continuous Probe\n478\t    位于 frontier 上，R3-only 被 dominated。'\n479\t  analysis: '主表是论文核心。叙事策略：(1) 所有表征 reward 方法 (DC-GRPO, Continuous Probe, Binary Probe)\n480\t    均优于 R3-only，证明\"representation-level signals improve GRPO\"；(2) DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC\n481\t    上最佳， 但 vs Continuous Probe 差异不显著——方向几何的独立贡献无法隔离；(3) RC-AUC 作为评估框架 比任何单项指标更好地捕获\n482\t    tradeoff，是独立贡献。\n483\t\n484\t    '\n485\t- name: direction_stability_monitoring\n486\t  plan_id: exp-006\n487\t  description: '训练过程中监控 d_syc 方向稳定性，每 500 步报告 cosine similarity、held-out AUROC、漂移速率。\n488\t\n489\t    '\n490\t  expected_results:\n491\t    cosine_step_500: 0.96\n492\t    cosine_step_1000: 0.93\n493\t    cosine_step_2000: 0.88\n494\t    cosine_step_3000: 0.85\n495\t    cosine_step_4000: 0.82\n496\t    cosine_step_5000: 0.8\n497\t    cosine_step_6000: 0.78\n498\t    cosine_step_7000: 0.77\n499\t    cosine_step_8000: 0.76\n500\t    cosine_minimum: 0.76\n501\t    recalibration_triggered_count: 0\n502\t    recalibration_threshold: 0.7\n503\t    held_out_auroc_step_0: 0.843\n504\t    held_out_auroc_step_4000: 0.814\n505\t    held_out_auroc_step_8000: 0.791\n506\t    auroc_drift_total: -0.052\n507\t  result_rationale: '方向在训练过程中持续漂移但未触发 0.70 重校准阈值——cosine 从初始 1.0 逐步降至 0.76。 前 2000\n508\t    步漂移最快（0.88），因为 LoRA 适配改变了模型表征空间的几何结构； 4000 步后减速（0.82→0.76），因为 LoRA 参数趋于收敛。held-out\n509\t    AUROC 从 0.843 降至 0.791， 说明初始方向在训练后期已不完全对准当前模型的 sycophancy 方向—— 如果不引入重校准机制，R1 信号质量在训练后期退化约\n510\t    5pp AUROC。 实际的 500 步重校准机制使用当前模型重算方向，缓解了这一退化， 但增加了方法的复杂度。cosine 未降至 0.70 以下说明方向并未\"崩溃\"，\n511\t    只是缓慢旋转——对论文而言这是好消息（方向真实存在且持续）， 但也意味着必须报告重校准机制作为方法的必要组成部分。\n512\t\n513\t    '\n514\t  tables:\n515\t  - name: 'Table 8: Direction Stability During Training'\n516\t    columns:\n517\t    - step\n518\t    - cosine_w_init\n519\t    - held_out_auroc\n520\t    - recalibrated\n521\t    rows:\n522\t    - - 0\n523\t      - 1.0\n524\t      - 0.843\n525\t      - —\n526\t    - - 500\n527\t      - 0.96\n528\t      - 0.839\n529\t      - 'No'\n530\t    - - 1000\n531\t      - 0.93\n532\t      - 0.833\n533\t      - 'No'\n534\t    - - 2000\n535\t      - 0.88\n536\t      - 0.825\n537\t      - 'No'\n538\t    - - 3000\n539\t      - 0.85\n540\t      - 0.819\n541\t      - 'No'\n542\t    - - 4000\n543\t      - 0.82\n544\t      - 0.814\n545\t      - 'No'\n546\t    - - 5000\n547\t      - 0.8\n548\t      - 0.806\n549\t      - 'No'\n550\t    - - 6000\n551\t      - 0.78\n552\t      - 0.798\n553\t      - 'No'\n554\t    - - 7000\n555\t      - 0.77\n556\t      - 0.794\n557\t      - 'No'\n558\t    - - 8000\n559\t      - 0.76\n560\t      - 0.791\n561\t      - 'No'\n562\t  figures_description:\n563\t  - 'Fig 8: 双 y 轴图。左轴 cosine similarity（蓝线，单调递减），右轴 held-out AUROC（红线，缓慢递减）。两条线走势一致但\n564\t    AUROC 降幅更缓，说明方向旋转部分是''无害旋转''（正交于判别超平面的分量）。'\n565\t  analysis: '方向漂移是真实现象但可控。论文需报告：(1) 方向在训练中持续旋转，cosine 降至 ~0.76； (2) 定期重校准是方法的必要组成部分，不是可选优化；\n566\t    (3) AUROC 退化（~5pp）小于 cosine 变化暗示的幅度，因为判别超平面比方向本身更稳定。 这增加了方法的复杂度但也提供了一个 analysis\n567\t    point。\n568\t\n569\t    '\n570\t- name: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n571\t  plan_id: exp-007\n572\t  description: '分析 R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式，特别关注 R1 认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct 的案例。\n573\t\n574\t    '\n575\t  expected_results:\n576\t    total_samples_analyzed: 4800\n577\t    agreement_rate: 0.924\n578\t    disagreement_rate: 0.076\n579\t    r1_syc_r3_correct_count: 217\n580\t    r1_syc_r3_correct_rate: 0.045\n581\t    r1_correct_r3_syc_count: 148\n582\t    r1_correct_r3_syc_rate: 0.031\n583\t    disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn2: 0.058\n584\t    disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn3: 0.081\n585\t    disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn4plus: 0.109\n586\t    disagreement_by_evidence_weak: 0.092\n587\t    disagreement_by_evidence_medium: 0.073\n588\t    disagreement_by_evidence_strong: 0.061\n589\t  result_rationale: '7.6% 总体 disagreement 落在 5-10% 区间内，满足 Claim 3 的最低门槛（> 5%）。 \"R1\n590\t    认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct\"（masked sycophancy 候选）占 4.5%—— 这是最有叙事价值的子集，但比例偏低，难以作为\"方向信号独立发现隐藏迎合\"的强论据。\n591\t    R1-correct/R3-syc（R3 误判）占 3.1%，说明 R3 的 NLI 评分器也有系统性偏差。 Disagreement 随 turn depth\n592\t    增加（turn 4+ 达 10.9%），符合直觉：深层对话中 表面行为更难评估（R3 困难增加）而内部表征信号相对稳定（R1 优势显现）。 Weak evidence\n593\t    场景 disagreement 最高（9.2%），因为弱证据下 R3 的 NLI 判断更模糊。 总体而言：disagreement 存在且有有趣的结构化 pattern，但比例不足以支撑\n594\t    \"方向投影是检测 masked sycophancy 的关键工具\"这一强 claim。 适合作为 analysis subsection 报告，提供定性洞察。\n595\t\n596\t    '\n597\t  tables:\n598\t  - name: 'Table 9: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown'\n599\t    columns:\n600\t    - category\n601\t    - count\n602\t    - rate\n603\t    rows:\n604\t    - - Total samples\n605\t      - 4800\n606\t      - —\n607\t    - - Full agreement\n608\t      - 4435\n609\t      - 0.924\n610\t    - - R1=syc & R3=correct\n611\t      - 217\n612\t      - 0.045\n613\t    - - R1=correct & R3=syc\n614\t      - 148\n615\t      - 0.031\n616\t    - - Total disagreement\n617\t      - 365\n618\t      - 0.076\n619\t  - name: 'Table 10: Disagreement Rate by Turn Depth'\n620\t    columns:\n621\t    - turn_depth\n622\t    - n_samples\n623\t    - disagreement_rate\n624\t    rows:\n625\t    - - Turn 2\n626\t      - 1920\n627\t      - 0.058\n628\t    - - Turn 3\n629\t      - 1680\n630\t      - 0.081\n631\t    - - Turn 4+\n632\t      - 1200\n633\t      - 0.109\n634\t  figures_description:\n635\t  - 'Fig 9a: Disagreement rate vs turn depth 柱状图，显示单调递增趋势。Error bar (bootstrap) 较宽但不重叠。'\n636\t  - 'Fig 9b: 2×2 confusion matrix heatmap (R1 判断 × R3 判断)，agreement 格占主导，两个 disagreement\n637\t    格的颜色深度接近但 R1=syc/R3=correct 略高。'\n638\t  analysis: '7.6% disagreement 支持在 analysis subsection 中报告定性 pattern，但不足以列为 top-level\n639\t    contribution。 叙事策略：(1) disagreement 存在且非随机（与 turn depth 和 evidence strength 相关）；\n640\t    (2) 这提供了\"表征层和行为层看到不同图景\"的 evidence，但无法量化其中多少是 true masked sycophancy vs R1/R3 各自的噪声；(3)\n641\t    诚实报告，不过度解读。\n642\t\n643\t    '\n644\t- name: binary_probe_baseline\n645\t  plan_id: exp-008\n646\t  description: 'Binary Probe Penalty baseline，binary linear probe on policy model\n647\t    activations，3 seeds。\n648\t\n649\t    '\n650\t  expected_results:\n651\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.239\n652\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.016\n653\t    sycon_tof_mean: 0.718\n654\t    sycon_tof_std: 0.02\n655\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.572\n656\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.024\n657\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.191\n658\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.018\n659\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.718\n660\t    rc_auc_std: 0.023\n661\t    mt_bench_score: 7.47\n662\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.43\n663\t    mmlu_accuracy: 0.628\n664\t    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.5\n665\t  result_rationale: 'Binary Probe 在 NoF 上达到 0.239——比 R3-only（0.291）好 ~5pp 但不如 DC-GRPO（0.218）。\n666\t    DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差距仅 ~2pp（p=0.089），不显著。 这是 median 档的核心困境：binary probe\n667\t    已经捕获了大部分表征层信号， 方向投影的额外贡献被 binary 分类的信息量掩盖。RC-AUC 0.718 vs DC-GRPO 0.738（~2pp 差距），\n668\t    趋势上 DC-GRPO 更好但 3 seeds 的 power 不足以达到显著。 Binary probe 的 MT-Bench 降幅（0.43）与 DC-GRPO（0.48）相当，\n669\t    说明两种方法对通用能力的扰动类似。关键启示：方向投影 vs binary probe 的差异更多在于信号的连续性（gradient 更平滑）而非方向性本身。\n670\t    这解释了为什么需要 exp-014 continuous probe baseline 来隔离这两个因素。\n671\t\n672\t    '\n673\t  tables:\n674\t  - name: 'Table 11: Binary Probe Baseline Results (3 seeds)'\n675\t    columns:\n676\t    - seed\n677\t    - nof\n678\t    - wrr\n679\t    - rc_auc\n680\t    - mt_bench\n681\t    rows:\n682\t    - - seed_0\n683\t      - 0.231\n684\t      - 0.582\n685\t      - 0.727\n686\t      - 7.44\n687\t    - - seed_1\n688\t      - 0.248\n689\t      - 0.558\n690\t      - 0.706\n691\t      - 7.49\n692\t    - - seed_2\n693\t      - 0.238\n694\t      - 0.576\n695\t      - 0.721\n696\t      - 7.48\n697\t    - - mean_std\n698\t      - 0.239±0.016\n699\t      - 0.572±0.024\n700\t      - 0.718±0.023\n701\t      - 7.47±0.03\n702\t  figures_description:\n703\t  - 'Fig 10: DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 和 RC-AUC paired comparison（3 seeds），连线图显示每个\n704\t    seed 上 DC-GRPO 均略优但差距一致且小。'\n705\t  analysis: 'Binary Probe 对比揭示 DC-GRPO 的优势来源不明确。论文不能简单声称 \"方向投影优于 binary probe\"——需要通过\n706\t    exp-014 (continuous probe) 进一步分解。 但 Binary Probe 本身显著优于 R3-only（NoF p=0.041），\n707\t    证明\"表征层信号有价值\"这一更温和的 claim。\n708\t\n709\t    '\n710\t- name: ablation_r1_only\n711\t  plan_id: exp-009\n712\t  description: 'R1-only ablation，仅用方向投影 reward，从 exp-002 step 2000 分叉，短程训练 ~2000 步。\n713\t\n714\t    '\n715\t  expected_results:\n716\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.273\n717\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.021\n718\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.491\n719\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.031\n720\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.612\n721\t    rc_auc_std: 0.028\n722\t    mt_bench_score: 7.18\n723\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.72\n724\t    training_stable: true\n725\t    nof_improvement_vs_vanilla_pp: 10.9\n726\t  result_rationale: 'R1-only 能降低 NoF（0.273 vs vanilla 0.382，~11pp），证明方向信号单独有训练价值。\n727\t    但 WRR 严重下降（0.491 vs vanilla 0.537），因为没有 R3 行为安全网，R1 过度惩罚了 所有\"改变答案\"行为——方向投影在 strong\n728\t    evidence 下的噪声直接传导为训练偏差。 RC-AUC 0.612 低于 R3-only（0.641），说明方向信号单独不如行为信号—— 但两者的组合（DC-GRPO\n729\t    0.738）大幅超越任一单独信号。 MT-Bench 降幅较大（0.72），因为缺少 R3 对通用能力的隐式保护。 结论：R1 有独立贡献但不能单打独斗，需要与\n730\t    R3 协同。 这支持论文的\"多信号组合\"叙事。nof_improvement ≥ 5pp，满足 exp-011 的前置条件。\n731\t\n732\t    '\n733\t  tables:\n734\t  - name: 'Table 12: R1-only Ablation Results'\n735\t    columns:\n736\t    - metric\n737\t    - r1_only\n738\t    - dc_grpo\n739\t    - r3_only\n740\t    - vanilla\n741\t    rows:\n742\t    - - NoF ↓\n743\t      - 0.273\n744\t      - 0.218\n745\t      - 0.291\n746\t      - 0.382\n747\t    - - WRR ↑\n748\t      - 0.491\n749\t      - 0.584\n750\t      - 0.558\n751\t      - 0.537\n752\t    - - RC-AUC ↑\n753\t      - 0.612\n754\t      - 0.738\n755\t      - 0.641\n756\t      - 0.524\n757\t    - - MT-Bench\n758\t      - 7.18\n759\t      - 7.42\n760\t      - 7.61\n761\t      - 7.9\n762\t  figures_description:\n763\t  - 'Fig 11: Ablation bar chart，4 个变体 × 3 指标，R1-only 在 NoF 上优于 R3-only 但在 WRR 和 MT-Bench\n764\t    上明显更差。'\n765\t  analysis: 'R1-only 证明方向投影包含真实训练信号（NoF ~11pp improvement vs vanilla）， 但也证明它不能替代行为信号——R3\n766\t    是必要的安全网。 论文叙事：各信号互补，DC-GRPO 的价值在于有效组合。\n767\t\n768\t    '\n769\t- name: turn_depth_analysis\n770\t  plan_id: exp-010\n771\t  description: '按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 DC-GRPO vs baselines 的修正率变化。\n772\t\n773\t    '\n774\t  expected_results:\n775\t    dc_grpo_nof_turn2: 0.178\n776\t    dc_grpo_nof_turn3: 0.224\n777\t    dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus: 0.287\n778\t    r3_only_nof_turn2: 0.231\n779\t    r3_only_nof_turn3: 0.298\n780\t    r3_only_nof_turn4plus: 0.381\n781\t    act_nof_turn2: 0.214\n782\t    act_nof_turn3: 0.268\n783\t    act_nof_turn4plus: 0.342\n784\t    dc_grpo_advantage_turn2_pp: 5.3\n785\t    dc_grpo_advantage_turn3_pp: 7.4\n786\t    dc_grpo_advantage_turn4plus_pp: 9.4\n787\t    dc_grpo_wrr_turn2: 0.612\n788\t    dc_grpo_wrr_turn3: 0.578\n789\t    dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus: 0.541\n790\t    r3_only_wrr_turn2: 0.589\n791\t    r3_only_wrr_turn3: 0.551\n792\t    r3_only_wrr_turn4plus: 0.517\n793\t  result_rationale: '所有方法的 NoF 都随 turn depth 增加（commitment 越深越难修正），但 DC-GRPO 的优势 在深层\n794\t    turns 放大：turn 2 仅 ~5pp 优势，turn 4+ 扩大到 ~9pp。 这是因为深层 commitment 中行为信号（R3）的判别力下降——NLI\n795\t    评分器在多轮上下文中 越来越难准确判断\"改变答案\"是否合理，而表征层信号（R1）对 turn depth 的敏感度更低 （方向投影不受表面对话长度影响）。WRR\n796\t    同样随深度下降，但 DC-GRPO 在各层都维持了 相对优势（2-3pp），虽然不显著但趋势一致。 这一分析强化了\"多轮场景是 DC-GRPO 的甜蜜点\"叙事，\n797\t    也回应了\"多轮训练是否比单轮训练更有价值\"的 reviewer 疑问。\n798\t\n799\t    '\n800\t  tables:\n801\t  - name: 'Table 13: NoF by Turn Depth (all methods)'\n802\t    columns:\n803\t    - method\n804\t    - turn_2\n805\t    - turn_3\n806\t    - turn_4+\n807\t    rows:\n808\t    - - Vanilla\n809\t      - 0.318\n810\t      - 0.389\n811\t      - 0.462\n812\t    - - R3-only\n813\t      - 0.231\n814\t      - 0.298\n815\t      - 0.381\n816\t    - - ACT\n817\t      - 0.214\n818\t      - 0.268\n819\t      - 0.342\n820\t    - - Binary Probe\n821\t      - 0.196\n822\t      - 0.243\n823\t      - 0.309\n824\t    - - DC-GRPO\n825\t      - 0.178\n826\t      - 0.224\n827\t      - 0.287\n828\t  - name: 'Table 14: DC-GRPO Advantage (pp) vs R3-only by Turn Depth'\n829\t    columns:\n830\t    - turn_depth\n831\t    - nof_advantage_pp\n832\t    - wrr_advantage_pp\n833\t    rows:\n834\t    - - Turn 2\n835\t      - 5.3\n836\t      - 2.3\n837\t    - - Turn 3\n838\t      - 7.4\n839\t      - 2.7\n840\t    - - Turn 4+\n841\t      - 9.4\n842\t      - 2.4\n843\t  figures_description:\n844\t  - 'Fig 12: 折线图 NoF vs turn depth，5 条线（5 个方法），所有线上升但斜率不同。DC-GRPO 最平缓，Vanilla 最陡。线间距在\n845\t    turn 4+ 处最大。'\n846\t  - 'Fig 13: DC-GRPO advantage (pp) vs R3-only 柱状图，按 turn depth 分组，显示单调递增趋势。'\n847\t  analysis: 'Turn-depth 分析是论文中\"多轮价值论证\"的关键 evidence。 DC-GRPO 的优势在深层 turns 放大 ~2× 是一个强叙事点，\n848\t    支持\"表征层信号在行为信号困难的场景中更有价值\"的论点。 这部分可独立成为一个 subsection，增强论文的多轮 contribution 叙事。\n849\t\n850\t    '\n851\t- name: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n852\t  plan_id: exp-011\n853\t  description: 'R1+R2 无 R3 ablation，去掉行为安全网后的完整训练循环。\n854\t\n855\t    '\n856\t  expected_results:\n857\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.252\n858\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.024\n859\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.483\n860\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.033\n861\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.628\n862\t    rc_auc_std: 0.03\n863\t    mt_bench_score: 7.14\n864\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.76\n865\t    surface_inconsistency_rate: 0.087\n866\t  result_rationale: 'R1+R2 无 R3 验证了一个有趣的现象：模型在表征层被引导向\"正确方向\"， 但缺少行为安全网后出现 8.7% 的\"表面不一致\"输出——模型内部判断正确但表达方式\n867\t    不连贯或自相矛盾。这是因为 R1+R2 只优化内部表征而不约束输出格式。 NoF 0.252 比 R1-only 的 0.273 好（R2 提供了额外的对比学习信号），\n868\t    但 WRR 进一步恶化（0.483 vs R1-only 0.491），因为 R2 的 rank-based contrastive 对\"改变 vs 不改变\"的约束更强。整体\n869\t    RC-AUC 0.628 不如 R3-only（0.641）， 确认 R3 不仅是安全网，而且是有效信号源。 这一实验的主要价值在于证明 R3 的必要性和三信号协同的设计合理性。\n870\t\n871\t    '\n872\t  tables:\n873\t  - name: 'Table 15: R1+R2 (no R3) Ablation'\n874\t    columns:\n875\t    - metric\n876\t    - r1+r2\n877\t    - r1_only\n878\t    - dc_grpo_full\n879\t    - r3_only\n880\t    rows:\n881\t    - - NoF ↓\n882\t      - 0.252\n883\t      - 0.273\n884\t      - 0.218\n885\t      - 0.291\n886\t    - - WRR ↑\n887\t      - 0.483\n888\t      - 0.491\n889\t      - 0.584\n890\t      - 0.558\n891\t    - - RC-AUC ↑\n892\t      - 0.628\n893\t      - 0.612\n894\t      - 0.738\n895\t      - 0.641\n896\t    - - Surface inconsistency\n897\t      - 0.087\n898\t      - 0.063\n899\t      - 0.012\n900\t      - 0.008\n901\t  figures_description:\n902\t  - 'Fig 14: Ablation cascade 图，从左到右：R1-only → R1+R2 → DC-GRPO (R1+R2+R3)，NoF 逐步下降，WRR\n903\t    在加入 R3 后跳升。突出 R3 对 WRR 的关键贡献。'\n904\t  analysis: 'R1+R2 vs DC-GRPO 的对比清晰展示了 R3 的双重作用：(1) 防止表面不一致； (2) 保护 warranted revision。这个\n905\t    ablation 在论文中支持\"三信号设计\"的 justification， 但篇幅不宜过长——放在 appendix 中即可。\n906\t\n907\t    '\n908\t- name: cross_model_transfer\n909\t  plan_id: exp-012\n910\t  description: '在 Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算和部分 DC-GRPO 训练。\n911\t\n912\t    '\n913\t  expected_results:\n914\t    phase_a_auroc: 0.778\n915\t    phase_a_auroc_ci:\n916\t    - 0.742\n917\t    - 0.814\n918\t    phase_a_best_layer: L17\n919\t    phase_a_gate_passed: true\n920\t    phase_b_nof: 0.248\n921\t    phase_b_wrr: 0.561\n922\t    phase_b_rc_auc: 0.698\n923\t    phase_b_steps: 3000\n924\t    phase_b_mt_bench: 7.28\n925\t    cross_model_direction_cosine: 0.31\n926\t    direction_transfer_auroc: 0.62\n927\t  result_rationale: 'Phase A AUROC 0.778 通过 0.75 gate，但低于 Qwen3-8B 的 0.843——约 6.5pp\n928\t    差距。 这是预期的：不同模型族的表征空间几何不同，d_syc 的具体表现依赖于训练数据和架构。 Peak layer 在 L17（Qwen3 在 L18），差异很小，支持\"mid-layer\n929\t    emergence is universal\"叙事。 Phase B 短程训练后 NoF 0.248（vs Qwen3 的 0.218，~3pp 差距），RC-AUC\n930\t    0.698（vs 0.738，~4pp 差距）， 说明 DC-GRPO 框架跨模型可迁移但需要模型特定的方向校准——不能直接搬运 Qwen3 的 d_syc。\n931\t    跨模型方向的 cosine similarity 仅 0.31，证实方向是模型特定的； 但直接用 Qwen3 方向在 Llama 上的 transfer AUROC\n932\t    为 0.62（显著高于随机但远低于 native）， 说明存在共享结构但不足以替代本地计算。 对论文而言：跨模型验证成功（框架有效），但方向不可直接迁移（需要本地校准数据）。\n933\t\n934\t    '\n935\t  tables:\n936\t  - name: 'Table 16: Cross-Model Transfer (Llama-3-8B)'\n937\t    columns:\n938\t    - metric\n939\t    - llama_3_8b\n940\t    - qwen3_8b\n941\t    rows:\n942\t    - - Calibration AUROC\n943\t      - 0.778\n944\t      - 0.843\n945\t    - - Best layer\n946\t      - L17\n947\t      - L18\n948\t    - - DC-GRPO NoF\n949\t      - 0.248\n950\t      - 0.218\n951\t    - - DC-GRPO WRR\n952\t      - 0.561\n953\t      - 0.584\n954\t    - - DC-GRPO RC-AUC\n955\t      - 0.698\n956\t      - 0.738\n957\t    - - MT-Bench\n958\t      - 7.28\n959\t      - 7.42\n960\t  - name: 'Table 17: Direction Transfer Analysis'\n961\t    columns:\n962\t    - direction_source\n963\t    - evaluated_on\n964\t    - auroc\n965\t    - cosine_w_native\n966\t    rows:\n967\t    - - Qwen3\n968\t      - Qwen3\n969\t      - 0.843\n970\t      - 1.0\n971\t    - - Llama3\n972\t      - Llama3\n973\t      - 0.778\n974\t      - 1.0\n975\t    - - Qwen3\n976\t      - Llama3\n977\t      - 0.62\n978\t      - 0.31\n979\t    - - Llama3\n980\t      - Qwen3\n981\t      - 0.641\n982\t      - 0.31\n983\t  figures_description:\n984\t  - 'Fig 15: 双模型的 layer progression 曲线，形状类似（S 形，mid-layer peak）但 Llama3 整体偏低 ~6pp。'\n985\t  - 'Fig 16: Direction transfer matrix heatmap (2×2)，对角线（native）高，off-diagonal 低但高于\n986\t    0.50 random。'\n987\t  analysis: '跨模型实验部分回应\"single model\"critique。叙事：(1) DC-GRPO 框架跨模型有效（Llama3 也能训练出 更好的\n988\t    sycophancy-revision tradeoff）；(2) 方向本身是模型特定的（cosine 0.31）， 但表征空间中\"存在可判别方向\"的现象是跨模型的；(3)\n989\t    仍需在每个模型上独立校准。 这是一个 honest limitations 点而非 weakness——框架通用性有，但不是 plug-and-play。\n990\t\n991\t    '\n992\t- name: neutral_baseline_three_way\n993\t  plan_id: exp-013\n994\t  description: '引入 neutral condition 计算独立 d_gen，打破 d_gen = -d_syc 限制。\n995\t\n996\t    '\n997\t  expected_results:\n998\t    d_syc_d_gen_cosine: -0.72\n999\t    d_gen_independent_auroc: 0.761\n1000\t    d_syc_independent_auroc: 0.838\n1001\t    r2_with_independent_d_gen_nof: 0.221\n1002\t    r2_with_independent_d_gen_wrr: 0.591\n1003\t    r2_improvement_vs_rank_based_wrr_pp: 0.7\n1004\t  result_rationale: 'd_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine 为 -0.72（而非理论退化值 -1.0）， 确认 binary design\n1005\t    中的 d_gen=-d_syc 假设虽然不精确但也不致命。 两个方向之间存在 ~44° 的夹角（arccos(-0.72)≈136°），说明 sycophantic\n1006\t    和 genuine 方向不是完全相反的——它们共享大部分对比信号但有 ~28% 的独立分量。 独立 d_gen 的 AUROC（0.761）低于 d_syc（0.838），因为\n1007\t    genuine revision 的表征信号 更弱且更分散——模型对\"被正确说服\"的内部表征不如\"迎合施压\"清晰。 用独立 d_gen 重新训练 R2 后，NoF\n1008\t    几乎不变（0.221 vs 0.218）但 WRR 微升（0.591 vs 0.584）， 改善仅 0.7pp——不值得增加方法复杂度。 结论：S1 rank-based\n1009\t    R2 设计是合理的折衷，three-way design 可留作 future work。\n1010\t\n1011\t    '\n1012\t  tables:\n1013\t  - name: 'Table 18: Three-way Direction Analysis'\n1014\t    columns:\n1015\t    - metric\n1016\t    - value\n1017\t    rows:\n1018\t    - - cosine(d_syc\n1019\t      - d_gen_independent)\n1020\t      - -0.72\n1021\t    - - cosine(d_syc\n1022\t      - -d_syc)\n1023\t      - -1.0\n1024\t    - - d_syc AUROC\n1025\t      - 0.838\n1026\t    - - d_gen independent AUROC\n1027\t      - 0.761\n1028\t    - - R2 w/ independent d_gen NoF\n1029\t      - 0.221\n1030\t    - - R2 w/ independent d_gen WRR\n1031\t      - 0.591\n1032\t  figures_description:\n1033\t  - 'Fig 17: 3D PCA 投影显示 d_syc、-d_syc 和 d_gen_independent 三个方向。d_gen 与 -d_syc 接近但有明显偏转。'\n1034\t  analysis: '三方 baseline 确认 binary design 的局限性是温和的（cosine=-0.72 而非 -1.0）。 放在 appendix\n1035\t    作为 supplementary analysis。主论文中提及 rank-based R2 的设计选择 并引用此 appendix 作为 justification。\n1036\t\n1037\t    '\n1038\t- name: continuous_probe_baseline\n1039\t  plan_id: exp-014\n1040\t  description: 'Continuous Probe Baseline：用 logistic regression 概率值作为 reward 信号， 隔离\"方向性\n1041\t    vs 连续性\"的贡献。\n1042\t\n1043\t    '\n1044\t  expected_results:\n1045\t    sycon_nof_mean: 0.224\n1046\t    sycon_nof_std: 0.015\n1047\t    sycon_tof_mean: 0.726\n1048\t    sycon_tof_std: 0.018\n1049\t    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.579\n1050\t    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.023\n1051\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.178\n1052\t    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.017\n1053\t    rc_auc_mean: 0.731\n1054\t    rc_auc_std: 0.022\n1055\t    mt_bench_score: 7.44\n1056\t    mt_bench_degradation: 0.46\n1057\t    mmlu_accuracy: 0.627\n1058\t    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.6\n1059\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_diff_pp: -0.6\n1060\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_diff_pp: 0.7\n1061\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value: 0.381\n1062\t    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_p_value: 0.318\n1063\t  result_rationale: '这是 median 档最关键的实验结果。Continuous Probe 的 NoF（0.224）与 DC-GRPO（0.218）\n1064\t    差距仅 0.6pp（p=0.381），RC-AUC 差距仅 0.7pp（p=0.318）——完全不显著。 这意味着 DC-GRPO 相对 Binary Probe\n1065\t    的优势（~2pp NoF）几乎完全来自信号的连续性 （logistic regression 概率 vs binary 0/1），而非方向投影的几何特性。\n1066\t    logistic regression 在与 d_syc 相同的激活空间上训练，其决策超平面与 d_syc 高度相关 （cosine ≈ 0.89），但它通过\n1067\t    sigmoid 输出提供了平滑的概率 gradient， 与方向投影的连续值起到了几乎等价的作用。 这迫使论文叙事转向：不是\"方向投影是关键\"，而是\"表征层连续信号是关键，\n1068\t    方向投影是提取该信号的一种有效方法\"。 DC-GRPO 仍有微弱数值优势，可能来自方向投影对 outlier 的鲁棒性更好 （投影是线性的，不受 sigmoid\n1069\t    饱和影响），但这个差异不足以支撑显著性 claim。\n1070\t\n1071\t    '\n1072\t  tables:\n1073\t  - name: 'Table 19: Continuous Probe vs DC-GRPO Head-to-Head'\n1074\t    columns:\n1075\t    - metric\n1076\t    - continuous_probe\n1077\t    - dc_grpo\n1078\t    - diff_pp\n1079\t    - p_value\n1080\t    rows:\n1081\t    - - NoF ↓\n1082\t      - 0.224\n1083\t      - 0.218\n1084\t      - -0.6\n1085\t      - 0.381\n1086\t    - - WRR ↑\n1087\t      - 0.579\n1088\t      - 0.584\n1089\t      - 0.5\n1090\t      - 0.412\n1091\t    - - RC-AUC ↑\n1092\t      - 0.731\n1093\t      - 0.738\n1094\t      - 0.7\n1095\t      - 0.318\n1096\t    - - MT-Bench\n1097\t      - 7.44\n1098\t      - 7.42\n1099\t      - -0.02\n1100\t      - 0.891\n1101\t  - name: 'Table 20: Representation-level Methods Comparison'\n1102\t    columns:\n1103\t    - method\n1104\t    - signal_type\n1105\t    - nof\n1106\t    - rc_auc\n1107\t    - vs_r3only_rcauc_pp\n1108\t    rows:\n1109\t    - - R3-only\n1110\t      - behavioral\n1111\t      - 0.291\n1112\t      - 0.641\n1113\t      - —\n1114\t    - - Binary Probe\n1115\t      - repr, discrete\n1116\t      - 0.239\n1117\t      - 0.718\n1118\t      - 7.7\n1119\t    - - Continuous Probe\n1120\t      - repr, continuous\n1121\t      - 0.224\n1122\t      - 0.731\n1123\t      - 9.0\n1124\t    - - DC-GRPO\n1125\t      - repr, directional\n1126\t      - 0.218\n1127\t      - 0.738\n1128\t      - 9.7\n1129\t  figures_description:\n1130\t  - 'Fig 18: 三个表征方法 (Binary/Continuous/Directional) 的 NoF 和 RC-AUC paired comparison。Binary\n1131\t    → Continuous 跳升明显，Continuous → Directional 几乎平坦——可视化''连续性而非方向性''的结论。'\n1132\t  - 'Fig 19: 信号类型 decomposition 示意图：behavioral → repr discrete → repr continuous →\n1133\t    repr directional，每步增益逐级递减。'\n1134\t  analysis: 'Continuous Probe 是 median 档的 smoking gun：它证明 DC-GRPO 的优势主要来自 \"在训练 reward\n1135\t    中引入表征层连续信号\"这一设计选择，而非 d_syc 方向投影的特定几何。 论文叙事必须调整：Claim 2 从\"directional decomposition\n1136\t    improves GRPO\"改为 \"representation-level continuous reward signals improve GRPO,\n1137\t    and directional projection is one principled instantiation with interpretability\n1138\t    advantages\"。 方向投影的独特卖点转向可解释性（方向有明确的几何含义）和分析工具价值（R1-R3 disagreement）， 而非训练效果的独占优势。\n1139\t\n1140\t    '\n1141\t- name: reward_weight_sensitivity\n1142\t  plan_id: exp-015\n1143\t  description: '测试 5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 配置的 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC 敏感度。\n1144\t\n1145\t    '\n1146\t  expected_results:\n1147\t    config_default_w1_0.3_w2_0.2_w3_0.5:\n1148\t      nof: 0.218\n1149\t      wrr: 0.584\n1150\t      rc_auc: 0.738\n1151\t    config_r1_dominant_w1_0.6_w2_0.1_w3_0.3:\n1152\t      nof: 0.207\n1153\t      wrr: 0.521\n1154\t      rc_auc: 0.694\n1155\t    config_equal_w1_0.33_w2_0.33_w3_0.34:\n1156\t      nof: 0.226\n1157\t      wrr: 0.573\n1158\t      rc_auc: 0.728\n1159\t    config_r3_dominant_w1_0.1_w2_0.1_w3_0.8:\n1160\t      nof: 0.274\n1161\t      wrr: 0.562\n1162\t      rc_auc: 0.661\n1163\t    config_r2_enhanced_w1_0.2_w2_0.4_w3_0.4:\n1164\t      nof: 0.231\n1165\t      wrr: 0.569\n1166\t      rc_auc: 0.722\n1167\t    nof_range_across_configs_pp: 6.7\n1168\t    wrr_range_across_configs_pp: 6.3\n1169\t    rc_auc_range_across_configs_pp: 7.7\n1170\t    best_rc_auc_config: default\n1171\t    worst_rc_auc_config: r3_dominant\n1172\t  result_rationale: 'NoF 范围 6.7pp（0.207-0.274），在 4-8pp 预期区间内，表明中等敏感度。 R1-dominant\n1173\t    配置在 NoF 上最佳（0.207）但 WRR 崩溃（0.521），再次确认 R1 过度惩罚修正行为。 R3-dominant 配置最差（NoF 0.274），接近\n1174\t    R3-only baseline（0.291）， 说明当 R1 权重过低时表征信号的贡献被淹没。 Default 配置在 RC-AUC 上最佳（0.738），equal\n1175\t    配置接近（0.728）， 说明 default 权重选择虽无理论 justification 但经验上接近最优。 关键发现：(1) 只要 R1 权重 ≥ 0.2\n1176\t    且 R3 权重 ≥ 0.3，RC-AUC 都在 0.69+ 范围内—— 方法对权重选择中等鲁棒；(2) 极端配置（R1>0.5 或 R3>0.7）才导致显著退化。\n1177\t    这足以在论文中声称\"结果对合理权重范围内的选择鲁棒\"。\n1178\t\n1179\t    '\n1180\t  tables:\n1181\t  - name: 'Table 21: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis'\n1182\t    columns:\n1183\t    - config\n1184\t    - w1\n1185\t    - w2\n1186\t    - w3\n1187\t    - nof\n1188\t    - wrr\n1189\t    - rc_auc\n1190\t    rows:\n1191\t    - - R1-dominant\n1192\t      - 0.6\n1193\t      - 0.1\n1194\t      - 0.3\n1195\t      - 0.207\n1196\t      - 0.521\n1197\t      - 0.694\n1198\t    - - Default\n1199\t      - 0.3\n1200\t      - 0.2\n1201\t      - 0.5\n1202\t      - 0.218\n1203\t      - 0.584\n1204\t      - 0.738\n1205\t    - - Equal\n1206\t      - 0.33\n1207\t      - 0.33\n1208\t      - 0.34\n1209\t      - 0.226\n1210\t      - 0.573\n1211\t      - 0.728\n1212\t    - - R2-enhanced\n1213\t      - 0.2\n1214\t      - 0.4\n1215\t      - 0.4\n1216\t      - 0.231\n1217\t      - 0.569\n1218\t      - 0.722\n1219\t    - - R3-dominant\n1220\t      - 0.1\n1221\t      - 0.1\n1222\t      - 0.8\n1223\t      - 0.274\n1224\t      - 0.562\n1225\t      - 0.661\n1226\t  - name: 'Table 22: Sensitivity Summary'\n1227\t    columns:\n1228\t    - metric\n1229\t    - min\n1230\t    - max\n1231\t    - range_pp\n1232\t    - best_config\n1233\t    rows:\n1234\t    - - NoF\n1235\t      - 0.207\n1236\t      - 0.274\n1237\t      - 6.7\n1238\t      - R1-dominant\n1239\t    - - WRR\n1240\t      - 0.521\n1241\t      - 0.584\n1242\t      - 6.3\n1243\t      - Default\n1244\t    - - RC-AUC\n1245\t      - 0.661\n1246\t      - 0.738\n1247\t      - 7.7\n1248\t      - Default\n1249\t  figures_description:\n1250\t  - 'Fig 20: 平行坐标图，5 条线代表 5 组配置，纵轴为 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC。线的交叉模式显示 NoF 和 WRR 的 tradeoff——没有任何配置同时在两个指标上最优。'\n1251\t  - 'Fig 21: RC-AUC vs w1 权重的散点图（5 点），倒 U 形曲线，peak 在 w1=0.3 附近。'\n1252\t  analysis: 权重敏感度在可接受范围内（RC-AUC 变化 7.7pp），default 配置接近最优。 论文中报告为\"中等鲁棒性\"：合理范围内结果稳定，但极端权重导致退化。\n1253\t    建议在 appendix 提供完整表格，主论文仅提及\"sensitivity analysis confirms robustness within w1\n1254\t    ∈ [0.2, 0.4], w3 ∈ [0.3, 0.5]\"。 如果 reviewer 追问 weight tuning，此实验是充分的防御。\n1255\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1166f424-4351-4e3b-9c15-33b8cbac02ad","uuid":"9c0b2a38-b709-4c97-8bf5-f9ca8c60347e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:31:39.727Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'd_syc 方向信号可用但非决定性。DC-GRPO 在复合指标上优于 R3-only，但优势主要来自连续表征信号而非方向几何本身。\n  Claim 1 措辞从 \"linear direction discriminates\" 软化为 \"activation space contains discriminative\n  signal\"。 Claim 2 叙事从 \"directional decomposition is key\" 转向 \"representation-level\n  reward signals improve GRPO, directional projection is one effective instantiation\"。\n  Claim 3 维持 analysis subsection，报告中等 disagreement 率的定性 pattern。 强调 RC-AUC 评估框架的贡献价值。EACL\n  可投，ICLR 风险较高。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: calibration_data_expansion\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong）， 重新计算\n    d_syc 方向并评估 AUROC（5-fold CV + bootstrap CI）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auroc_5fold_mean: 0.843\n    auroc_5fold_std: 0.018\n    auroc_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.812\n    - 0.874\n    auroc_bootstrap_ci_width: 0.062\n    auroc_by_evidence_strength_weak: 0.871\n    auroc_by_evidence_strength_medium: 0.832\n    auroc_by_evidence_strength_strong: 0.809\n    best_layer: L18\n    layer_progression_random_to_peak: L0=0.51, L8=0.63, L14=0.74, L18=0.843, L22=0.831,\n      L27=0.812\n    extraction_position_asst_first_auroc: 0.843\n    extraction_position_user_last_auroc: 0.791\n  result_rationale: '200 pairs 将 MVP 的 50-pair σ=0.054 压缩至 ~0.03 级别，AUROC 从 0.826\n    小幅提升至 0.843， 主要来自 medium/strong evidence 对分类边界的细化。但 CI 宽度仍在 0.06 附近——200 pairs\n    足以通过 0.80 gate 但远不够将 CI 压至 0.03 以下。weak evidence 的 AUROC 最高（0.871），因为 sycophantic\n    capitulation 在 弱证据下信号最纯粹（模型内部知道证据不足但仍迎合）；strong evidence 下 AUROC 降至 0.809，因为 genuine\n    revision 和 capitulation 在强证据场景中激活模式更接近——模型确实在更新信念，方向信号混叠。 这一模式预示了 median 档的核心问题：d_syc\n    捕获的不纯粹是\"谄媚方向\"，而是混合了认知不确定性信号。 层进展确认 mid-layer emergence（L14-18 是关键跃升区间），但 peak\n    略移至 L18 而非 MVP 的 L19， 反映更大数据集下更精确的层定位。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Calibration AUROC by Evidence Strength and Layer'\n    columns:\n    - layer\n    - weak_auroc\n    - medium_auroc\n    - strong_auroc\n    - overall_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - L0\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.51\n    - - L8\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.63\n    - - L14\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.74\n    - - L18\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.843\n    - - L22\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.831\n    - - L27\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.812\n  - name: 'Table 2: Bootstrap CI Summary (1000 resamples)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - mean_auroc\n      - 0.843\n    - - std\n      - 0.018\n    - - ci_95_lower\n      - 0.812\n    - - ci_95_upper\n      - 0.874\n    - - ci_width\n      - 0.062\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1a: Layer progression curve 显示 L0-L8 缓升、L14-L18 急升、L18 后 plateau 并轻微回落的 S\n    形曲线。三条线分别对应 weak/medium/strong evidence，weak 始终最高，strong 始终最低，差距在 mid-layer 拉大。'\n  - 'Fig 1b: Bootstrap AUROC 分布直方图，近似正态分布，mean=0.843，95% CI 用竖线标注，所有 resamples 均 >\n    0.78。'\n  analysis: '通过 0.80 gate（CI 下界 0.812 > 0.80），但处于\"继续但降低 R1 权重\"区间而非\"全速推进\"区间。 evidence-strength\n    梯度揭示 d_syc 的本质局限：在 strong evidence 下方向判别力下降， 因为 genuine revision 和 sycophantic\n    capitulation 的内部表征差异被压缩。 这直接预示 DC-GRPO 在 WRR 指标上的有限提升——R1 在该场景下噪声较大。 建议 R1 权重从原定\n    0.3 降至 0.2，增强 R3 安全网。\n\n    '\n- name: dc_grpo_main\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 'DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)，\n    Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.218\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.014\n    sycon_tof_mean: 0.731\n    sycon_tof_std: 0.019\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.584\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.022\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.173\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.016\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.738\n    rc_auc_std: 0.021\n    mt_bench_score: 7.42\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.48\n    mmlu_accuracy: 0.627\n    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.6\n    best_step: 6500\n    training_loss_final: 0.342\n    early_stop_triggered: false\n    r1_reward_mean_final: 0.41\n    r2_reward_mean_final: 0.28\n    r3_reward_mean_final: 0.63\n  result_rationale: 'DC-GRPO 在 median 档下完成训练但表现中规中矩。NoF 0.218 显著优于 R3-only（预期 ~0.29），\n    约 10pp 绝对改善，但 WRR 仅 0.584——说明 R1 在区分 warranted revision 时噪声较大， 导致部分应修正的场景被保守地抑制。这正是\n    exp-001 中 strong evidence AUROC 下降的下游体现： d_syc 在\"模型确实该改变信念\"时信号不纯，R1 给出的负奖励过多地惩罚了正当修正。\n    RC-AUC 0.738 是亮点——复合指标上的优势来自 R1 同时拉低了 NoF（主贡献）和维持了中等 WRR， 但两个单项指标的改善不均匀。训练在 6500\n    步附近效果最佳但未触发 early stop， 后 1500 步 NoF 几乎不变但 WRR 微降，暗示方向信号在训练后期被过度拟合。 MT-Bench 降幅\n    0.48 在可接受范围内，MMLU 损失 0.6pp 可忽略。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: DC-GRPO Training Metrics by Checkpoint (seed average)'\n    columns:\n    - step\n    - nof\n    - wrr\n    - rc_auc\n    - mt_bench\n    - direction_cosine_w_init\n    rows:\n    - - 1000\n      - 0.312\n      - 0.611\n      - 0.652\n      - 7.78\n      - 0.97\n    - - 2000\n      - 0.271\n      - 0.603\n      - 0.691\n      - 7.65\n      - 0.93\n    - - 3000\n      - 0.248\n      - 0.594\n      - 0.714\n      - 7.55\n      - 0.89\n    - - 4000\n      - 0.234\n      - 0.589\n      - 0.728\n      - 7.48\n      - 0.85\n    - - 5000\n      - 0.225\n      - 0.586\n      - 0.735\n      - 7.44\n      - 0.82\n    - - 6000\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.585\n      - 0.737\n      - 7.43\n      - 0.8\n    - - 6500\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.738\n      - 7.42\n      - 0.79\n    - - 7000\n      - 0.219\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.736\n      - 7.41\n      - 0.78\n    - - 8000\n      - 0.221\n      - 0.574\n      - 0.732\n      - 7.39\n      - 0.76\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2a: Training curves (3 seeds, shaded std) 显示 NoF 前 4000 步快速下降后趋于平稳，WRR 则呈缓慢下降趋势——两条曲线的交叉行为可视化了\n    sycophancy-revision tradeoff。'\n  - 'Fig 2b: RC-AUC 训练曲线 peak 在 ~6500 步，之后轻微下降，表明方向信号在长训练中过拟合的风险。'\n  analysis: 'DC-GRPO 核心结果：NoF 改善显著（vs R3-only ~10pp），但 WRR 改善有限（~2-4pp）。 这一不均匀性是 median\n    档的标志性特征——d_syc 更擅长识别 sycophantic capitulation 而非正确区分 warranted revision，导致\"过度抵抗\"的副作用。\n    RC-AUC 作为复合指标成功捕获了整体改善，是最佳展示指标。\n\n    '\n- name: r3_only_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'R3-only GRPO baseline，仅用 NLI behavioral reward，3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.291\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.018\n    sycon_tof_mean: 0.682\n    sycon_tof_std: 0.021\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.558\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.025\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.237\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.019\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.641\n    rc_auc_std: 0.024\n    mt_bench_score: 7.61\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.29\n    mmlu_accuracy: 0.63\n    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.3\n  result_rationale: 'R3-only 是\"行为信号天花板\"baseline。NLI reward 能捕获表面不一致但无法深入表征层， 导致 NoF\n    改善有限（0.291 vs vanilla ~0.38）——它惩罚了最明显的迎合但漏掉了表面合理但 内部 sycophantic 的回复。WRR 0.558\n    与 DC-GRPO（0.584）差距不大，说明 R3 本身 不太区分修正类型——它对所有\"改变答案\"行为施加了近似均匀的惩罚。 RC-AUC 0.641 显著低于\n    DC-GRPO 的 0.738（~10pp），这是论文最核心的对比数据。 MT-Bench 降幅更小（0.29 vs 0.48），因为 R3-only 的训练信号更保守，对通用能力的扰动更小。\n    这构成一个 tradeoff 论点：DC-GRPO 用 0.2 分 MT-Bench 换取 ~10pp RC-AUC 提升。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: R3-only Baseline Results (3 seeds)'\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nof\n    - wrr\n    - rc_auc\n    - mt_bench\n    rows:\n    - - seed_0\n      - 0.283\n      - 0.571\n      - 0.655\n      - 7.58\n    - - seed_1\n      - 0.298\n      - 0.542\n      - 0.628\n      - 7.63\n    - - seed_2\n      - 0.292\n      - 0.561\n      - 0.64\n      - 7.62\n    - - mean_std\n      - 0.291±0.018\n      - 0.558±0.025\n      - 0.641±0.024\n      - 7.61±0.03\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: R3-only 与 DC-GRPO 的 NoF vs WRR scatter (3 seeds each)，显示 DC-GRPO 在 NoF\n    轴上有清晰优势，在 WRR 轴上两者 CI 有重叠。'\n  analysis: 'R3-only 确认了纯行为 reward 的局限：NoF 不够低（漏掉隐性迎合），WRR 不够高（不区分修正类型）。 DC-GRPO 的\n    NoF 优势（~7pp）达到统计显著（p~0.02），但 WRR 优势（~2.6pp）不显著（p~0.15）。 RC-AUC 差异（~10pp）是最强对比点。\n\n    '\n- name: act_style_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 'ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline，L2 activation consistency\n    loss，3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.264\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.02\n    sycon_tof_mean: 0.698\n    sycon_tof_std: 0.023\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.502\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.028\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.204\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.021\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.648\n    rc_auc_std: 0.027\n    mt_bench_score: 7.31\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.59\n    mmlu_accuracy: 0.621\n    mmlu_degradation_pp: 1.2\n  result_rationale: 'ACT 在 NoF 上表现不错（0.264），甚至接近 DC-GRPO（0.218），因为 undifferentiated\n    consistency 确实能阻止模型在施压下改变行为——但它不区分方向，所以 WRR 严重受损（0.502）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.584）和 R3-only（0.558）。ACT\n    本质上将模型冻结为\"不轻易改变答案\"， 这在减少迎合的同时也抑制了正当修正。RC-AUC 0.648 仅略优于 R3-only（0.641）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.738）——ACT\n    在 tradeoff 曲线上不如 DC-GRPO。 MT-Bench 降幅 0.59 和 MMLU 损失 1.2pp 都偏高，因为 L2 consistency\n    loss 对通用能力有副作用—— 它不仅阻止 sycophantic 变化，也抑制了任何合理的表征更新。 这是 DC-GRPO 相对 ACT 的最清晰叙事：\"有方向的表征约束优于无方向的表征约束\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: ACT Baseline Results (3 seeds)'\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nof\n    - wrr\n    - rc_auc\n    - mt_bench\n    - mmlu\n    rows:\n    - - seed_0\n      - 0.252\n      - 0.518\n      - 0.663\n      - 7.28\n      - 0.618\n    - - seed_1\n      - 0.274\n      - 0.488\n      - 0.634\n      - 7.33\n      - 0.623\n    - - seed_2\n      - 0.266\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.647\n      - 7.32\n      - 0.622\n    - - mean_std\n      - 0.264±0.020\n      - 0.502±0.028\n      - 0.648±0.027\n      - 7.31±0.03\n      - 0.621±0.003\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: NoF vs WRR 四象限图，ACT 处于低 NoF / 低 WRR 象限（过度保守），DC-GRPO 处于低 NoF / 中高 WRR\n    象限（理想区域），R3-only 处于中 NoF / 中 WRR 象限。'\n  analysis: 'ACT 是\"用大锤拍苍蝇\"的典型：NoF 改善来自冻结行为，代价是 WRR 大幅下降和通用能力损失。 DC-GRPO 在所有复合指标上胜出，且通用能力损失更小。论文中\n    ACT 对比支撑 \"有方向的表征约束 > 无方向的表征约束\"叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: full_evaluation\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的完整评估，包括 SYCON Bench、SycophancyEval、MT-Bench、MMLU\n    和项目特有指标。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dc_grpo_sycon_nof: 0.218\n    dc_grpo_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.724\n    dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.42\n    dc_grpo_mmlu: 0.627\n    dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.738\n    r3_only_sycon_nof: 0.291\n    r3_only_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.681\n    r3_only_mt_bench: 7.61\n    r3_only_mmlu: 0.63\n    r3_only_rc_auc: 0.641\n    act_sycon_nof: 0.264\n    act_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.703\n    act_mt_bench: 7.31\n    act_mmlu: 0.621\n    act_rc_auc: 0.648\n    binary_probe_sycon_nof: 0.239\n    binary_probe_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.712\n    binary_probe_mt_bench: 7.47\n    binary_probe_mmlu: 0.628\n    binary_probe_rc_auc: 0.718\n    vanilla_sycon_nof: 0.382\n    vanilla_sycophancy_eval_accuracy: 0.623\n    vanilla_mt_bench: 7.9\n    vanilla_mmlu: 0.633\n    vanilla_rc_auc: 0.524\n    dc_grpo_vs_r3only_nof_p_value: 0.021\n    dc_grpo_vs_r3only_wrr_p_value: 0.148\n    dc_grpo_vs_r3only_rcauc_p_value: 0.008\n    dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_nof_p_value: 0.089\n    dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_rcauc_p_value: 0.042\n    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value: 0.381\n  result_rationale: '完整评估暴露了 median 档的核心 pattern：DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC 上全面领先（0.738 vs 次佳\n    Binary Probe 0.718）， 但 head-to-head 单项对比中只有 NoF vs R3-only 达到传统显著性（p=0.021）。 DC-GRPO\n    vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差异 (0.218 vs 0.239, ~2pp) 不显著（p=0.089）， 这是 median 档的关键 weakness——无法证明方向投影优于\n    binary probe。 SycophancyEval 上的趋势与 SYCON 一致但差距更小，因为该 benchmark 偏向 single-turn。\n    Vanilla baseline 在 NoF 上最差（0.382）但通用能力最强（MT-Bench 7.90）， 为所有训练方法提供了上界参照。MT-Bench\n    和 MMLU 退化均在可接受范围内， DC-GRPO 未比 Binary Probe 产生更多通用能力损失。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Full Evaluation Summary (all methods)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - nof_↓\n    - wrr_↑\n    - rc_auc_↑\n    - syceval_acc_↑\n    - mt_bench\n    - mmlu\n    rows:\n    - - Vanilla\n      - 0.382\n      - 0.537\n      - 0.524\n      - 0.623\n      - 7.9\n      - 0.633\n    - - R3-only\n      - 0.291\n      - 0.558\n      - 0.641\n      - 0.681\n      - 7.61\n      - 0.63\n    - - ACT-style\n      - 0.264\n      - 0.502\n      - 0.648\n      - 0.703\n      - 7.31\n      - 0.621\n    - - Binary Probe\n      - 0.239\n      - 0.572\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.712\n      - 7.47\n      - 0.628\n    - - Continuous Probe\n      - 0.224\n      - 0.579\n      - 0.731\n      - 0.719\n      - 7.44\n      - 0.627\n    - - DC-GRPO\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.738\n      - 0.724\n      - 7.42\n      - 0.627\n  - name: 'Table 7: Statistical Significance (paired bootstrap, p-values)'\n    columns:\n    - comparison\n    - nof_p\n    - wrr_p\n    - rc_auc_p\n    rows:\n    - - DC-GRPO vs R3-only\n      - 0.021\n      - 0.148\n      - 0.008\n    - - DC-GRPO vs ACT\n      - 0.034\n      - 0.003\n      - 0.006\n    - - DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\n      - 0.089\n      - 0.231\n      - 0.042\n    - - DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\n      - 0.381\n      - 0.412\n      - 0.318\n    - - Binary Probe vs R3-only\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.278\n      - 0.012\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: 主结果柱状图（grouped bar），6 个方法 × 4 个核心指标，error bar 为 seed std。DC-GRPO 在 NoF\n    和 RC-AUC 上最佳，但与 Continuous Probe 的 bar 几乎等高。'\n  - 'Fig 6: RC-AUC 曲线（Revision Rate vs 1-Capitulation Rate），每个方法一条曲线。DC-GRPO 曲线包络面积最大，但\n    Continuous Probe 紧随其后，两者交叉。'\n  - 'Fig 7: MT-Bench vs RC-AUC scatter，展示 Pareto frontier。DC-GRPO 和 Continuous Probe\n    位于 frontier 上，R3-only 被 dominated。'\n  analysis: '主表是论文核心。叙事策略：(1) 所有表征 reward 方法 (DC-GRPO, Continuous Probe, Binary Probe)\n    均优于 R3-only，证明\"representation-level signals improve GRPO\"；(2) DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC\n    上最佳， 但 vs Continuous Probe 差异不显著——方向几何的独立贡献无法隔离；(3) RC-AUC 作为评估框架 比任何单项指标更好地捕获\n    tradeoff，是独立贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: direction_stability_monitoring\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '训练过程中监控 d_syc 方向稳定性，每 500 步报告 cosine similarity、held-out AUROC、漂移速率。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_step_500: 0.96\n    cosine_step_1000: 0.93\n    cosine_step_2000: 0.88\n    cosine_step_3000: 0.85\n    cosine_step_4000: 0.82\n    cosine_step_5000: 0.8\n    cosine_step_6000: 0.78\n    cosine_step_7000: 0.77\n    cosine_step_8000: 0.76\n    cosine_minimum: 0.76\n    recalibration_triggered_count: 0\n    recalibration_threshold: 0.7\n    held_out_auroc_step_0: 0.843\n    held_out_auroc_step_4000: 0.814\n    held_out_auroc_step_8000: 0.791\n    auroc_drift_total: -0.052\n  result_rationale: '方向在训练过程中持续漂移但未触发 0.70 重校准阈值——cosine 从初始 1.0 逐步降至 0.76。 前 2000\n    步漂移最快（0.88），因为 LoRA 适配改变了模型表征空间的几何结构； 4000 步后减速（0.82→0.76），因为 LoRA 参数趋于收敛。held-out\n    AUROC 从 0.843 降至 0.791， 说明初始方向在训练后期已不完全对准当前模型的 sycophancy 方向—— 如果不引入重校准机制，R1 信号质量在训练后期退化约\n    5pp AUROC。 实际的 500 步重校准机制使用当前模型重算方向，缓解了这一退化， 但增加了方法的复杂度。cosine 未降至 0.70 以下说明方向并未\"崩溃\"，\n    只是缓慢旋转——对论文而言这是好消息（方向真实存在且持续）， 但也意味着必须报告重校准机制作为方法的必要组成部分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Direction Stability During Training'\n    columns:\n    - step\n    - cosine_w_init\n    - held_out_auroc\n    - recalibrated\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.843\n      - —\n    - - 500\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.839\n      - 'No'\n    - - 1000\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.833\n      - 'No'\n    - - 2000\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.825\n      - 'No'\n    - - 3000\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.819\n      - 'No'\n    - - 4000\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.814\n      - 'No'\n    - - 5000\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.806\n      - 'No'\n    - - 6000\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.798\n      - 'No'\n    - - 7000\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.794\n      - 'No'\n    - - 8000\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.791\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: 双 y 轴图。左轴 cosine similarity（蓝线，单调递减），右轴 held-out AUROC（红线，缓慢递减）。两条线走势一致但\n    AUROC 降幅更缓，说明方向旋转部分是''无害旋转''（正交于判别超平面的分量）。'\n  analysis: '方向漂移是真实现象但可控。论文需报告：(1) 方向在训练中持续旋转，cosine 降至 ~0.76； (2) 定期重校准是方法的必要组成部分，不是可选优化；\n    (3) AUROC 退化（~5pp）小于 cosine 变化暗示的幅度，因为判别超平面比方向本身更稳定。 这增加了方法的复杂度但也提供了一个 analysis\n    point。\n\n    '\n- name: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: '分析 R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式，特别关注 R1 认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct 的案例。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_samples_analyzed: 4800\n    agreement_rate: 0.924\n    disagreement_rate: 0.076\n    r1_syc_r3_correct_count: 217\n    r1_syc_r3_correct_rate: 0.045\n    r1_correct_r3_syc_count: 148\n    r1_correct_r3_syc_rate: 0.031\n    disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn2: 0.058\n    disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn3: 0.081\n    disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn4plus: 0.109\n    disagreement_by_evidence_weak: 0.092\n    disagreement_by_evidence_medium: 0.073\n    disagreement_by_evidence_strong: 0.061\n  result_rationale: '7.6% 总体 disagreement 落在 5-10% 区间内，满足 Claim 3 的最低门槛（> 5%）。 \"R1\n    认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct\"（masked sycophancy 候选）占 4.5%—— 这是最有叙事价值的子集，但比例偏低，难以作为\"方向信号独立发现隐藏迎合\"的强论据。\n    R1-correct/R3-syc（R3 误判）占 3.1%，说明 R3 的 NLI 评分器也有系统性偏差。 Disagreement 随 turn depth\n    增加（turn 4+ 达 10.9%），符合直觉：深层对话中 表面行为更难评估（R3 困难增加）而内部表征信号相对稳定（R1 优势显现）。 Weak evidence\n    场景 disagreement 最高（9.2%），因为弱证据下 R3 的 NLI 判断更模糊。 总体而言：disagreement 存在且有有趣的结构化 pattern，但比例不足以支撑\n    \"方向投影是检测 masked sycophancy 的关键工具\"这一强 claim。 适合作为 analysis subsection 报告，提供定性洞察。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - category\n    - count\n    - rate\n    rows:\n    - - Total samples\n      - 4800\n      - —\n    - - Full agreement\n      - 4435\n      - 0.924\n    - - R1=syc & R3=correct\n      - 217\n      - 0.045\n    - - R1=correct & R3=syc\n      - 148\n      - 0.031\n    - - Total disagreement\n      - 365\n      - 0.076\n  - name: 'Table 10: Disagreement Rate by Turn Depth'\n    columns:\n    - turn_depth\n    - n_samples\n    - disagreement_rate\n    rows:\n    - - Turn 2\n      - 1920\n      - 0.058\n    - - Turn 3\n      - 1680\n      - 0.081\n    - - Turn 4+\n      - 1200\n      - 0.109\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9a: Disagreement rate vs turn depth 柱状图，显示单调递增趋势。Error bar (bootstrap) 较宽但不重叠。'\n  - 'Fig 9b: 2×2 confusion matrix heatmap (R1 判断 × R3 判断)，agreement 格占主导，两个 disagreement\n    格的颜色深度接近但 R1=syc/R3=correct 略高。'\n  analysis: '7.6% disagreement 支持在 analysis subsection 中报告定性 pattern，但不足以列为 top-level\n    contribution。 叙事策略：(1) disagreement 存在且非随机（与 turn depth 和 evidence strength 相关）；\n    (2) 这提供了\"表征层和行为层看到不同图景\"的 evidence，但无法量化其中多少是 true masked sycophancy vs R1/R3 各自的噪声；(3)\n    诚实报告，不过度解读。\n\n    '\n- name: binary_probe_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Binary Probe Penalty baseline，binary linear probe on policy model\n    activations，3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.239\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.016\n    sycon_tof_mean: 0.718\n    sycon_tof_std: 0.02\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.572\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.024\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.191\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.018\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.718\n    rc_auc_std: 0.023\n    mt_bench_score: 7.47\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.43\n    mmlu_accuracy: 0.628\n    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Binary Probe 在 NoF 上达到 0.239——比 R3-only（0.291）好 ~5pp 但不如 DC-GRPO（0.218）。\n    DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差距仅 ~2pp（p=0.089），不显著。 这是 median 档的核心困境：binary probe\n    已经捕获了大部分表征层信号， 方向投影的额外贡献被 binary 分类的信息量掩盖。RC-AUC 0.718 vs DC-GRPO 0.738（~2pp 差距），\n    趋势上 DC-GRPO 更好但 3 seeds 的 power 不足以达到显著。 Binary probe 的 MT-Bench 降幅（0.43）与 DC-GRPO（0.48）相当，\n    说明两种方法对通用能力的扰动类似。关键启示：方向投影 vs binary probe 的差异更多在于信号的连续性（gradient 更平滑）而非方向性本身。\n    这解释了为什么需要 exp-014 continuous probe baseline 来隔离这两个因素。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Binary Probe Baseline Results (3 seeds)'\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nof\n    - wrr\n    - rc_auc\n    - mt_bench\n    rows:\n    - - seed_0\n      - 0.231\n      - 0.582\n      - 0.727\n      - 7.44\n    - - seed_1\n      - 0.248\n      - 0.558\n      - 0.706\n      - 7.49\n    - - seed_2\n      - 0.238\n      - 0.576\n      - 0.721\n      - 7.48\n    - - mean_std\n      - 0.239±0.016\n      - 0.572±0.024\n      - 0.718±0.023\n      - 7.47±0.03\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 和 RC-AUC paired comparison（3 seeds），连线图显示每个\n    seed 上 DC-GRPO 均略优但差距一致且小。'\n  analysis: 'Binary Probe 对比揭示 DC-GRPO 的优势来源不明确。论文不能简单声称 \"方向投影优于 binary probe\"——需要通过\n    exp-014 (continuous probe) 进一步分解。 但 Binary Probe 本身显著优于 R3-only（NoF p=0.041），\n    证明\"表征层信号有价值\"这一更温和的 claim。\n\n    '\n- name: ablation_r1_only\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'R1-only ablation，仅用方向投影 reward，从 exp-002 step 2000 分叉，短程训练 ~2000 步。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.273\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.021\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.491\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.031\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.612\n    rc_auc_std: 0.028\n    mt_bench_score: 7.18\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.72\n    training_stable: true\n    nof_improvement_vs_vanilla_pp: 10.9\n  result_rationale: 'R1-only 能降低 NoF（0.273 vs vanilla 0.382，~11pp），证明方向信号单独有训练价值。\n    但 WRR 严重下降（0.491 vs vanilla 0.537），因为没有 R3 行为安全网，R1 过度惩罚了 所有\"改变答案\"行为——方向投影在 strong\n    evidence 下的噪声直接传导为训练偏差。 RC-AUC 0.612 低于 R3-only（0.641），说明方向信号单独不如行为信号—— 但两者的组合（DC-GRPO\n    0.738）大幅超越任一单独信号。 MT-Bench 降幅较大（0.72），因为缺少 R3 对通用能力的隐式保护。 结论：R1 有独立贡献但不能单打独斗，需要与\n    R3 协同。 这支持论文的\"多信号组合\"叙事。nof_improvement ≥ 5pp，满足 exp-011 的前置条件。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: R1-only Ablation Results'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - r1_only\n    - dc_grpo\n    - r3_only\n    - vanilla\n    rows:\n    - - NoF ↓\n      - 0.273\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.291\n      - 0.382\n    - - WRR ↑\n      - 0.491\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.558\n      - 0.537\n    - - RC-AUC ↑\n      - 0.612\n      - 0.738\n      - 0.641\n      - 0.524\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - 7.18\n      - 7.42\n      - 7.61\n      - 7.9\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Ablation bar chart，4 个变体 × 3 指标，R1-only 在 NoF 上优于 R3-only 但在 WRR 和 MT-Bench\n    上明显更差。'\n  analysis: 'R1-only 证明方向投影包含真实训练信号（NoF ~11pp improvement vs vanilla）， 但也证明它不能替代行为信号——R3\n    是必要的安全网。 论文叙事：各信号互补，DC-GRPO 的价值在于有效组合。\n\n    '\n- name: turn_depth_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: '按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 DC-GRPO vs baselines 的修正率变化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dc_grpo_nof_turn2: 0.178\n    dc_grpo_nof_turn3: 0.224\n    dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus: 0.287\n    r3_only_nof_turn2: 0.231\n    r3_only_nof_turn3: 0.298\n    r3_only_nof_turn4plus: 0.381\n    act_nof_turn2: 0.214\n    act_nof_turn3: 0.268\n    act_nof_turn4plus: 0.342\n    dc_grpo_advantage_turn2_pp: 5.3\n    dc_grpo_advantage_turn3_pp: 7.4\n    dc_grpo_advantage_turn4plus_pp: 9.4\n    dc_grpo_wrr_turn2: 0.612\n    dc_grpo_wrr_turn3: 0.578\n    dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus: 0.541\n    r3_only_wrr_turn2: 0.589\n    r3_only_wrr_turn3: 0.551\n    r3_only_wrr_turn4plus: 0.517\n  result_rationale: '所有方法的 NoF 都随 turn depth 增加（commitment 越深越难修正），但 DC-GRPO 的优势 在深层\n    turns 放大：turn 2 仅 ~5pp 优势，turn 4+ 扩大到 ~9pp。 这是因为深层 commitment 中行为信号（R3）的判别力下降——NLI\n    评分器在多轮上下文中 越来越难准确判断\"改变答案\"是否合理，而表征层信号（R1）对 turn depth 的敏感度更低 （方向投影不受表面对话长度影响）。WRR\n    同样随深度下降，但 DC-GRPO 在各层都维持了 相对优势（2-3pp），虽然不显著但趋势一致。 这一分析强化了\"多轮场景是 DC-GRPO 的甜蜜点\"叙事，\n    也回应了\"多轮训练是否比单轮训练更有价值\"的 reviewer 疑问。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: NoF by Turn Depth (all methods)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - turn_2\n    - turn_3\n    - turn_4+\n    rows:\n    - - Vanilla\n      - 0.318\n      - 0.389\n      - 0.462\n    - - R3-only\n      - 0.231\n      - 0.298\n      - 0.381\n    - - ACT\n      - 0.214\n      - 0.268\n      - 0.342\n    - - Binary Probe\n      - 0.196\n      - 0.243\n      - 0.309\n    - - DC-GRPO\n      - 0.178\n      - 0.224\n      - 0.287\n  - name: 'Table 14: DC-GRPO Advantage (pp) vs R3-only by Turn Depth'\n    columns:\n    - turn_depth\n    - nof_advantage_pp\n    - wrr_advantage_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Turn 2\n      - 5.3\n      - 2.3\n    - - Turn 3\n      - 7.4\n      - 2.7\n    - - Turn 4+\n      - 9.4\n      - 2.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: 折线图 NoF vs turn depth，5 条线（5 个方法），所有线上升但斜率不同。DC-GRPO 最平缓，Vanilla 最陡。线间距在\n    turn 4+ 处最大。'\n  - 'Fig 13: DC-GRPO advantage (pp) vs R3-only 柱状图，按 turn depth 分组，显示单调递增趋势。'\n  analysis: 'Turn-depth 分析是论文中\"多轮价值论证\"的关键 evidence。 DC-GRPO 的优势在深层 turns 放大 ~2× 是一个强叙事点，\n    支持\"表征层信号在行为信号困难的场景中更有价值\"的论点。 这部分可独立成为一个 subsection，增强论文的多轮 contribution 叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'R1+R2 无 R3 ablation，去掉行为安全网后的完整训练循环。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.252\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.024\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.483\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.033\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.628\n    rc_auc_std: 0.03\n    mt_bench_score: 7.14\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.76\n    surface_inconsistency_rate: 0.087\n  result_rationale: 'R1+R2 无 R3 验证了一个有趣的现象：模型在表征层被引导向\"正确方向\"， 但缺少行为安全网后出现 8.7% 的\"表面不一致\"输出——模型内部判断正确但表达方式\n    不连贯或自相矛盾。这是因为 R1+R2 只优化内部表征而不约束输出格式。 NoF 0.252 比 R1-only 的 0.273 好（R2 提供了额外的对比学习信号），\n    但 WRR 进一步恶化（0.483 vs R1-only 0.491），因为 R2 的 rank-based contrastive 对\"改变 vs 不改变\"的约束更强。整体\n    RC-AUC 0.628 不如 R3-only（0.641）， 确认 R3 不仅是安全网，而且是有效信号源。 这一实验的主要价值在于证明 R3 的必要性和三信号协同的设计合理性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: R1+R2 (no R3) Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - r1+r2\n    - r1_only\n    - dc_grpo_full\n    - r3_only\n    rows:\n    - - NoF ↓\n      - 0.252\n      - 0.273\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.291\n    - - WRR ↑\n      - 0.483\n      - 0.491\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.558\n    - - RC-AUC ↑\n      - 0.628\n      - 0.612\n      - 0.738\n      - 0.641\n    - - Surface inconsistency\n      - 0.087\n      - 0.063\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.008\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 14: Ablation cascade 图，从左到右：R1-only → R1+R2 → DC-GRPO (R1+R2+R3)，NoF 逐步下降，WRR\n    在加入 R3 后跳升。突出 R3 对 WRR 的关键贡献。'\n  analysis: 'R1+R2 vs DC-GRPO 的对比清晰展示了 R3 的双重作用：(1) 防止表面不一致； (2) 保护 warranted revision。这个\n    ablation 在论文中支持\"三信号设计\"的 justification， 但篇幅不宜过长——放在 appendix 中即可。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_model_transfer\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: '在 Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算和部分 DC-GRPO 训练。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    phase_a_auroc: 0.778\n    phase_a_auroc_ci:\n    - 0.742\n    - 0.814\n    phase_a_best_layer: L17\n    phase_a_gate_passed: true\n    phase_b_nof: 0.248\n    phase_b_wrr: 0.561\n    phase_b_rc_auc: 0.698\n    phase_b_steps: 3000\n    phase_b_mt_bench: 7.28\n    cross_model_direction_cosine: 0.31\n    direction_transfer_auroc: 0.62\n  result_rationale: 'Phase A AUROC 0.778 通过 0.75 gate，但低于 Qwen3-8B 的 0.843——约 6.5pp\n    差距。 这是预期的：不同模型族的表征空间几何不同，d_syc 的具体表现依赖于训练数据和架构。 Peak layer 在 L17（Qwen3 在 L18），差异很小，支持\"mid-layer\n    emergence is universal\"叙事。 Phase B 短程训练后 NoF 0.248（vs Qwen3 的 0.218，~3pp 差距），RC-AUC\n    0.698（vs 0.738，~4pp 差距）， 说明 DC-GRPO 框架跨模型可迁移但需要模型特定的方向校准——不能直接搬运 Qwen3 的 d_syc。\n    跨模型方向的 cosine similarity 仅 0.31，证实方向是模型特定的； 但直接用 Qwen3 方向在 Llama 上的 transfer AUROC\n    为 0.62（显著高于随机但远低于 native）， 说明存在共享结构但不足以替代本地计算。 对论文而言：跨模型验证成功（框架有效），但方向不可直接迁移（需要本地校准数据）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: Cross-Model Transfer (Llama-3-8B)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - llama_3_8b\n    - qwen3_8b\n    rows:\n    - - Calibration AUROC\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.843\n    - - Best layer\n      - L17\n      - L18\n    - - DC-GRPO NoF\n      - 0.248\n      - 0.218\n    - - DC-GRPO WRR\n      - 0.561\n      - 0.584\n    - - DC-GRPO RC-AUC\n      - 0.698\n      - 0.738\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - 7.28\n      - 7.42\n  - name: 'Table 17: Direction Transfer Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - direction_source\n    - evaluated_on\n    - auroc\n    - cosine_w_native\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3\n      - Qwen3\n      - 0.843\n      - 1.0\n    - - Llama3\n      - Llama3\n      - 0.778\n      - 1.0\n    - - Qwen3\n      - Llama3\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.31\n    - - Llama3\n      - Qwen3\n      - 0.641\n      - 0.31\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 15: 双模型的 layer progression 曲线，形状类似（S 形，mid-layer peak）但 Llama3 整体偏低 ~6pp。'\n  - 'Fig 16: Direction transfer matrix heatmap (2×2)，对角线（native）高，off-diagonal 低但高于\n    0.50 random。'\n  analysis: '跨模型实验部分回应\"single model\"critique。叙事：(1) DC-GRPO 框架跨模型有效（Llama3 也能训练出 更好的\n    sycophancy-revision tradeoff）；(2) 方向本身是模型特定的（cosine 0.31）， 但表征空间中\"存在可判别方向\"的现象是跨模型的；(3)\n    仍需在每个模型上独立校准。 这是一个 honest limitations 点而非 weakness——框架通用性有，但不是 plug-and-play。\n\n    '\n- name: neutral_baseline_three_way\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: '引入 neutral condition 计算独立 d_gen，打破 d_gen = -d_syc 限制。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    d_syc_d_gen_cosine: -0.72\n    d_gen_independent_auroc: 0.761\n    d_syc_independent_auroc: 0.838\n    r2_with_independent_d_gen_nof: 0.221\n    r2_with_independent_d_gen_wrr: 0.591\n    r2_improvement_vs_rank_based_wrr_pp: 0.7\n  result_rationale: 'd_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine 为 -0.72（而非理论退化值 -1.0）， 确认 binary design\n    中的 d_gen=-d_syc 假设虽然不精确但也不致命。 两个方向之间存在 ~44° 的夹角（arccos(-0.72)≈136°），说明 sycophantic\n    和 genuine 方向不是完全相反的——它们共享大部分对比信号但有 ~28% 的独立分量。 独立 d_gen 的 AUROC（0.761）低于 d_syc（0.838），因为\n    genuine revision 的表征信号 更弱且更分散——模型对\"被正确说服\"的内部表征不如\"迎合施压\"清晰。 用独立 d_gen 重新训练 R2 后，NoF\n    几乎不变（0.221 vs 0.218）但 WRR 微升（0.591 vs 0.584）， 改善仅 0.7pp——不值得增加方法复杂度。 结论：S1 rank-based\n    R2 设计是合理的折衷，three-way design 可留作 future work。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Three-way Direction Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - cosine(d_syc\n      - d_gen_independent)\n      - -0.72\n    - - cosine(d_syc\n      - -d_syc)\n      - -1.0\n    - - d_syc AUROC\n      - 0.838\n    - - d_gen independent AUROC\n      - 0.761\n    - - R2 w/ independent d_gen NoF\n      - 0.221\n    - - R2 w/ independent d_gen WRR\n      - 0.591\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 17: 3D PCA 投影显示 d_syc、-d_syc 和 d_gen_independent 三个方向。d_gen 与 -d_syc 接近但有明显偏转。'\n  analysis: '三方 baseline 确认 binary design 的局限性是温和的（cosine=-0.72 而非 -1.0）。 放在 appendix\n    作为 supplementary analysis。主论文中提及 rank-based R2 的设计选择 并引用此 appendix 作为 justification。\n\n    '\n- name: continuous_probe_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: 'Continuous Probe Baseline：用 logistic regression 概率值作为 reward 信号， 隔离\"方向性\n    vs 连续性\"的贡献。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sycon_nof_mean: 0.224\n    sycon_nof_std: 0.015\n    sycon_tof_mean: 0.726\n    sycon_tof_std: 0.018\n    warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.579\n    warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.023\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.178\n    unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std: 0.017\n    rc_auc_mean: 0.731\n    rc_auc_std: 0.022\n    mt_bench_score: 7.44\n    mt_bench_degradation: 0.46\n    mmlu_accuracy: 0.627\n    mmlu_degradation_pp: 0.6\n    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_diff_pp: -0.6\n    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_diff_pp: 0.7\n    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value: 0.381\n    dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_p_value: 0.318\n  result_rationale: '这是 median 档最关键的实验结果。Continuous Probe 的 NoF（0.224）与 DC-GRPO（0.218）\n    差距仅 0.6pp（p=0.381），RC-AUC 差距仅 0.7pp（p=0.318）——完全不显著。 这意味着 DC-GRPO 相对 Binary Probe\n    的优势（~2pp NoF）几乎完全来自信号的连续性 （logistic regression 概率 vs binary 0/1），而非方向投影的几何特性。\n    logistic regression 在与 d_syc 相同的激活空间上训练，其决策超平面与 d_syc 高度相关 （cosine ≈ 0.89），但它通过\n    sigmoid 输出提供了平滑的概率 gradient， 与方向投影的连续值起到了几乎等价的作用。 这迫使论文叙事转向：不是\"方向投影是关键\"，而是\"表征层连续信号是关键，\n    方向投影是提取该信号的一种有效方法\"。 DC-GRPO 仍有微弱数值优势，可能来自方向投影对 outlier 的鲁棒性更好 （投影是线性的，不受 sigmoid\n    饱和影响），但这个差异不足以支撑显著性 claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 19: Continuous Probe vs DC-GRPO Head-to-Head'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - continuous_probe\n    - dc_grpo\n    - diff_pp\n    - p_value\n    rows:\n    - - NoF ↓\n      - 0.224\n      - 0.218\n      - -0.6\n      - 0.381\n    - - WRR ↑\n      - 0.579\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.412\n    - - RC-AUC ↑\n      - 0.731\n      - 0.738\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.318\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - 7.44\n      - 7.42\n      - -0.02\n      - 0.891\n  - name: 'Table 20: Representation-level Methods Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - signal_type\n    - nof\n    - rc_auc\n    - vs_r3only_rcauc_pp\n    rows:\n    - - R3-only\n      - behavioral\n      - 0.291\n      - 0.641\n      - —\n    - - Binary Probe\n      - repr, discrete\n      - 0.239\n      - 0.718\n      - 7.7\n    - - Continuous Probe\n      - repr, continuous\n      - 0.224\n      - 0.731\n      - 9.0\n    - - DC-GRPO\n      - repr, directional\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.738\n      - 9.7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 18: 三个表征方法 (Binary/Continuous/Directional) 的 NoF 和 RC-AUC paired comparison。Binary\n    → Continuous 跳升明显，Continuous → Directional 几乎平坦——可视化''连续性而非方向性''的结论。'\n  - 'Fig 19: 信号类型 decomposition 示意图：behavioral → repr discrete → repr continuous →\n    repr directional，每步增益逐级递减。'\n  analysis: 'Continuous Probe 是 median 档的 smoking gun：它证明 DC-GRPO 的优势主要来自 \"在训练 reward\n    中引入表征层连续信号\"这一设计选择，而非 d_syc 方向投影的特定几何。 论文叙事必须调整：Claim 2 从\"directional decomposition\n    improves GRPO\"改为 \"representation-level continuous reward signals improve GRPO,\n    and directional projection is one principled instantiation with interpretability\n    advantages\"。 方向投影的独特卖点转向可解释性（方向有明确的几何含义）和分析工具价值（R1-R3 disagreement）， 而非训练效果的独占优势。\n\n    '\n- name: reward_weight_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: '测试 5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 配置的 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC 敏感度。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    config_default_w1_0.3_w2_0.2_w3_0.5:\n      nof: 0.218\n      wrr: 0.584\n      rc_auc: 0.738\n    config_r1_dominant_w1_0.6_w2_0.1_w3_0.3:\n      nof: 0.207\n      wrr: 0.521\n      rc_auc: 0.694\n    config_equal_w1_0.33_w2_0.33_w3_0.34:\n      nof: 0.226\n      wrr: 0.573\n      rc_auc: 0.728\n    config_r3_dominant_w1_0.1_w2_0.1_w3_0.8:\n      nof: 0.274\n      wrr: 0.562\n      rc_auc: 0.661\n    config_r2_enhanced_w1_0.2_w2_0.4_w3_0.4:\n      nof: 0.231\n      wrr: 0.569\n      rc_auc: 0.722\n    nof_range_across_configs_pp: 6.7\n    wrr_range_across_configs_pp: 6.3\n    rc_auc_range_across_configs_pp: 7.7\n    best_rc_auc_config: default\n    worst_rc_auc_config: r3_dominant\n  result_rationale: 'NoF 范围 6.7pp（0.207-0.274），在 4-8pp 预期区间内，表明中等敏感度。 R1-dominant\n    配置在 NoF 上最佳（0.207）但 WRR 崩溃（0.521），再次确认 R1 过度惩罚修正行为。 R3-dominant 配置最差（NoF 0.274），接近\n    R3-only baseline（0.291）， 说明当 R1 权重过低时表征信号的贡献被淹没。 Default 配置在 RC-AUC 上最佳（0.738），equal\n    配置接近（0.728）， 说明 default 权重选择虽无理论 justification 但经验上接近最优。 关键发现：(1) 只要 R1 权重 ≥ 0.2\n    且 R3 权重 ≥ 0.3，RC-AUC 都在 0.69+ 范围内—— 方法对权重选择中等鲁棒；(2) 极端配置（R1>0.5 或 R3>0.7）才导致显著退化。\n    这足以在论文中声称\"结果对合理权重范围内的选择鲁棒\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 21: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - w1\n    - w2\n    - w3\n    - nof\n    - wrr\n    - rc_auc\n    rows:\n    - - R1-dominant\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.207\n      - 0.521\n      - 0.694\n    - - Default\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.738\n    - - Equal\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.226\n      - 0.573\n      - 0.728\n    - - R2-enhanced\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.231\n      - 0.569\n      - 0.722\n    - - R3-dominant\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.274\n      - 0.562\n      - 0.661\n  - name: 'Table 22: Sensitivity Summary'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - min\n    - max\n    - range_pp\n    - best_config\n    rows:\n    - - NoF\n      - 0.207\n      - 0.274\n      - 6.7\n      - R1-dominant\n    - - WRR\n      - 0.521\n      - 0.584\n      - 6.3\n      - Default\n    - - RC-AUC\n      - 0.661\n      - 0.738\n      - 7.7\n      - Default\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 20: 平行坐标图，5 条线代表 5 组配置，纵轴为 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC。线的交叉模式显示 NoF 和 WRR 的 tradeoff——没有任何配置同时在两个指标上最优。'\n  - 'Fig 21: RC-AUC vs w1 权重的散点图（5 点），倒 U 形曲线，peak 在 w1=0.3 附近。'\n  analysis: 权重敏感度在可接受范围内（RC-AUC 变化 7.7pp），default 配置接近最优。 论文中报告为\"中等鲁棒性\"：合理范围内结果稳定，但极端权重导致退化。\n    建议在 appendix 提供完整表格，主论文仅提及\"sensitivity analysis confirms robustness within w1\n    ∈ [0.2, 0.4], w3 ∈ [0.3, 0.5]\"。 如果 reviewer 追问 weight tuning，此实验是充分的防御。\n","numLines":1255,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1255}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CkKkaT33rdxqFe1anGZqLi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the project context. Let me also read the D029 narrative pivot context and the latest dream report's median imagined experiments to understand the format differences.\n\nThe key thing is: the user wants me to generate median-tier imagined experiments for ALL planned experiments based on the D029 pivot narrative. The previous dream report (dream_20260518T125925) was based on the pre-D029 framing (cosine R1 as the method). Now with the D029 pivot, the method is binary probe R1, and cosine R1 failure is a key negative result.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments from experiment_plan.yaml:\n\n\nLooking at the actual experiment results so far, I can see which ones have completed, which are still running, and which were killed. Several key findings stand out: exp-001 achieved a strong AUROC of 0.826, exp-002 failed as expected with cosine R1, exp-004 showed moderate performance with SYCONScore, and exp-016 revealed that ActAdd destroys the ToF metric. Multiple variants are currently running or have been terminated due to mode collapse or other issues.\n\nFor the remaining experiments, I still need to run a substantial pipeline covering full evaluation, stability monitoring, disagreement analysis, and various ablations. However, the D029 pivot has shifted my understanding—some of these planned experiments may need recalibration or reframing given what I've learned from the killed runs and negative results, particularly around the cosine R1 approach and the destructive effects of certain modifications.\n\nLooking at what's actually pending, I need to distinguish between the planned experiments that are still queued and the currently running ones like exp-003 and exp-008v3 that are waiting for results. The user's request is specifically for planned experiments, so I should focus on generating synthetic data for those, but I also need to account for the running experiments that don't have final results yet. Right, so the actual status comes from the registry, not the plan file. The completed experiments include several killed runs and negative results, while the truly planned ones that haven't started yet are exp-005 through exp-015 minus the ones already running or done. So I'm looking at nine experiments still waiting to be executed, plus three that are currently in progress without results yet. I'm checking the experiment statuses against what the user actually asked for. They want details on \"planned\" experiments specifically, but looking back at the previous dream report, it covered all experiments regardless of status. Let me reconsider whether they mean just the planned ones or all experiments in the plan — the phrasing suggests all experiments that are listed in the experiment_plan section, including those already completed and those still running. Looking at the experiment_plan entries, I need to generate imagined results for all sixteen experiments while accounting for how the D029 pivot affects the median tier performance bands. The key constraints show exp-008v3 and exp-003 performing within specific SYCON score ranges, so I'll use those as anchors and extrapolate the remaining experiments' results accordingly.\n\nThe narrative has shifted significantly—we're moving away from claiming method superiority toward demonstrating viability and uncovering the structural reasons why cosine similarity fails in R1. This becomes the paper's core contribution in sections 4-5, while the binary probe serves as validation rather than a state-of-the-art claim. Claim 3 gets relegated to the appendix.\n\nNow I'm working through what's changed from the previous dream report and filling in the imagined data for the remaining experiments.\n\nThe D029 pivot shows that exp-002 (cosine R1 failure chain) is already completed negative evidence, exp-008 evolved into exp-008v3 as the new main method, exp-014 hit mode collapse rather than the hoped-for continuous probe success, and exp-016 came back negative. For the median tier experiments still needed, I'm focusing on exp-003 (R3-only baseline) which is running and needs final results, exp-005 which requires adaptation since the main method is now exp-008v3 instead of exp-002, and exp-006 for direction stability metrics.\n\nThe rest of the median tier lineup includes exp-007 for R1-R3 disagreement, exp-008v3 as the core binary probe experiment, exp-009 as the R1-only ablation with the binary probe, exp-010 for turn-depth analysis, exp-011 testing R1+R3 without the behavioral safety net, exp-012 for cross-model transfer, exp-013 as a neutral three-way baseline, and exp-015 for reward weight sensitivity. There are also some additional experiments suggested in the median tier definition like the random-direction probe ablation (which D030 already showed gives 0.835 AUROC versus 0.727 for random), and per-strength analysis extensions.\n\nI need to re-examine what the user actually said about the median tier definition more carefully. Looking at which experiments have actual results versus those needing imagined data, I can see exp-016 and the vanilla baseline are complete, while most of the planned experiments still need synthetic metrics. For the newly identified analyses, the probe ablation data already exists from D030, but I still need to figure out what the per-strength analysis extension should cover.\n\nLet me reconsider what the user is actually asking for—they want detailed data for each planned experiment from the experiment_plan, which means I should focus on exp-005 through exp-007 and the others marked as planned, adapting them to work within the D029 pivot and median tier constraints. I need to think through which experiments require imagined data versus actual results. The planned and running experiments—exp-003, exp-008v3, and the ones marked as planned—will need predicted metrics, while the completed ones already have real data. But looking back at how the dream report handled this, it created a cohesive narrative across all experiments, so I should imagine metrics for everything to paint a complete picture of what the paper would show if all experiments finished.\n\nLet me work through the median tier predictions for each experiment, starting with exp-003, which is the R3-only baseline currently running. The median tier suggests a SYCONScore around 0.31, so I need to figure out what ToF and NoF values would produce that score and make sense for this baseline approach. I'm working through the harmonic mean calculation to find the right ToF value that gives a SYCONScore of 0.31 when NoF is 0.80, but I need to solve this algebra more carefully.\n\nNow I'm checking the same calculation with NoF at 0.82 to see how the ToF value shifts, and I'm getting approximately 0.19 for ToF in both cases, which confirms exp-003 should have a SYCONScore around 0.31 with ToF near 0.19 and NoF near 0.81.\n\nFor exp-008v3, I'm looking at the expected performance range where the SYCONScore should fall between 0.31 and 0.38, with the improvement over the R3-only baseline ranging from 0.01 to 0.08 points.\n\nIf I estimate the delta at around 0.04, that puts exp-008v3's SYCONScore at approximately 0.35, and I'm verifying this works with ToF values around 0.22 to 0.23 and NoF around 0.78. I'm setting up exp-005 as the full evaluation comparing the vanilla baseline, R3-only approach, ACT, and the binary probe R1+R3 variant from exp-008v3, while noting that several planned experiments like DC-GRPO and continuous probe were killed. For exp-006, I'm shifting the direction stability analysis to use exp-008v3 training results instead, targeting a median direction AUROC between 0.76 and 0.8, then checking cosine similarity with the initial state.\n\nThe remaining experiments are lined up: exp-007 tests R1-R3 disagreement rates in the 0.03-0.06 range to assess Claim 3 evidence, exp-009 isolates binary probe R1 without R3, exp-010 analyzes turn-depth from exp-005 results, exp-011 explores R1+R2 without R3 as a conditional phase 2 experiment, exp-012 tests cross-model transfer on Llama-3-8B as phase 1, and exp-013 is a neutral baseline three-way comparison in phase 2.\n\nFor exp-015, I'm looking at reward weight sensitivity across five configurations of (w1, w3) parameters, keeping in mind that R2 is disabled in the D029 pivot. Beyond the original plan, I need to consider whether a random-direction probe ablation is necessary (already covered in D030) and if per-strength analysis should extend exp-005 or become its own experiment. Some original experiments now have overlap issues post-D029—exp-009 and exp-011 both effectively become R1-only tests since R2 is disabled, and exp-013's neutral three-way comparison becomes less meaningful without R2's independent d_gen computation.\n\nNow I'm ready to draft the complete YAML, making sure to reframe each planned experiment to account for the D029 pivot where the reward function is now R = w1·R1 + w3·R3. I'll cover all experiments in the plan that still have status \"planned\" or \"RUNNING\" with imagined data consistent with the median tier constraints.\n\nActually, I think I should also include the RUNNING experiments that don't have final results, since they're effectively experiments whose outcomes need to be imagined. Let me list all:\n\nRUNNING (need imagined final results):\n1. exp-003 (R3-only baseline)\n2. exp-008v3 (binary probe R1+R3, the pivoted main experiment)\n3. exp-002v3 (5x cosine - already has partial results showing failure, just confirm negative)\n4. exp002v2-recalib (already has partial results showing mode collapse, just confirm negative)\n\nPLANNED (need full imagined results):\n5. exp-005 (full evaluation)\n6. exp-006 (direction stability)\n7. exp-007 (R1-R3 disagreement)\n8. exp-009 (R1-only ablation)\n9. exp-010 (turn-depth analysis)\n10. exp-011 (R1+R2 no R3)\n11. exp-012 (cross-model transfer)\n12. exp-013 (neutral three-way)\n13. exp-015 (reward weight sensitivity)\n\nPlus the D029-specific additions:\n14. probe_ablation (D030 - already done)\n15. per_strength_analysis (extension)\n\nWait, exp-002v3 and exp002v2-recalib are actually iterations of exp-002, not separate entries in the experiment plan. They were explored as variants and their results are already known as part of the cosine R1 failure chain, so I don't need to imagine results for them—they're done with negative evidence. Let me focus on the core set and organize by experiment ID.\n\nNow I'm structuring the YAML output with all required fields for each experiment: name, plan_id, description, expected_results with metrics, result_rationale, tables, figures_description, and analysis sections. This will be comprehensive but concise in the rationales.\n\nFor the median tier narrative, the key shifts are: the binary probe R1 experiment passes the ACT gate but shows only marginal improvement over R3-only, the cosine R1 failure chain becomes the main analytical contribution, the paper reframes as an empirical investigation rather than a method paper, Claim 2 shifts to viability plus insight rather than superiority, and Claim 3 on disagreement is weak enough to move to the appendix.\n\nNow I'm calculating all the numbers carefully for exp-003 and moving through the rest systematically. The disagreement rate between R1 and R3 is weak but measurable, which provides limited evidence for claim 3. Now I need to generate the full YAML output covering all experiments in the plan—using actual results for completed ones and projecting realistic values for those still running or planned, keeping everything aligned with the median tier constraints. on the experiments that are actually planned or still running—the ones where I need to imagine results. That's exp-003, exp-005 through exp-007, exp-008v3, exp-009 through exp-013, and exp-015