{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CkKkaT33rdxqFe1anGZqLi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"基于所有 done/running/planned 实验的状态和 D029 pivot 上下文，我来生成 median 档的完整 imagined experiments。需要先确认几个关键数字的一致性。\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Binary probe R1 过 ACT gate (SYCONScore 0.367 > 0.301)，但对 R3-only 的边际提升有限 (Δ=0.050, p≈0.12)。\n  R3-only baseline 出乎意料地强 (SYCONScore 0.317)，NLI 行为信号已覆盖大部分 sycophancy 检测。\n  论文重心从 \"method paper\" 转向 \"empirical investigation\"：\n  cosine R1 的 4-experiment failure chain + 结构性根因分析 (discriminability ≠ reward utility) 成为核心贡献 (Section 4-5)，\n  binary probe 作为 proof-of-concept 验证 binarization insight (Section 6)。\n  Claim 2 降级为 \"method viability + key insight\"，Claim 3 (R1-R3 disagreement 4.5%) 降为 appendix。\n  补充实验加固分析贡献：probe ablation (D030 已完成), reward weight sensitivity, per-strength analysis。\n  Paper framing: \"An Empirical Investigation of Representation-to-Reward Transfer in Anti-Sycophancy Training\"。\n  目标 EMNLP main，预期 score 3.5-4.0。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  # RUNNING — 等待最终评估\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  - name: r3_only_baseline\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      R3-only GRPO baseline，仅用 NLI behavioral reward，无 R1/R2。\n      D027 unified eval (ToF/NoF/SYCONScore)。3 seeds 报告 mean ± std。\n    expected_results:\n      seed_0:\n        ToF: 0.205\n        NoF: 0.808\n        SYCONScore: 0.326\n        best_checkpoint: checkpoint-6000\n      seed_1:\n        ToF: 0.188\n        NoF: 0.831\n        SYCONScore: 0.306\n        best_checkpoint: checkpoint-5000\n      seed_2:\n        ToF: 0.198\n        NoF: 0.818\n        SYCONScore: 0.318\n        best_checkpoint: checkpoint-6000\n      mean:\n        ToF: 0.197\n        NoF: 0.819\n        SYCONScore: 0.317\n      std:\n        ToF: 0.009\n        NoF: 0.012\n        SYCONScore: 0.010\n      training_steps: 8000\n      mt_bench: 7.62\n      mmlu: 0.629\n    result_rationale: >\n      R3-only 在 median 档下表现出乎意料地强。SYCONScore 0.317 已超过 ACT best (0.301)，\n      原因是 NLI behavioral reward 与 D027 评估框架存在 metric alignment——R3 直接优化 NLI 一致性，\n      而 D027 的 ToF/NoF 本身基于 NLI 判断。ToF 达 0.197 (vs ACT 0.182, +1.5pp)，\n      说明 NLI reward 能部分区分 \"合理修正\" 和 \"无理迎合\" (通过 entailment 关系评估)，\n      不像 ACT 的 L2 consistency loss 无差别惩罚所有 activation 变化。\n      NoF 0.819 低于 ACT 的 0.867，但 harmonic mean 组合使 R3-only 总分更高。\n      这一结果严重压缩了 probe R1 的叙事空间：Δ SYCONScore 仅 ~5pp，\n      在 3 seeds 下可能不具统计显著性。\n      MT-Bench 降幅仅 -0.23 (vs Vanilla 7.85)，R3 训练信号保守，通用能力扰动小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: R3-only per-seed Results\"\n        columns: [seed, checkpoint, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore]\n        rows:\n          - [seed_0, ckpt-6000, 0.205, 0.808, 0.326]\n          - [seed_1, ckpt-5000, 0.188, 0.831, 0.306]\n          - [seed_2, ckpt-6000, 0.198, 0.818, 0.318]\n          - [\"mean±std\", \"—\", \"0.197±0.009\", \"0.819±0.012\", \"0.317±0.010\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"R3-only SYCONScore training curve (3 seeds, shaded std)：前 3000 步快速上升，4000-6000 步 plateau，best checkpoint 在 5000-6000 步区间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R3-only 的强势是 median 档核心挑战。论文不能依赖 \"R3 不够好\" 的假设，\n      而必须转向 \"R3 已经很好，probe R1 的价值在理解层面 (binarization insight) 而非大幅性能提升\"。\n      关键防线：R3 受限于 NLI 评分器能力——masked sycophancy (表面正确但内部迎合) 完全逃逸 R3 检测。\n\n  - name: binary_probe_r1_main\n    plan_id: exp-008v3\n    description: >\n      Binary probe R1 + R3 GRPO 训练 (D029 pivoted main experiment)。\n      R1 = probe(h; d_syc) ∈ {0,1}，R = w1·R1 + w3·R3 (w1=0.3, w3=0.7, R2 disabled)。\n      Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64。1 seed (时间限制)，D027 unified eval。\n    expected_results:\n      best_checkpoint: checkpoint-4500\n      training_steps: 6000\n      eval_at_best:\n        ToF: 0.241\n        NoF: 0.783\n        SYCONScore: 0.367\n      eval_at_final:\n        ToF: 0.238\n        NoF: 0.775\n        SYCONScore: 0.359\n      training_progression:\n        step_1000: {ToF: 0.165, NoF: 0.852, SYCONScore: 0.278, R1_mean: 0.73, entropy: 2.41}\n        step_2000: {ToF: 0.208, NoF: 0.815, SYCONScore: 0.332, R1_mean: 0.71, entropy: 2.18}\n        step_3000: {ToF: 0.228, NoF: 0.795, SYCONScore: 0.351, R1_mean: 0.69, entropy: 2.01}\n        step_4000: {ToF: 0.237, NoF: 0.788, SYCONScore: 0.362, R1_mean: 0.67, entropy: 1.91}\n        step_4500: {ToF: 0.241, NoF: 0.783, SYCONScore: 0.367, R1_mean: 0.66, entropy: 1.87}\n        step_6000: {ToF: 0.238, NoF: 0.775, SYCONScore: 0.359, R1_mean: 0.64, entropy: 1.82}\n      mt_bench: 7.51\n      mmlu: 0.626\n      delta_vs_r3only_SYCONScore: 0.050\n      delta_vs_ACT_SYCONScore: 0.066\n      passes_ACT_gate: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      SYCONScore 0.367 过 ACT gate (>0.301, Δ=+0.066)，但对 R3-only (0.317) 的边际提升仅 +0.050。\n      1 seed 下无法做 probe vs R3-only 显著性检验 (需 3 seeds)。\n      ToF 提升 (+4.4pp vs R3-only) 是主要收益：probe R1 在 valid evidence 场景给正奖励，\n      鼓励正当信念修正——这正是 cosine R1 无法做到的 (cosine 对所有 \"信念变化\" 给负奖励)。\n      NoF 轻微下降 (-3.6pp vs R3-only)：probe 约 3-5% 误分类率导致部分 invalid evidence 样本\n      被错误标记为 \"genuine revision\"，削弱了抵抗力。\n      R1 reward 均值从 0.73 (step 1000) 缓降至 0.64 (final)，反映 d_syc 方向在训练后期\n      与 probe decision boundary 的 alignment 退化 (exp-006 AUROC 从 0.835→0.78)。\n      训练在 4500 步最优，之后 SYCONScore 微降——probe R1 信号后期变 noisy。\n      Entropy 1.82、response length ~245 tokens 均健康，无 mode collapse\n      (对比 exp-014 continuous probe 的 entropy 0.025 catastrophic collapse)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: exp-008v3 vs All Baselines\"\n        columns: [Method, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore, \"Δ SYCONScore\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.111, 0.923, 0.197, \"-0.170\"]\n          - [ACT (ckpt-8000), 0.182, 0.867, 0.301, \"-0.066\"]\n          - [\"R3-only (mean)\", 0.197, 0.819, 0.317, \"-0.050\"]\n          - [\"Probe R1+R3 (ckpt-4500)\", 0.241, 0.783, 0.367, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"SYCONScore training curve：前 2000 步快速攀升 (0.28→0.33)，2000-4500 步稳步提升 (0.33→0.367)，4500 步后轻微回落。\"\n      - \"ToF vs NoF scatter (4 methods)：Probe R1+R3 在 ToF 轴最右 (最高修正率)，NoF 轴中间位置。ACT 在 NoF 轴最高但 ToF 最低。连接各方法形成 Pareto frontier。\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-008v3 成功验证 binarization insight：binary probe R1 提供有效 GRPO reward (R1 mean 0.64-0.73)，\n      而同一 d_syc 方向的 cosine 投影完全失败 (exp-002v2 R1≈0, exp-002v3 strong evidence R1=-0.305)。\n      但 median 档核心问题是 Δ vs R3-only 仅 0.050，不具统计显著性。\n      论文不能宣称 \"probe R1 显著优于 R3-only\"，只能说 \"binary probe R1 是有效的 representation-level reward，\n      验证了 binarization 作为 discriminability→reward 转化桥梁的必要性\"。\n      核心卖点从 method performance 转向 binarization insight：AUROC 0.82 (discriminability) ≠ reward utility (cosine fails)，binarization bridges the gap。\n\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  # PLANNED — 完整预测\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  - name: full_evaluation\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      所有方法在 D027 unified eval + 通用 benchmark 上的完整评估。\n      方法：Vanilla, ACT, R3-only, Probe R1+R3。\n      D029 后不再包括 cosine R1 (killed) 和 continuous probe (killed)，\n      它们在 Section 4-5 作为 negative evidence 呈现。\n    expected_results:\n      main_table:\n        Vanilla: {ToF: 0.111, NoF: 0.923, SYCONScore: 0.197, MT_Bench: 7.85, MMLU: 0.632}\n        ACT: {ToF: 0.182, NoF: 0.867, SYCONScore: 0.301, MT_Bench: 7.38, MMLU: 0.624}\n        R3_only: {ToF: 0.197, NoF: 0.819, SYCONScore: 0.317, MT_Bench: 7.62, MMLU: 0.629}\n        Probe_R1_R3: {ToF: 0.241, NoF: 0.783, SYCONScore: 0.367, MT_Bench: 7.51, MMLU: 0.626}\n      pairwise_significance:\n        probe_vs_vanilla_p: 0.002\n        probe_vs_ACT_p: 0.04\n        probe_vs_r3only_p: 0.12\n        r3only_vs_ACT_p: 0.31\n        r3only_vs_vanilla_p: 0.005\n      notes: >\n        p-values based on bootstrap resampling (n=1000).\n        Probe vs R3-only comparison underpowered: 1 seed (probe) vs 3 seeds (R3-only).\n    result_rationale: >\n      主结果表呈现清晰层次：Vanilla < ACT ≤ R3-only < Probe R1+R3，\n      但相邻方法间差距不总显著。Probe vs ACT 显著 (p=0.04)：\n      probe 在 ToF 上的优势 (+5.9pp) 补偿了 NoF 损失 (-8.4pp)，harmonic mean 胜出。\n      Probe vs R3-only 不显著 (p=0.12)：Δ=0.050 在 1v3 seeds 对比下 power 不足。\n      R3-only vs ACT 不显著 (p=0.31)：两者 SYCONScore 接近 (0.317 vs 0.301)。\n      MT-Bench 排序与 anti-sycophancy 强度负相关：Vanilla 7.85 > R3-only 7.62 > Probe 7.51 > ACT 7.38，\n      probe R1+R3 的 MT-Bench 降幅 (-0.34) 小于 ACT (-0.47)，\n      说明 directed representation constraint 对通用能力比 undirected L2 consistency 更友好。\n      MMLU 差异可忽略 (所有方法 ≤ 0.8pp 差距)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Main Results (Section 6)\"\n        columns: [Method, \"ToF ↑\", \"NoF ↑\", \"SYCONScore ↑\", MT-Bench, MMLU]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.111, 0.923, 0.197, 7.85, 0.632]\n          - [ACT, 0.182, 0.867, 0.301, 7.38, 0.624]\n          - [R3-only, \"0.197±.009\", \"0.819±.012\", \"0.317±.010\", 7.62, 0.629]\n          - [Probe R1+R3, 0.241, 0.783, 0.367, 7.51, 0.626]\n      - name: \"Table: Pairwise Significance\"\n        columns: [Comparison, \"Δ SYCONScore\", p-value, \"sig (α=0.05)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Probe vs Vanilla, +0.170, 0.002, \"Yes\"]\n          - [Probe vs ACT, +0.066, 0.04, \"Yes\"]\n          - [Probe vs R3-only, +0.050, 0.12, \"No\"]\n          - [R3-only vs ACT, +0.016, 0.31, \"No\"]\n          - [R3-only vs Vanilla, +0.120, 0.005, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"主结果柱状图 (4 methods × SYCONScore/ToF/NoF)：Probe R1+R3 的 SYCONScore bar 最高但与 R3-only 差距视觉上不大。\"\n      - \"ToF vs NoF scatter + Pareto frontier：Probe 位于 frontier 上 (最佳 tradeoff)，ACT 远离 frontier (高 NoF 低 ToF)。\"\n      - \"MT-Bench vs SYCONScore scatter：R3-only 和 Probe 均在 frontier 附近，ACT 被 dominated。\"\n    analysis: >\n      主表是 Section 6 核心。Median 档叙事策略：\n      (1) Probe R1+R3 SYCONScore 最佳，显著优于 ACT 和 Vanilla——binarization insight 实际可行；\n      (2) vs R3-only 不显著——这不是方法失败，而是 Section 4-5 分析贡献的支撑：\n      discriminability ≠ reward utility 意味着 representation-level reward 的边际价值有限\n      当 behavioral reward 已经 well-aligned 时；\n      (3) Section 6 定位为 proof-of-concept 而非 headline result。\n\n  - name: direction_stability_monitoring\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      exp-008v3 训练过程中每 500 步监控 d_syc 方向稳定性：\n      cosine similarity with initial direction、held-out probe AUROC。\n    expected_results:\n      stability_curve:\n        step_0: {cosine: 1.00, probe_AUROC: 0.835}\n        step_500: {cosine: 0.96, probe_AUROC: 0.830}\n        step_1000: {cosine: 0.93, probe_AUROC: 0.822}\n        step_2000: {cosine: 0.89, probe_AUROC: 0.810}\n        step_3000: {cosine: 0.86, probe_AUROC: 0.800}\n        step_4000: {cosine: 0.84, probe_AUROC: 0.790}\n        step_5000: {cosine: 0.83, probe_AUROC: 0.785}\n        step_6000: {cosine: 0.82, probe_AUROC: 0.780}\n      auroc_total_drift: -0.055\n      cosine_total_drift: -0.18\n      recalibration_triggered: 0\n      recalibration_threshold: 0.70\n    result_rationale: >\n      方向漂移模式与 D025 已知数据一致：cosine 从 1.0 单调降至 0.82，前 2000 步最快 (Δ=-0.11)\n      因为 LoRA 参数变化最剧烈，4000 步后减速趋稳 (Δ=-0.02/1000步)。\n      Probe AUROC 从 0.835 降至 0.780 (Δ=-0.055)，落在 median 档 [0.76, 0.80] 内。\n      AUROC 降幅 (6pp) 远小于 cosine 降幅 (18pp)，说明方向旋转中大量是 \"无害旋转\"——\n      正交于判别超平面的分量。Probe decision boundary 比 raw direction 更稳定。\n      未触发 0.70 重校准阈值，但 AUROC 退化是真实的——解释了 exp-008v3 后期 R1 reward\n      均值下降 (0.73→0.64) 和 SYCONScore 轻微回落。\n      在 median 档下，退化可控但非 trivial，需要在论文中如实报告。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Direction Stability (exp-008v3 training)\"\n        columns: [step, cosine_w_init, probe_AUROC, recalibrated]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 1.00, 0.835, \"—\"]\n          - [500, 0.96, 0.830, \"No\"]\n          - [1000, 0.93, 0.822, \"No\"]\n          - [2000, 0.89, 0.810, \"No\"]\n          - [3000, 0.86, 0.800, \"No\"]\n          - [4000, 0.84, 0.790, \"No\"]\n          - [5000, 0.83, 0.785, \"No\"]\n          - [6000, 0.82, 0.780, \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 y 轴图：左轴 cosine similarity (蓝线, 1.0→0.82)，右轴 probe AUROC (红线, 0.835→0.780)。AUROC 曲线更平缓，说明 probe 比 raw direction 鲁棒。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 1 的 stability 部分成立 (cosine≥0.82, AUROC≥0.78)。\n      论文需报告：(1) 方向缓慢旋转，AUROC 退化 ~6pp；\n      (2) 重校准是安全机制 (即使本次未触发)；\n      (3) probe decision boundary 比方向本身更稳——binarization 的额外好处。\n      这增加了方法复杂度但提供了 analysis point。\n\n  - name: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      分析 exp-008v3 训练过程中 probe R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式。\n      R1=syc & R3=correct (masked sycophancy 候选) 需 > 5% 以支撑 Claim 3。\n    expected_results:\n      total_samples_analyzed: 3600\n      agreement_rate: 0.955\n      total_disagreement_rate: 0.045\n      r1_syc_r3_correct:\n        count: 97\n        rate: 0.027\n      r1_correct_r3_syc:\n        count: 65\n        rate: 0.018\n      by_evidence_strength:\n        weak: 0.058\n        medium: 0.042\n        strong: 0.031\n      by_turn_depth:\n        turn_2: 0.035\n        turn_3: 0.048\n        turn_4plus: 0.062\n    result_rationale: >\n      4.5% 总体 disagreement 落在 median 档 [3%, 6%] 内但低于 5% 门槛。\n      \"R1=syc, R3=correct\" (masked sycophancy 候选) 仅 2.7%——比例太低，\n      无法支撑 \"probe R1 发现 R3 遗漏的隐藏迎合\" 的强 claim。\n      两个结构化 pattern 有分析价值：\n      (a) 与 evidence strength 负相关 (weak 5.8% > strong 3.1%)——弱证据下 NLI 置信度低，\n      R3 判断模糊，而 probe R1 基于固定 decision boundary 不受影响；\n      (b) 与 turn depth 正相关 (turn 2 3.5% → turn 4+ 6.2%)——深层对话中\n      NLI 评分器面对长上下文准确率下降，probe 基于即时 activation 不受影响。\n      但两个 pattern 的量级有限，不足以作为正式贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown\"\n        columns: [category, count, rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Total samples, 3600, \"—\"]\n          - [Full agreement, 3438, 0.955]\n          - [\"R1=syc & R3=correct\", 97, 0.027]\n          - [\"R1=correct & R3=syc\", 65, 0.018]\n          - [Total disagreement, 162, 0.045]\n      - name: \"Table: Disagreement by Turn Depth\"\n        columns: [turn_depth, n_samples, disagreement_rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Turn 2, 1440, 0.035]\n          - [Turn 3, 1200, 0.048]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", 960, 0.062]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Disagreement rate vs turn depth 柱状图：单调递增，turn 2 vs turn 4+ 的 bootstrap CI 不重叠。\"\n      - \"Disagreement rate vs evidence strength 柱状图：单调递减，weak vs strong CI 不重叠。\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.5% 不满足 Claim 3 的 5% 门槛。\n      Claim 3 从 analysis subsection 降为 Appendix C 讨论。\n      主论文一句话：\"R1-R3 disagreement is 4.5%, below the 5% threshold\n      for claiming diagnostic utility; structured patterns by turn depth\n      and evidence strength are reported in Appendix C.\"\n\n  - name: ablation_r1_only\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      Probe R1-only ablation：仅用 binary probe reward, 无 R3 behavioral safety net。\n      从 exp-008v3 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉, 短程训练 ~2000 步。\n    expected_results:\n      best_step: 3200\n      eval_at_best:\n        ToF: 0.208\n        NoF: 0.762\n        SYCONScore: 0.327\n      eval_at_final:\n        ToF: 0.201\n        NoF: 0.748\n        SYCONScore: 0.316\n      training_entropy_final: 1.54\n      mean_response_length_final: 198\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe R1-only SYCONScore 0.327 高于 Vanilla (0.197, Δ=+0.130)，\n      证明 probe R1 包含独立训练信号。但低于 R1+R3 组合 (0.367, Δ=-0.040)。\n      缺少 R3 安全网后 NoF 下降显著 (0.762 vs 0.783, -2.1pp)——probe 误分类无 R3 兜底。\n      ToF 也更低 (0.208 vs 0.241, -3.3pp)——反直觉但合理：R3 的 NLI reward 在\n      valid evidence 场景中提供 \"这次修正是对的\" 的确认信号，缺失后模型对所有修正更 hedging。\n      Entropy 偏低 (1.54 vs 1.82)：probe R1 alone 的 reward landscape 更尖锐，GRPO 探索受限。\n      R1-only (0.327) 与 R3-only (0.317) SYCONScore 接近——\n      两种信号源 (representation vs behavior) 独立贡献大致相当，但组合有超线性收益。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: R1-only Ablation\"\n        columns: [Method, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore, entropy]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.111, 0.923, 0.197, 2.85]\n          - [R3-only, 0.197, 0.819, 0.317, 2.12]\n          - [Probe R1-only, 0.208, 0.762, 0.327, 1.54]\n          - [Probe R1+R3, 0.241, 0.783, 0.367, 1.82]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Ablation cascade 柱状图 (SYCONScore)：R3-only 和 R1-only 几乎等高 (0.317 vs 0.327)，R1+R3 明显更高 (0.367)。视觉强调组合的超线性收益。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R1-only ablation 在论文中支撑两个论点：\n      (1) Probe R1 有独立训练信号 (vs Vanilla +13pp)；\n      (2) R1 和 R3 互补——R1+R3 (0.367) > max(R1-only 0.327, R3-only 0.317)。\n      R1-only ≈ R3-only 强化 median 档叙事：两种信号独立贡献相当，组合收益有限但一致。\n\n  - name: turn_depth_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 probe R1+R3 vs baselines。\n      验证 probe R1 在深层 commitment 中是否优势放大。\n    expected_results:\n      by_method_and_depth:\n        Vanilla: {turn_2: 0.228, turn_3: 0.189, turn_4plus: 0.152}\n        ACT: {turn_2: 0.328, turn_3: 0.295, turn_4plus: 0.264}\n        R3_only: {turn_2: 0.355, turn_3: 0.311, turn_4plus: 0.268}\n        Probe_R1_R3: {turn_2: 0.401, turn_3: 0.359, turn_4plus: 0.312}\n      probe_advantage_vs_r3only:\n        turn_2_pp: 4.6\n        turn_3_pp: 4.8\n        turn_4plus_pp: 4.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有方法 SYCONScore 随 turn depth 下降 (commitment 越深越难正确应对)。\n      Probe R1+R3 的优势在各深度大致恒定 (~4.4-4.8pp)，未如 best 档预期在深层 turns 放大。\n      原因：d_syc 在 fixed-length 校准数据上计算，turn 4+ 长上下文中 activation pattern 偏移，\n      probe accuracy 同样下降——probe 的优势是 turn-depth-invariant 而非 amplified。\n      R3-only 在 turn 4+ 退化 (-0.087 from turn 2) 和 probe (-0.089) 降幅几乎相同。\n      \"Multi-turn 是 probe 甜蜜点\" 的叙事在 median 档下不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SYCONScore by Turn Depth\"\n        columns: [Method, Turn_2, Turn_3, \"Turn_4+\", \"Δ(turn2→4+)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.228, 0.189, 0.152, -0.076]\n          - [ACT, 0.328, 0.295, 0.264, -0.064]\n          - [R3-only, 0.355, 0.311, 0.268, -0.087]\n          - [Probe R1+R3, 0.401, 0.359, 0.312, -0.089]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"折线图 SYCONScore vs turn depth (4 methods)：所有线下降，线间距大致恒定——没有在深层 turns 拉开差距。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Turn-depth 分析不支持 \"multi-turn advantage amplification\" 叙事。\n      但提供另一个 finding：probe R1 优势是 turn-depth-invariant，\n      说明 representation-level signal 不因 context length 退化——\n      而 behavioral signal (R3) 的 NLI 模型可能随 context 长度退化。\n      在 Section 6 作为补充分析，支撑 \"representation signal is robust to context length\" 的温和 claim。\n\n  - name: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      D029 pivot 后 R2 已 disabled。此实验变为冗余 (等价于 exp-009 probe R1-only)。\n    expected_results:\n      status: REDUNDANT_POST_D029\n      recommendation: >\n        合并入 exp-015 reward weight sensitivity 中 w1=0.8/w3=0.2 极端配置。\n    result_rationale: >\n      D029 pivot 禁用 R2 (rank-based contrastive reward)。\n      原始设计 (R1+R2 without R3) 退化为 R1-only (与 exp-009 相同)，\n      单独运行无新增信息量。功能合并入 exp-015 极端权重配置。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      标记为 SKIP。如 reviewer 问 R2，回答：\n      \"R2 在 binary probe 框架下冗余——probe 已将 d_syc 方向信息 binarize，\n      rank-based contrastive 无法提供超越 probe decision boundary 的额外信息。\"\n\n  - name: cross_model_transfer\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Phase A: Llama-3-8B 上计算 d_syc + 训练 probe, 报告 AUROC。\n      Phase B (if AUROC > 0.75): 短程 binary probe R1+R3 GRPO (~3000 步)。\n    expected_results:\n      phase_a:\n        auroc: 0.78\n        auroc_ci_95: [0.74, 0.82]\n        best_layer: L17\n        probe_auroc: 0.79\n      phase_a_gate: PASS\n      phase_b:\n        best_checkpoint: step_2500\n        ToF: 0.212\n        NoF: 0.770\n        SYCONScore: 0.331\n      cross_model_direction:\n        cosine_qwen_llama: 0.28\n        transfer_auroc_qwen_on_llama: 0.61\n        transfer_auroc_llama_on_qwen: 0.63\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3-8B d_syc AUROC 0.78 通过 0.75 gate，但低于 Qwen3 的 0.826 (~4.6pp)——\n      模型族差异导致表征空间几何不同，但 \"mid-layer 存在 sycophancy 判别方向\" 跨模型普遍。\n      Peak layer L17 (Qwen3 在 L19)，差异反映架构细节 (Llama GQA, Qwen RoPE 实现不同)。\n      Phase B SYCONScore 0.331 (vs 估算 Llama Vanilla ~0.21, Δ=+0.12)，\n      框架跨模型可迁移但效果打折 (Qwen3 上 0.367)。\n      跨模型方向 cosine 仅 0.28——方向是 model-specific。\n      Transfer AUROC 0.61 高于 random 但远低于 native (0.79)——\n      不同模型编码 sycophancy 的\"方向不同但现象相同\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [metric, Qwen3-8B, Llama-3-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [d_syc AUROC, 0.826, 0.78]\n          - [Probe AUROC, 0.835, 0.79]\n          - [Best layer, L19, L17]\n          - [Probe R1+R3 SYCONScore, 0.367, 0.331]\n      - name: \"Table: Direction Transfer Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"source → target\", AUROC, cosine]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3 → Qwen3\", 0.835, 1.00]\n          - [\"Llama3 → Llama3\", 0.79, 1.00]\n          - [\"Qwen3 → Llama3\", 0.61, 0.28]\n          - [\"Llama3 → Qwen3\", 0.63, 0.28]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双模型 layer progression 曲线：两条 S 形曲线形状相似，Llama3 整体偏低 ~4pp，peak 偏早 2 层。\"\n      - \"Direction transfer heatmap (2×2)：对角线高 (0.84/0.79)，off-diagonal 低但 >0.50 (0.61/0.63)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      部分回应 \"single model\" critique。论文声称：\n      (1) sycophancy 方向判别跨模型普遍存在；\n      (2) binary probe R1+R3 框架跨模型有效；\n      (3) 方向不可直接迁移，需 per-model 校准。\n      Honest limitation 而非 weakness。Phase B SYCONScore 0.331 vs Llama Vanilla ~0.21 是强 evidence。\n\n  - name: neutral_baseline_three_way\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      D029 后 R2 disabled，优先级大幅降低。\n      仅作几何理解贡献：计算独立 d_gen, 分析与 d_syc 的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      d_syc_d_gen_cosine: -0.74\n      angular_separation_degrees: 42\n      d_gen_independent_auroc: 0.73\n      d_syc_auroc: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      d_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine=-0.74 (而非退化值 -1.0)，\n      存在 ~42° 偏差——sycophantic 和 genuine 方向不完全反对称。\n      d_gen AUROC 0.73 低于 d_syc 0.83：genuine revision 的表征信号更弱更分散，\n      模型对 \"被正确说服\" 的内部表征不如 \"迎合施压\" 清晰。\n      在 R2 disabled 框架下纯粹是 understanding 贡献：解释为什么 probe 只需 d_syc，\n      不需要独立 d_gen。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Three-way Direction Geometry\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cosine(d_syc, d_gen_indep)\", -0.74]\n          - [angular separation, \"42°\"]\n          - [d_syc AUROC, 0.83]\n          - [d_gen independent AUROC, 0.73]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2D PCA 投影：d_syc, -d_syc, d_gen_independent 三个方向。d_gen 与 -d_syc 接近但有 ~42° 偏转。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix 级 supplementary geometry analysis。\n      主论文一句话引用：\"d_syc and independently computed d_gen are near-anti-parallel\n      (cosine=-0.74), confirming the binary framing captures most directional structure.\"\n\n  - name: reward_weight_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      D029 后仅 w1 (probe R1) 和 w3 (R3) 两个权重 (w3=1-w1)。\n      5 组配置：w1 ∈ {0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.5, 0.8}。\n      从 exp-008v3 step 2000 分叉, 每组 ~2000 步短程训练。\n    expected_results:\n      configs:\n        w1_01: {ToF: 0.200, NoF: 0.815, SYCONScore: 0.321, entropy: 2.10}\n        w1_02: {ToF: 0.222, NoF: 0.798, SYCONScore: 0.347, entropy: 1.95}\n        w1_03: {ToF: 0.241, NoF: 0.783, SYCONScore: 0.367, entropy: 1.82}\n        w1_05: {ToF: 0.248, NoF: 0.752, SYCONScore: 0.373, entropy: 1.58}\n        w1_08: {ToF: 0.185, NoF: 0.648, SYCONScore: 0.288, entropy: 1.12}\n      robust_range: \"w1 ∈ [0.2, 0.5], SYCONScore ∈ [0.347, 0.373], range = 2.6pp\"\n      best_config: \"w1=0.5\"\n      default_config: \"w1=0.3\"\n      failure_mode: \"w1=0.8 → entropy collapse (1.12), NoF drops to 0.648, probe errors dominate\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      SYCONScore 在 w1=0.2-0.5 范围内稳健 (range 2.6pp)，证明非 cherry-pick。\n      w1=0.5 marginal best (0.373 vs default 0.367)——SYCONScore plateau 效应：\n      w1 从 0.3→0.5 时 ToF 继续上升 (+0.7pp) 但 NoF 加速下降 (-3.1pp)，harmonic mean 近似持平。\n      Default w1=0.3 不是绝对最优但处于 plateau 内，且 entropy (1.82) 比 w1=0.5 (1.58) 更健康。\n      w1=0.1 退化温和 (0.321)，接近 R3-only (0.317)——probe 信号被淹没。\n      w1=0.8 严重退化 (0.288 < R3-only)：entropy collapse (1.12)，probe 误分类被极度放大，\n      模型学会 \"游戏\" probe decision boundary 而非真正改善 sycophancy behavior。\n      NoF 0.648 甚至低于 Vanilla，说明极端 R1 权重适得其反。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Reward Weight Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [w1, w3, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore, entropy]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, 0.9, 0.200, 0.815, 0.321, 2.10]\n          - [0.2, 0.8, 0.222, 0.798, 0.347, 1.95]\n          - [\"**0.3**\", \"**0.7**\", \"**0.241**\", \"**0.783**\", \"**0.367**\", \"**1.82**\"]\n          - [0.5, 0.5, 0.248, 0.752, 0.373, 1.58]\n          - [0.8, 0.2, 0.185, 0.648, 0.288, 1.12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"SYCONScore vs w1 曲线：w1=0.1-0.5 上升后 plateau (peak at 0.5)，w1=0.8 急剧下降。inverted-J shape。\"\n      - \"Entropy vs w1 曲线：单调递减，w1=0.8 处 entropy 近 mode collapse 阈值。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix E 完整表格，主论文一句话：\n      \"Sensitivity analysis confirms robustness across w1 ∈ [0.2, 0.5]\n      (SYCONScore range 2.6pp); extreme w1=0.8 causes entropy collapse.\"\n      关键 reviewer 防御：结果非 cherry-pick，合理权重范围内均有效。\n```\n\n**验证约束一致性**:\n- exp_008v3 SYCONScore = 0.367 ∈ [0.31, 0.38] ✓\n- exp_003 SYCONScore = 0.317 ∈ [0.27, 0.35] ✓\n- Δ probe vs R3-only = 0.050 ∈ [0.01, 0.08] ✓\n- Δ probe vs ACT = 0.066 ∈ [0.005, 0.08] ✓\n- exp_008v3 ToF = 0.241 ∈ [0.2, 0.28] ✓\n- exp_008v3 NoF = 0.783 ∈ [0.72, 0.82] ✓\n- direction AUROC endtrain = 0.78 ∈ [0.76, 0.8] ✓\n- R1-R3 disagreement = 0.045 ∈ [0.03, 0.06] ✓\n\n**与前版 dream 的关键差异**: D029 pivot 根本改变了实验格局——cosine R1 (exp-002 系列) 从主方法变为负面证据，binary probe (exp-008v3) 成为 proof-of-concept，R2 被禁用使 exp-011/exp-013 优先级骤降。exp-014 的实际结果 (mode collapse) 与前版 dream 预测 (continuous probe ≈ DC-GRPO) 完全不同，进一步验证了 binarization 的必要性。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4363,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33015,"cache_read_input_tokens":34296,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33015},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1166f424-4351-4e3b-9c15-33b8cbac02ad","uuid":"31634b9e-aa03-4111-b176-5b55700b56ff"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":853678,"duration_api_ms":855164,"num_turns":6,"result":"基于所有 done/running/planned 实验的状态和 D029 pivot 上下文，我来生成 median 档的完整 imagined experiments。需要先确认几个关键数字的一致性。\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Binary probe R1 过 ACT gate (SYCONScore 0.367 > 0.301)，但对 R3-only 的边际提升有限 (Δ=0.050, p≈0.12)。\n  R3-only baseline 出乎意料地强 (SYCONScore 0.317)，NLI 行为信号已覆盖大部分 sycophancy 检测。\n  论文重心从 \"method paper\" 转向 \"empirical investigation\"：\n  cosine R1 的 4-experiment failure chain + 结构性根因分析 (discriminability ≠ reward utility) 成为核心贡献 (Section 4-5)，\n  binary probe 作为 proof-of-concept 验证 binarization insight (Section 6)。\n  Claim 2 降级为 \"method viability + key insight\"，Claim 3 (R1-R3 disagreement 4.5%) 降为 appendix。\n  补充实验加固分析贡献：probe ablation (D030 已完成), reward weight sensitivity, per-strength analysis。\n  Paper framing: \"An Empirical Investigation of Representation-to-Reward Transfer in Anti-Sycophancy Training\"。\n  目标 EMNLP main，预期 score 3.5-4.0。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  # RUNNING — 等待最终评估\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  - name: r3_only_baseline\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      R3-only GRPO baseline，仅用 NLI behavioral reward，无 R1/R2。\n      D027 unified eval (ToF/NoF/SYCONScore)。3 seeds 报告 mean ± std。\n    expected_results:\n      seed_0:\n        ToF: 0.205\n        NoF: 0.808\n        SYCONScore: 0.326\n        best_checkpoint: checkpoint-6000\n      seed_1:\n        ToF: 0.188\n        NoF: 0.831\n        SYCONScore: 0.306\n        best_checkpoint: checkpoint-5000\n      seed_2:\n        ToF: 0.198\n        NoF: 0.818\n        SYCONScore: 0.318\n        best_checkpoint: checkpoint-6000\n      mean:\n        ToF: 0.197\n        NoF: 0.819\n        SYCONScore: 0.317\n      std:\n        ToF: 0.009\n        NoF: 0.012\n        SYCONScore: 0.010\n      training_steps: 8000\n      mt_bench: 7.62\n      mmlu: 0.629\n    result_rationale: >\n      R3-only 在 median 档下表现出乎意料地强。SYCONScore 0.317 已超过 ACT best (0.301)，\n      原因是 NLI behavioral reward 与 D027 评估框架存在 metric alignment——R3 直接优化 NLI 一致性，\n      而 D027 的 ToF/NoF 本身基于 NLI 判断。ToF 达 0.197 (vs ACT 0.182, +1.5pp)，\n      说明 NLI reward 能部分区分 \"合理修正\" 和 \"无理迎合\" (通过 entailment 关系评估)，\n      不像 ACT 的 L2 consistency loss 无差别惩罚所有 activation 变化。\n      NoF 0.819 低于 ACT 的 0.867，但 harmonic mean 组合使 R3-only 总分更高。\n      这一结果严重压缩了 probe R1 的叙事空间：Δ SYCONScore 仅 ~5pp，\n      在 3 seeds 下可能不具统计显著性。\n      MT-Bench 降幅仅 -0.23 (vs Vanilla 7.85)，R3 训练信号保守，通用能力扰动小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: R3-only per-seed Results\"\n        columns: [seed, checkpoint, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore]\n        rows:\n          - [seed_0, ckpt-6000, 0.205, 0.808, 0.326]\n          - [seed_1, ckpt-5000, 0.188, 0.831, 0.306]\n          - [seed_2, ckpt-6000, 0.198, 0.818, 0.318]\n          - [\"mean±std\", \"—\", \"0.197±0.009\", \"0.819±0.012\", \"0.317±0.010\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"R3-only SYCONScore training curve (3 seeds, shaded std)：前 3000 步快速上升，4000-6000 步 plateau，best checkpoint 在 5000-6000 步区间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R3-only 的强势是 median 档核心挑战。论文不能依赖 \"R3 不够好\" 的假设，\n      而必须转向 \"R3 已经很好，probe R1 的价值在理解层面 (binarization insight) 而非大幅性能提升\"。\n      关键防线：R3 受限于 NLI 评分器能力——masked sycophancy (表面正确但内部迎合) 完全逃逸 R3 检测。\n\n  - name: binary_probe_r1_main\n    plan_id: exp-008v3\n    description: >\n      Binary probe R1 + R3 GRPO 训练 (D029 pivoted main experiment)。\n      R1 = probe(h; d_syc) ∈ {0,1}，R = w1·R1 + w3·R3 (w1=0.3, w3=0.7, R2 disabled)。\n      Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64。1 seed (时间限制)，D027 unified eval。\n    expected_results:\n      best_checkpoint: checkpoint-4500\n      training_steps: 6000\n      eval_at_best:\n        ToF: 0.241\n        NoF: 0.783\n        SYCONScore: 0.367\n      eval_at_final:\n        ToF: 0.238\n        NoF: 0.775\n        SYCONScore: 0.359\n      training_progression:\n        step_1000: {ToF: 0.165, NoF: 0.852, SYCONScore: 0.278, R1_mean: 0.73, entropy: 2.41}\n        step_2000: {ToF: 0.208, NoF: 0.815, SYCONScore: 0.332, R1_mean: 0.71, entropy: 2.18}\n        step_3000: {ToF: 0.228, NoF: 0.795, SYCONScore: 0.351, R1_mean: 0.69, entropy: 2.01}\n        step_4000: {ToF: 0.237, NoF: 0.788, SYCONScore: 0.362, R1_mean: 0.67, entropy: 1.91}\n        step_4500: {ToF: 0.241, NoF: 0.783, SYCONScore: 0.367, R1_mean: 0.66, entropy: 1.87}\n        step_6000: {ToF: 0.238, NoF: 0.775, SYCONScore: 0.359, R1_mean: 0.64, entropy: 1.82}\n      mt_bench: 7.51\n      mmlu: 0.626\n      delta_vs_r3only_SYCONScore: 0.050\n      delta_vs_ACT_SYCONScore: 0.066\n      passes_ACT_gate: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      SYCONScore 0.367 过 ACT gate (>0.301, Δ=+0.066)，但对 R3-only (0.317) 的边际提升仅 +0.050。\n      1 seed 下无法做 probe vs R3-only 显著性检验 (需 3 seeds)。\n      ToF 提升 (+4.4pp vs R3-only) 是主要收益：probe R1 在 valid evidence 场景给正奖励，\n      鼓励正当信念修正——这正是 cosine R1 无法做到的 (cosine 对所有 \"信念变化\" 给负奖励)。\n      NoF 轻微下降 (-3.6pp vs R3-only)：probe 约 3-5% 误分类率导致部分 invalid evidence 样本\n      被错误标记为 \"genuine revision\"，削弱了抵抗力。\n      R1 reward 均值从 0.73 (step 1000) 缓降至 0.64 (final)，反映 d_syc 方向在训练后期\n      与 probe decision boundary 的 alignment 退化 (exp-006 AUROC 从 0.835→0.78)。\n      训练在 4500 步最优，之后 SYCONScore 微降——probe R1 信号后期变 noisy。\n      Entropy 1.82、response length ~245 tokens 均健康，无 mode collapse\n      (对比 exp-014 continuous probe 的 entropy 0.025 catastrophic collapse)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: exp-008v3 vs All Baselines\"\n        columns: [Method, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore, \"Δ SYCONScore\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.111, 0.923, 0.197, \"-0.170\"]\n          - [ACT (ckpt-8000), 0.182, 0.867, 0.301, \"-0.066\"]\n          - [\"R3-only (mean)\", 0.197, 0.819, 0.317, \"-0.050\"]\n          - [\"Probe R1+R3 (ckpt-4500)\", 0.241, 0.783, 0.367, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"SYCONScore training curve：前 2000 步快速攀升 (0.28→0.33)，2000-4500 步稳步提升 (0.33→0.367)，4500 步后轻微回落。\"\n      - \"ToF vs NoF scatter (4 methods)：Probe R1+R3 在 ToF 轴最右 (最高修正率)，NoF 轴中间位置。ACT 在 NoF 轴最高但 ToF 最低。连接各方法形成 Pareto frontier。\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-008v3 成功验证 binarization insight：binary probe R1 提供有效 GRPO reward (R1 mean 0.64-0.73)，\n      而同一 d_syc 方向的 cosine 投影完全失败 (exp-002v2 R1≈0, exp-002v3 strong evidence R1=-0.305)。\n      但 median 档核心问题是 Δ vs R3-only 仅 0.050，不具统计显著性。\n      论文不能宣称 \"probe R1 显著优于 R3-only\"，只能说 \"binary probe R1 是有效的 representation-level reward，\n      验证了 binarization 作为 discriminability→reward 转化桥梁的必要性\"。\n      核心卖点从 method performance 转向 binarization insight：AUROC 0.82 (discriminability) ≠ reward utility (cosine fails)，binarization bridges the gap。\n\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  # PLANNED — 完整预测\n  # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  - name: full_evaluation\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      所有方法在 D027 unified eval + 通用 benchmark 上的完整评估。\n      方法：Vanilla, ACT, R3-only, Probe R1+R3。\n      D029 后不再包括 cosine R1 (killed) 和 continuous probe (killed)，\n      它们在 Section 4-5 作为 negative evidence 呈现。\n    expected_results:\n      main_table:\n        Vanilla: {ToF: 0.111, NoF: 0.923, SYCONScore: 0.197, MT_Bench: 7.85, MMLU: 0.632}\n        ACT: {ToF: 0.182, NoF: 0.867, SYCONScore: 0.301, MT_Bench: 7.38, MMLU: 0.624}\n        R3_only: {ToF: 0.197, NoF: 0.819, SYCONScore: 0.317, MT_Bench: 7.62, MMLU: 0.629}\n        Probe_R1_R3: {ToF: 0.241, NoF: 0.783, SYCONScore: 0.367, MT_Bench: 7.51, MMLU: 0.626}\n      pairwise_significance:\n        probe_vs_vanilla_p: 0.002\n        probe_vs_ACT_p: 0.04\n        probe_vs_r3only_p: 0.12\n        r3only_vs_ACT_p: 0.31\n        r3only_vs_vanilla_p: 0.005\n      notes: >\n        p-values based on bootstrap resampling (n=1000).\n        Probe vs R3-only comparison underpowered: 1 seed (probe) vs 3 seeds (R3-only).\n    result_rationale: >\n      主结果表呈现清晰层次：Vanilla < ACT ≤ R3-only < Probe R1+R3，\n      但相邻方法间差距不总显著。Probe vs ACT 显著 (p=0.04)：\n      probe 在 ToF 上的优势 (+5.9pp) 补偿了 NoF 损失 (-8.4pp)，harmonic mean 胜出。\n      Probe vs R3-only 不显著 (p=0.12)：Δ=0.050 在 1v3 seeds 对比下 power 不足。\n      R3-only vs ACT 不显著 (p=0.31)：两者 SYCONScore 接近 (0.317 vs 0.301)。\n      MT-Bench 排序与 anti-sycophancy 强度负相关：Vanilla 7.85 > R3-only 7.62 > Probe 7.51 > ACT 7.38，\n      probe R1+R3 的 MT-Bench 降幅 (-0.34) 小于 ACT (-0.47)，\n      说明 directed representation constraint 对通用能力比 undirected L2 consistency 更友好。\n      MMLU 差异可忽略 (所有方法 ≤ 0.8pp 差距)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Main Results (Section 6)\"\n        columns: [Method, \"ToF ↑\", \"NoF ↑\", \"SYCONScore ↑\", MT-Bench, MMLU]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.111, 0.923, 0.197, 7.85, 0.632]\n          - [ACT, 0.182, 0.867, 0.301, 7.38, 0.624]\n          - [R3-only, \"0.197±.009\", \"0.819±.012\", \"0.317±.010\", 7.62, 0.629]\n          - [Probe R1+R3, 0.241, 0.783, 0.367, 7.51, 0.626]\n      - name: \"Table: Pairwise Significance\"\n        columns: [Comparison, \"Δ SYCONScore\", p-value, \"sig (α=0.05)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Probe vs Vanilla, +0.170, 0.002, \"Yes\"]\n          - [Probe vs ACT, +0.066, 0.04, \"Yes\"]\n          - [Probe vs R3-only, +0.050, 0.12, \"No\"]\n          - [R3-only vs ACT, +0.016, 0.31, \"No\"]\n          - [R3-only vs Vanilla, +0.120, 0.005, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"主结果柱状图 (4 methods × SYCONScore/ToF/NoF)：Probe R1+R3 的 SYCONScore bar 最高但与 R3-only 差距视觉上不大。\"\n      - \"ToF vs NoF scatter + Pareto frontier：Probe 位于 frontier 上 (最佳 tradeoff)，ACT 远离 frontier (高 NoF 低 ToF)。\"\n      - \"MT-Bench vs SYCONScore scatter：R3-only 和 Probe 均在 frontier 附近，ACT 被 dominated。\"\n    analysis: >\n      主表是 Section 6 核心。Median 档叙事策略：\n      (1) Probe R1+R3 SYCONScore 最佳，显著优于 ACT 和 Vanilla——binarization insight 实际可行；\n      (2) vs R3-only 不显著——这不是方法失败，而是 Section 4-5 分析贡献的支撑：\n      discriminability ≠ reward utility 意味着 representation-level reward 的边际价值有限\n      当 behavioral reward 已经 well-aligned 时；\n      (3) Section 6 定位为 proof-of-concept 而非 headline result。\n\n  - name: direction_stability_monitoring\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      exp-008v3 训练过程中每 500 步监控 d_syc 方向稳定性：\n      cosine similarity with initial direction、held-out probe AUROC。\n    expected_results:\n      stability_curve:\n        step_0: {cosine: 1.00, probe_AUROC: 0.835}\n        step_500: {cosine: 0.96, probe_AUROC: 0.830}\n        step_1000: {cosine: 0.93, probe_AUROC: 0.822}\n        step_2000: {cosine: 0.89, probe_AUROC: 0.810}\n        step_3000: {cosine: 0.86, probe_AUROC: 0.800}\n        step_4000: {cosine: 0.84, probe_AUROC: 0.790}\n        step_5000: {cosine: 0.83, probe_AUROC: 0.785}\n        step_6000: {cosine: 0.82, probe_AUROC: 0.780}\n      auroc_total_drift: -0.055\n      cosine_total_drift: -0.18\n      recalibration_triggered: 0\n      recalibration_threshold: 0.70\n    result_rationale: >\n      方向漂移模式与 D025 已知数据一致：cosine 从 1.0 单调降至 0.82，前 2000 步最快 (Δ=-0.11)\n      因为 LoRA 参数变化最剧烈，4000 步后减速趋稳 (Δ=-0.02/1000步)。\n      Probe AUROC 从 0.835 降至 0.780 (Δ=-0.055)，落在 median 档 [0.76, 0.80] 内。\n      AUROC 降幅 (6pp) 远小于 cosine 降幅 (18pp)，说明方向旋转中大量是 \"无害旋转\"——\n      正交于判别超平面的分量。Probe decision boundary 比 raw direction 更稳定。\n      未触发 0.70 重校准阈值，但 AUROC 退化是真实的——解释了 exp-008v3 后期 R1 reward\n      均值下降 (0.73→0.64) 和 SYCONScore 轻微回落。\n      在 median 档下，退化可控但非 trivial，需要在论文中如实报告。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Direction Stability (exp-008v3 training)\"\n        columns: [step, cosine_w_init, probe_AUROC, recalibrated]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 1.00, 0.835, \"—\"]\n          - [500, 0.96, 0.830, \"No\"]\n          - [1000, 0.93, 0.822, \"No\"]\n          - [2000, 0.89, 0.810, \"No\"]\n          - [3000, 0.86, 0.800, \"No\"]\n          - [4000, 0.84, 0.790, \"No\"]\n          - [5000, 0.83, 0.785, \"No\"]\n          - [6000, 0.82, 0.780, \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 y 轴图：左轴 cosine similarity (蓝线, 1.0→0.82)，右轴 probe AUROC (红线, 0.835→0.780)。AUROC 曲线更平缓，说明 probe 比 raw direction 鲁棒。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 1 的 stability 部分成立 (cosine≥0.82, AUROC≥0.78)。\n      论文需报告：(1) 方向缓慢旋转，AUROC 退化 ~6pp；\n      (2) 重校准是安全机制 (即使本次未触发)；\n      (3) probe decision boundary 比方向本身更稳——binarization 的额外好处。\n      这增加了方法复杂度但提供了 analysis point。\n\n  - name: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      分析 exp-008v3 训练过程中 probe R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式。\n      R1=syc & R3=correct (masked sycophancy 候选) 需 > 5% 以支撑 Claim 3。\n    expected_results:\n      total_samples_analyzed: 3600\n      agreement_rate: 0.955\n      total_disagreement_rate: 0.045\n      r1_syc_r3_correct:\n        count: 97\n        rate: 0.027\n      r1_correct_r3_syc:\n        count: 65\n        rate: 0.018\n      by_evidence_strength:\n        weak: 0.058\n        medium: 0.042\n        strong: 0.031\n      by_turn_depth:\n        turn_2: 0.035\n        turn_3: 0.048\n        turn_4plus: 0.062\n    result_rationale: >\n      4.5% 总体 disagreement 落在 median 档 [3%, 6%] 内但低于 5% 门槛。\n      \"R1=syc, R3=correct\" (masked sycophancy 候选) 仅 2.7%——比例太低，\n      无法支撑 \"probe R1 发现 R3 遗漏的隐藏迎合\" 的强 claim。\n      两个结构化 pattern 有分析价值：\n      (a) 与 evidence strength 负相关 (weak 5.8% > strong 3.1%)——弱证据下 NLI 置信度低，\n      R3 判断模糊，而 probe R1 基于固定 decision boundary 不受影响；\n      (b) 与 turn depth 正相关 (turn 2 3.5% → turn 4+ 6.2%)——深层对话中\n      NLI 评分器面对长上下文准确率下降，probe 基于即时 activation 不受影响。\n      但两个 pattern 的量级有限，不足以作为正式贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown\"\n        columns: [category, count, rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Total samples, 3600, \"—\"]\n          - [Full agreement, 3438, 0.955]\n          - [\"R1=syc & R3=correct\", 97, 0.027]\n          - [\"R1=correct & R3=syc\", 65, 0.018]\n          - [Total disagreement, 162, 0.045]\n      - name: \"Table: Disagreement by Turn Depth\"\n        columns: [turn_depth, n_samples, disagreement_rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Turn 2, 1440, 0.035]\n          - [Turn 3, 1200, 0.048]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", 960, 0.062]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Disagreement rate vs turn depth 柱状图：单调递增，turn 2 vs turn 4+ 的 bootstrap CI 不重叠。\"\n      - \"Disagreement rate vs evidence strength 柱状图：单调递减，weak vs strong CI 不重叠。\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.5% 不满足 Claim 3 的 5% 门槛。\n      Claim 3 从 analysis subsection 降为 Appendix C 讨论。\n      主论文一句话：\"R1-R3 disagreement is 4.5%, below the 5% threshold\n      for claiming diagnostic utility; structured patterns by turn depth\n      and evidence strength are reported in Appendix C.\"\n\n  - name: ablation_r1_only\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      Probe R1-only ablation：仅用 binary probe reward, 无 R3 behavioral safety net。\n      从 exp-008v3 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉, 短程训练 ~2000 步。\n    expected_results:\n      best_step: 3200\n      eval_at_best:\n        ToF: 0.208\n        NoF: 0.762\n        SYCONScore: 0.327\n      eval_at_final:\n        ToF: 0.201\n        NoF: 0.748\n        SYCONScore: 0.316\n      training_entropy_final: 1.54\n      mean_response_length_final: 198\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe R1-only SYCONScore 0.327 高于 Vanilla (0.197, Δ=+0.130)，\n      证明 probe R1 包含独立训练信号。但低于 R1+R3 组合 (0.367, Δ=-0.040)。\n      缺少 R3 安全网后 NoF 下降显著 (0.762 vs 0.783, -2.1pp)——probe 误分类无 R3 兜底。\n      ToF 也更低 (0.208 vs 0.241, -3.3pp)——反直觉但合理：R3 的 NLI reward 在\n      valid evidence 场景中提供 \"这次修正是对的\" 的确认信号，缺失后模型对所有修正更 hedging。\n      Entropy 偏低 (1.54 vs 1.82)：probe R1 alone 的 reward landscape 更尖锐，GRPO 探索受限。\n      R1-only (0.327) 与 R3-only (0.317) SYCONScore 接近——\n      两种信号源 (representation vs behavior) 独立贡献大致相当，但组合有超线性收益。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: R1-only Ablation\"\n        columns: [Method, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore, entropy]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.111, 0.923, 0.197, 2.85]\n          - [R3-only, 0.197, 0.819, 0.317, 2.12]\n          - [Probe R1-only, 0.208, 0.762, 0.327, 1.54]\n          - [Probe R1+R3, 0.241, 0.783, 0.367, 1.82]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Ablation cascade 柱状图 (SYCONScore)：R3-only 和 R1-only 几乎等高 (0.317 vs 0.327)，R1+R3 明显更高 (0.367)。视觉强调组合的超线性收益。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R1-only ablation 在论文中支撑两个论点：\n      (1) Probe R1 有独立训练信号 (vs Vanilla +13pp)；\n      (2) R1 和 R3 互补——R1+R3 (0.367) > max(R1-only 0.327, R3-only 0.317)。\n      R1-only ≈ R3-only 强化 median 档叙事：两种信号独立贡献相当，组合收益有限但一致。\n\n  - name: turn_depth_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 probe R1+R3 vs baselines。\n      验证 probe R1 在深层 commitment 中是否优势放大。\n    expected_results:\n      by_method_and_depth:\n        Vanilla: {turn_2: 0.228, turn_3: 0.189, turn_4plus: 0.152}\n        ACT: {turn_2: 0.328, turn_3: 0.295, turn_4plus: 0.264}\n        R3_only: {turn_2: 0.355, turn_3: 0.311, turn_4plus: 0.268}\n        Probe_R1_R3: {turn_2: 0.401, turn_3: 0.359, turn_4plus: 0.312}\n      probe_advantage_vs_r3only:\n        turn_2_pp: 4.6\n        turn_3_pp: 4.8\n        turn_4plus_pp: 4.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有方法 SYCONScore 随 turn depth 下降 (commitment 越深越难正确应对)。\n      Probe R1+R3 的优势在各深度大致恒定 (~4.4-4.8pp)，未如 best 档预期在深层 turns 放大。\n      原因：d_syc 在 fixed-length 校准数据上计算，turn 4+ 长上下文中 activation pattern 偏移，\n      probe accuracy 同样下降——probe 的优势是 turn-depth-invariant 而非 amplified。\n      R3-only 在 turn 4+ 退化 (-0.087 from turn 2) 和 probe (-0.089) 降幅几乎相同。\n      \"Multi-turn 是 probe 甜蜜点\" 的叙事在 median 档下不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SYCONScore by Turn Depth\"\n        columns: [Method, Turn_2, Turn_3, \"Turn_4+\", \"Δ(turn2→4+)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Vanilla, 0.228, 0.189, 0.152, -0.076]\n          - [ACT, 0.328, 0.295, 0.264, -0.064]\n          - [R3-only, 0.355, 0.311, 0.268, -0.087]\n          - [Probe R1+R3, 0.401, 0.359, 0.312, -0.089]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"折线图 SYCONScore vs turn depth (4 methods)：所有线下降，线间距大致恒定——没有在深层 turns 拉开差距。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Turn-depth 分析不支持 \"multi-turn advantage amplification\" 叙事。\n      但提供另一个 finding：probe R1 优势是 turn-depth-invariant，\n      说明 representation-level signal 不因 context length 退化——\n      而 behavioral signal (R3) 的 NLI 模型可能随 context 长度退化。\n      在 Section 6 作为补充分析，支撑 \"representation signal is robust to context length\" 的温和 claim。\n\n  - name: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      D029 pivot 后 R2 已 disabled。此实验变为冗余 (等价于 exp-009 probe R1-only)。\n    expected_results:\n      status: REDUNDANT_POST_D029\n      recommendation: >\n        合并入 exp-015 reward weight sensitivity 中 w1=0.8/w3=0.2 极端配置。\n    result_rationale: >\n      D029 pivot 禁用 R2 (rank-based contrastive reward)。\n      原始设计 (R1+R2 without R3) 退化为 R1-only (与 exp-009 相同)，\n      单独运行无新增信息量。功能合并入 exp-015 极端权重配置。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      标记为 SKIP。如 reviewer 问 R2，回答：\n      \"R2 在 binary probe 框架下冗余——probe 已将 d_syc 方向信息 binarize，\n      rank-based contrastive 无法提供超越 probe decision boundary 的额外信息。\"\n\n  - name: cross_model_transfer\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Phase A: Llama-3-8B 上计算 d_syc + 训练 probe, 报告 AUROC。\n      Phase B (if AUROC > 0.75): 短程 binary probe R1+R3 GRPO (~3000 步)。\n    expected_results:\n      phase_a:\n        auroc: 0.78\n        auroc_ci_95: [0.74, 0.82]\n        best_layer: L17\n        probe_auroc: 0.79\n      phase_a_gate: PASS\n      phase_b:\n        best_checkpoint: step_2500\n        ToF: 0.212\n        NoF: 0.770\n        SYCONScore: 0.331\n      cross_model_direction:\n        cosine_qwen_llama: 0.28\n        transfer_auroc_qwen_on_llama: 0.61\n        transfer_auroc_llama_on_qwen: 0.63\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3-8B d_syc AUROC 0.78 通过 0.75 gate，但低于 Qwen3 的 0.826 (~4.6pp)——\n      模型族差异导致表征空间几何不同，但 \"mid-layer 存在 sycophancy 判别方向\" 跨模型普遍。\n      Peak layer L17 (Qwen3 在 L19)，差异反映架构细节 (Llama GQA, Qwen RoPE 实现不同)。\n      Phase B SYCONScore 0.331 (vs 估算 Llama Vanilla ~0.21, Δ=+0.12)，\n      框架跨模型可迁移但效果打折 (Qwen3 上 0.367)。\n      跨模型方向 cosine 仅 0.28——方向是 model-specific。\n      Transfer AUROC 0.61 高于 random 但远低于 native (0.79)——\n      不同模型编码 sycophancy 的\"方向不同但现象相同\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [metric, Qwen3-8B, Llama-3-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [d_syc AUROC, 0.826, 0.78]\n          - [Probe AUROC, 0.835, 0.79]\n          - [Best layer, L19, L17]\n          - [Probe R1+R3 SYCONScore, 0.367, 0.331]\n      - name: \"Table: Direction Transfer Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"source → target\", AUROC, cosine]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3 → Qwen3\", 0.835, 1.00]\n          - [\"Llama3 → Llama3\", 0.79, 1.00]\n          - [\"Qwen3 → Llama3\", 0.61, 0.28]\n          - [\"Llama3 → Qwen3\", 0.63, 0.28]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双模型 layer progression 曲线：两条 S 形曲线形状相似，Llama3 整体偏低 ~4pp，peak 偏早 2 层。\"\n      - \"Direction transfer heatmap (2×2)：对角线高 (0.84/0.79)，off-diagonal 低但 >0.50 (0.61/0.63)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      部分回应 \"single model\" critique。论文声称：\n      (1) sycophancy 方向判别跨模型普遍存在；\n      (2) binary probe R1+R3 框架跨模型有效；\n      (3) 方向不可直接迁移，需 per-model 校准。\n      Honest limitation 而非 weakness。Phase B SYCONScore 0.331 vs Llama Vanilla ~0.21 是强 evidence。\n\n  - name: neutral_baseline_three_way\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      D029 后 R2 disabled，优先级大幅降低。\n      仅作几何理解贡献：计算独立 d_gen, 分析与 d_syc 的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      d_syc_d_gen_cosine: -0.74\n      angular_separation_degrees: 42\n      d_gen_independent_auroc: 0.73\n      d_syc_auroc: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      d_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine=-0.74 (而非退化值 -1.0)，\n      存在 ~42° 偏差——sycophantic 和 genuine 方向不完全反对称。\n      d_gen AUROC 0.73 低于 d_syc 0.83：genuine revision 的表征信号更弱更分散，\n      模型对 \"被正确说服\" 的内部表征不如 \"迎合施压\" 清晰。\n      在 R2 disabled 框架下纯粹是 understanding 贡献：解释为什么 probe 只需 d_syc，\n      不需要独立 d_gen。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Three-way Direction Geometry\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cosine(d_syc, d_gen_indep)\", -0.74]\n          - [angular separation, \"42°\"]\n          - [d_syc AUROC, 0.83]\n          - [d_gen independent AUROC, 0.73]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2D PCA 投影：d_syc, -d_syc, d_gen_independent 三个方向。d_gen 与 -d_syc 接近但有 ~42° 偏转。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix 级 supplementary geometry analysis。\n      主论文一句话引用：\"d_syc and independently computed d_gen are near-anti-parallel\n      (cosine=-0.74), confirming the binary framing captures most directional structure.\"\n\n  - name: reward_weight_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      D029 后仅 w1 (probe R1) 和 w3 (R3) 两个权重 (w3=1-w1)。\n      5 组配置：w1 ∈ {0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.5, 0.8}。\n      从 exp-008v3 step 2000 分叉, 每组 ~2000 步短程训练。\n    expected_results:\n      configs:\n        w1_01: {ToF: 0.200, NoF: 0.815, SYCONScore: 0.321, entropy: 2.10}\n        w1_02: {ToF: 0.222, NoF: 0.798, SYCONScore: 0.347, entropy: 1.95}\n        w1_03: {ToF: 0.241, NoF: 0.783, SYCONScore: 0.367, entropy: 1.82}\n        w1_05: {ToF: 0.248, NoF: 0.752, SYCONScore: 0.373, entropy: 1.58}\n        w1_08: {ToF: 0.185, NoF: 0.648, SYCONScore: 0.288, entropy: 1.12}\n      robust_range: \"w1 ∈ [0.2, 0.5], SYCONScore ∈ [0.347, 0.373], range = 2.6pp\"\n      best_config: \"w1=0.5\"\n      default_config: \"w1=0.3\"\n      failure_mode: \"w1=0.8 → entropy collapse (1.12), NoF drops to 0.648, probe errors dominate\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      SYCONScore 在 w1=0.2-0.5 范围内稳健 (range 2.6pp)，证明非 cherry-pick。\n      w1=0.5 marginal best (0.373 vs default 0.367)——SYCONScore plateau 效应：\n      w1 从 0.3→0.5 时 ToF 继续上升 (+0.7pp) 但 NoF 加速下降 (-3.1pp)，harmonic mean 近似持平。\n      Default w1=0.3 不是绝对最优但处于 plateau 内，且 entropy (1.82) 比 w1=0.5 (1.58) 更健康。\n      w1=0.1 退化温和 (0.321)，接近 R3-only (0.317)——probe 信号被淹没。\n      w1=0.8 严重退化 (0.288 < R3-only)：entropy collapse (1.12)，probe 误分类被极度放大，\n      模型学会 \"游戏\" probe decision boundary 而非真正改善 sycophancy behavior。\n      NoF 0.648 甚至低于 Vanilla，说明极端 R1 权重适得其反。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Reward Weight Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [w1, w3, ToF, NoF, SYCONScore, entropy]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, 0.9, 0.200, 0.815, 0.321, 2.10]\n          - [0.2, 0.8, 0.222, 0.798, 0.347, 1.95]\n          - [\"**0.3**\", \"**0.7**\", \"**0.241**\", \"**0.783**\", \"**0.367**\", \"**1.82**\"]\n          - [0.5, 0.5, 0.248, 0.752, 0.373, 1.58]\n          - [0.8, 0.2, 0.185, 0.648, 0.288, 1.12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"SYCONScore vs w1 曲线：w1=0.1-0.5 上升后 plateau (peak at 0.5)，w1=0.8 急剧下降。inverted-J shape。\"\n      - \"Entropy vs w1 曲线：单调递减，w1=0.8 处 entropy 近 mode collapse 阈值。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix E 完整表格，主论文一句话：\n      \"Sensitivity analysis confirms robustness across w1 ∈ [0.2, 0.5]\n      (SYCONScore range 2.6pp); extreme w1=0.8 causes entropy collapse.\"\n      关键 reviewer 防御：结果非 cherry-pick，合理权重范围内均有效。\n```\n\n**验证约束一致性**:\n- exp_008v3 SYCONScore = 0.367 ∈ [0.31, 0.38] ✓\n- exp_003 SYCONScore = 0.317 ∈ [0.27, 0.35] ✓\n- Δ probe vs R3-only = 0.050 ∈ [0.01, 0.08] ✓\n- Δ probe vs ACT = 0.066 ∈ [0.005, 0.08] ✓\n- exp_008v3 ToF = 0.241 ∈ [0.2, 0.28] ✓\n- exp_008v3 NoF = 0.783 ∈ [0.72, 0.82] ✓\n- direction AUROC endtrain = 0.78 ∈ [0.76, 0.8] ✓\n- R1-R3 disagreement = 0.045 ∈ [0.03, 0.06] ✓\n\n**与前版 dream 的关键差异**: D029 pivot 根本改变了实验格局——cosine R1 (exp-002 系列) 从主方法变为负面证据，binary probe (exp-008v3) 成为 proof-of-concept，R2 被禁用使 exp-011/exp-013 优先级骤降。exp-014 的实际结果 (mode collapse) 与前版 dream 预测 (continuous probe ≈ DC-GRPO) 完全不同，进一步验证了 binarization 的必要性。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1166f424-4351-4e3b-9c15-33b8cbac02ad","total_cost_usd":1.6389964999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":4367,"cache_creation_input_tokens":55470,"cache_read_input_tokens":107858,"output_tokens":48154,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":55470,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4363,"output_tokens":47601,"cache_read_input_tokens":34296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3301